  (81, 'Arcane Thievery', 'Spell. For 5...35 seconds, one random spell is disabled for target foe, and Arcane Thievery is replaced by that spell.', 'Spell. (5...35 seconds.) Disables one random spell. This skill becomes that spell.', 'Arcane Thievery', 'Spell. For 5...35 seconds, one random spell is disabled for target foe, and Arcane Thievery is replaced by that spell.', 'Spell. (5...35 seconds.) Disables one random spell. This skill becomes that spell.'),
