  (83, 'Animate Bone Horror', 'Spell. Exploit nearest corpse to animate a level 1...17 bone horror.', 'Spell. Creates a level 1...17 bone horror. Exploits a fresh corpse.', 'Animate Bone Horror', 'Spell. Exploit nearest corpse to animate a level 1...17 bone horror.', 'Spell. Creates a level 1...17 bone horror. Exploits a fresh corpse.'),
  (84, 'Animate Bone Fiend', 'Spell. Exploit nearest corpse to animate a level 1...17 bone fiend. Bone fiends can attack at range.', 'Spell. Creates a level 1...17 bone fiend that can attack at range. Exploits a fresh corpse.', 'Animate Bone Fiend', 'Spell. Exploit nearest corpse to animate a level 1...17 bone fiend. Bone fiends can attack at range.', 'Spell. Creates a level 1...17 bone fiend that can attack at range. Exploits a fresh corpse.'),
