  (98, 'Consume Corpse', 'Spell. Exploit a random target. You teleport to that corpse''s location and gain 25...100 Health and 5...20 Energy.', 'Spell. Teleport to a corpse''s location. You gain 25...100 Health and 5...20 Energy. Exploits a fresh corpse.', 'Consume Corpse', 'Spell. Exploit a random target. You teleport to that corpse''s location and gain 25...100 Health and 5...20 Energy.', 'Spell. Teleport to a corpse''s location. You gain 25...100 Health and 5...20 Energy. Exploits a fresh corpse.'),
