  (217, 'Crystal Wave', 'Spell. Foes adjacent to you are struck for 10...70 damage but are cured of any negative conditions. Each condition removed deals 5...15 damage.', 'Spell. Deals 10...70 damage to all foes adjacent to you. Those foes lose all conditions and take 5...15 damage for each condition removed.', 'Crystal Wave', 'Spell. Foes adjacent to you are struck for 10...70 damage but are cured of any negative conditions. Each condition removed deals 5...15 damage.', 'Spell. Deals 10...70 damage to all foes adjacent to you. Those foes lose all conditions and take 5...15 damage for each condition removed.'),
