  (225, 'Air Attunement', 'Enchantment Spell. For 36...60 seconds, you are attuned to Air. You gain 1 Energy plus 30% of the base Energy cost of the skill whenever you use Air Magic.', 'Enchantment Spell. (36...60 seconds.) You gain 1 Energy plus 30% of the Energy cost when you use an Air Magic skill.', 'Air Attunement', 'Enchantment Spell. For 36...60 seconds, you are attuned to Air. You gain 1 Energy plus 30% of the base Energy cost of the skill whenever you use Air Magic.', 'Enchantment Spell. (36...60 seconds.) You gain 1 Energy plus 30% of the Energy cost when you use an Air Magic skill.'),
  (226, 'Mind Shock', 'Elite Spell. Target foe suffers 10...50 lightning damage. If you have more Energy than target foe, that foe suffers 10...50 more lightning damage and is knocked down. This spell has 25% armor penetration.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 10...50 lightning damage. If you have more Energy than target foe, deals +10...50 lightning damage and causes knockdown. 25% armor penetration.', 'Mind Shock (PvP)', 'Elite Spell. Target foe suffers 10...50 lightning damage. If you have more Energy than target foe, that foe suffers 10...50 more lightning damage and is knocked down. This spell has 25% armor penetration.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 10...50 lightning damage. If you have more Energy than target foe, deals +10...50 lightning damage and causes knockdown. 25% armor penetration.'),
  (227, 'Glimmering Mark', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 10 seconds, target foe and all foes adjacent to your target take 5...25 damage each second. Foes using attack skills are Blinded for 3 seconds. This hex ends if you use a skill that targets this foe.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (10 seconds.) Deals 5...25 damage each second to target and adjacent foes. Inflicts Blindness on foes using attack skills. Ends if you use a skill that targets this foe.', 'Glimmering Mark', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 10 seconds, target foe and all foes adjacent to your target take 5...25 damage each second. Foes using attack skills are Blinded for 3 seconds. This hex ends if you use a skill that targets this foe.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (10 seconds.) Deals 5...25 damage each second to target and adjacent foes. Inflicts Blindness on foes using attack skills. Ends if you use a skill that targets this foe.'),
  (228, 'Thunderclap', 'Elite Spell. Create a massive shockwave at target foe''s location. Deals 10...50 lightning damage to target and all nearby foes. Struck foes are interrupted and suffer from Cracked Armor and Weakness for 5...20 seconds. This spell has 25% armor penetration.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 10...50 lightning damage. Also strikes nearby foes. Inflicts Cracked Armor and Weakness (5...20 seconds). Causes interrupt. 25% armor penetration.', 'Thunderclap', 'Elite Spell. Create a massive shockwave at target foe''s location. Deals 10...50 lightning damage to target and all nearby foes. Struck foes are interrupted and suffer from Cracked Armor and Weakness for 5...20 seconds. This spell has 25% armor penetration.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 10...50 lightning damage. Also strikes nearby foes. Inflicts Cracked Armor and Weakness (5...20 seconds). Causes interrupt. 25% armor penetration.'),
  (229, 'Lightning Orb', 'Spell. Send out a Lightning Orb that strikes target foe for 10...100 lightning damage. This spell has 25% armor penetration.', 'Spell. Projectile: deals 10...100 lightning damage. 25% armor penetration.', 'Lightning Orb', 'Spell. Send out a Lightning Orb that strikes target foe for 10...100 lightning damage. This spell has 25% armor penetration.', 'Spell. Projectile: deals 10...100 lightning damage. 25% armor penetration.'),
  (230, 'Lightning Javelin', 'Spell. Send out a Lightning Javelin that strikes for 15...50 lightning damage if it hits. Lightning Javelin interrupts attacking foes. This spell has 25% armor penetration and strikes all foes between you and your target.', 'Spell. Projectile: deals 15...50 lightning damage. Interrupts if your target is attacking. 25% armor penetration. Strikes all foes between you and your target.', 'Lightning Javelin', 'Spell. Send out a Lightning Javelin that strikes for 15...50 lightning damage if it hits. Lightning Javelin interrupts attacking foes. This spell has 25% armor penetration and strikes all foes between you and your target.', 'Spell. Projectile: deals 15...50 lightning damage. Interrupts if your target is attacking. 25% armor penetration. Strikes all foes between you and your target.'),
  (231, 'Shock', 'Skill. Target touched foe is knocked down and struck for 10...60 lightning damage. This skill has 25% armor penetration.', 'Touch Skill. Deals 10...60 lightning damage. Causes knock-down. 25% armor penetration.', 'Shock', 'Skill. Target touched foe is knocked down and struck for 10...60 lightning damage. This skill has 25% armor penetration.', 'Touch Skill. Deals 10...60 lightning damage. Causes knock-down. 25% armor penetration.'),
  (232, 'Lightning Touch', 'Skill. Target touched foe and all adjacent foes are struck for 10...60 lightning damage, are Blinded for 1...4 seconds, and have Cracked Armor for 1...10 seconds. This skill has 25% armor penetration.', 'Touch Skill. Deals 10...60 lightning damage. Also hits foes adjacent to target foe. Inflicts Blind (1...4 seconds) and Cracked Armor (1...10 seconds) on all struck foes. 25% armor penetration.', 'Lightning Touch', 'Skill. Target touched foe and all adjacent foes are struck for 10...60 lightning damage, are Blinded for 1...4 seconds, and have Cracked Armor for 1...10 seconds. This skill has 25% armor penetration.', 'Touch Skill. Deals 10...60 lightning damage. Also hits foes adjacent to target foe. Inflicts Blind (1...4 seconds) and Cracked Armor (1...10 seconds) on all struck foes. 25% armor penetration.'),
  (233, 'Swirling Aura', 'Enchantment Spell. For 3...7 seconds, you are enchanted with Swirling Aura and have 1...6 Health regeneration and a 50% chance to block projectiles. If you are Overcast when you cast this spell, all party members in earshot are also enchanted.', 'Enchantment Spell. (3...7 seconds.) Gives 1...6 Health regeneration and a 50% chance to block projectiles. If Overcast, also enchants party members in earshot.', 'Swirling Aura', 'Enchantment Spell. For 3...7 seconds, you are enchanted with Swirling Aura and have 1...6 Health regeneration and a 50% chance to block projectiles. If you are Overcast when you cast this spell, all party members in earshot are also enchanted.', 'Enchantment Spell. (3...7 seconds.) Gives 1...6 Health regeneration and a 50% chance to block projectiles. If Overcast, also enchants party members in earshot.'),
  (234, 'Deep Freeze', 'Hex Spell. You cause a Deep Freeze at target foe''s location. All foes in this area are struck for 10...85 cold damage, and for 10 seconds, they move 66% slower.', 'Hex Spell. Also hexes foes in the area of your target (10 seconds). These foes move 66% slower. Initial effect: deals 10...85 cold damage.', 'Deep Freeze', 'Hex Spell. You cause a Deep Freeze at target foe''s location. All foes in this area are struck for 10...85 cold damage, and for 10 seconds, they move 66% slower.', 'Hex Spell. Also hexes foes in the area of your target (10 seconds). These foes move 66% slower. Initial effect: deals 10...85 cold damage.'),
  (235, 'Blurred Vision', 'Hex Spell. For 4...10 seconds, target foe and adjacent foes are hexed with Blurred Vision. While hexed, those foes have a 50% chance to miss with attacks.', 'Hex Spell. Also hexes foes adjacent to target (4...10 seconds). They have 50% chance to miss.', 'Blurred Vision', 'Hex Spell. For 4...10 seconds, target foe and adjacent foes are hexed with Blurred Vision. While hexed, those foes have a 50% chance to miss with attacks.', 'Hex Spell. Also hexes foes adjacent to target (4...10 seconds). They have 50% chance to miss.'),
  (236, 'Mist Form', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 10...45 seconds, you take 33% less damage from foes under the effect of Water Magic hexes. Whenever you cast an elemental spell, all non-spirit allies in earshot are healed for 50...250% of the Energy cost of the spell.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (10...45 seconds.) Take 33% less damage from foes hexed with Water Magic. Heals non-spirit allies in earshot for 50...250% of the Energy cost of your elemental spells.', 'Mist Form (PvP)', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 10...45 seconds, you take 33% less damage from foes under the effect of Water Magic hexes. Whenever you cast an elemental spell, all non-spirit allies in earshot are healed for 50...250% of the Energy cost of the spell. This spell does not heal allies above 80% Health.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (10...45 seconds.) Take 33% less damage from foes hexed with Water Magic. Heals non-spirit allies in earshot for 50...250% of the Energy cost of your elemental spells. Does not heal allies above 80% Health.'),
