  (266, 'Peace and Harmony', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Target ally loses 0...9 conditions and hexes. For 1...3 seconds, conditions and hexes expire 90% faster on that ally. All of your Smiting Prayers are disabled for 20 seconds.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Target ally loses 0...9 conditions and hexes. Conditions and hexes expire 90% faster on that ally (1...3 seconds). Disables your Smiting Prayers (20 seconds).', 'Peace and Harmony (PvP)', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Target ally loses 0...4 conditions and hexes. For 1...3 seconds, conditions and hexes expire 90% faster on that ally. All of your Smiting Prayers are disabled for 20 seconds.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Target ally loses 0...4 conditions and hexes. Conditions and hexes expire 90% faster on that ally (1...3 seconds). Disables your Smiting Prayers (20 seconds).'),
