  (380, 'Bonetti''s Defense', 'Stance. For 5...11 seconds, you have a 75% chance to block melee and projectile attacks. You gain 5 Energy for each successful melee attack blocked. Bonetti''s Defense ends if you use a skill.', 'Stance. (5...11 seconds.) You have 75% chance to block. Gain 5 Energy for each melee attack blocked. Ends if you use a skill.', 'Bonetti''s Defense', 'Stance. For 5...11 seconds, you have a 75% chance to block melee and projectile attacks. You gain 5 Energy for each successful melee attack blocked. Bonetti''s Defense ends if you use a skill.', 'Stance. (5...11 seconds.) You have 75% chance to block. Gain 5 Energy for each melee attack blocked. Ends if you use a skill.'),
