  (385, 'Final Thrust', 'Sword Attack. Lose all adrenaline. If Final Thrust hits, you deal 5...40 more damage. This damage is doubled if your target was below 50% Health.', 'Sword Attack. Deals +5...40 damage. Deals +5...40 more damage if target foe is below 50% Health. Lose all adrenaline.', 'Final Thrust', 'Sword Attack. Lose all adrenaline. If Final Thrust hits, you deal 5...40 more damage. This damage is doubled if your target was below 50% Health.', 'Sword Attack. Deals +5...40 damage. Deals +5...40 more damage if target foe is below 50% Health. Lose all adrenaline.'),
