  (447, 'Otyugh''s Cry', 'Shout. For 10...25 seconds, your animal companion gains +24 armor and cannot be blocked.', 'Shout. (10...25 seconds.) Your pet has +24 armor and is unblockable.', 'Otyugh''s Cry (PvP)', 'Shout. For 5...15 seconds, your animal companion gains +24 armor and cannot be blocked.', 'Shout. (5...15 seconds.) Your pet has +24 armor and is unblockable.'),
  (448, 'Escape', 'Elite Stance. For 1...8 seconds, you move 33% faster and have a 75% chance to block attacks.', 'Elite Stance. (1...8 seconds.) You move 33% faster and have 75% chance to block.', 'Escape (PvP)', 'Elite Stance. For 1...8 seconds, you move 33% faster and have a 75% chance to block attacks. Escape ends if you make a melee attack.', 'Elite Stance. (1...8 seconds.) You move 33% faster and have 75% chance to block. Ends if you make a melee attack.'),
  (449, 'Practiced Stance', 'Elite Stance. For 20...35 seconds, your preparations recharge 50% faster and last 30...300% longer.', 'Elite Stance. (20...35 seconds.) Your preparations recharge 50% faster and last 30...300% longer.', 'Practiced Stance', 'Elite Stance. For 20...35 seconds, your preparations recharge 50% faster and last 30...300% longer.', 'Elite Stance. (20...35 seconds.) Your preparations recharge 50% faster and last 30...300% longer.'),
  (450, 'Whirling Defense', 'Stance. For 8...20 seconds, you have 75% chance to block attacks. Whenever you block a projectile in this way, adjacent foes take 5...11 damage.', 'Stance. (8...20 seconds.) You have 75% chance to block. Deals 5...11 damage to adjacent foes whenever you block a projectile attack.', 'Whirling Defense', 'Stance. For 8...20 seconds, you have 75% chance to block attacks. Whenever you block a projectile in this way, adjacent foes take 5...11 damage.', 'Stance. (8...20 seconds.) You have 75% chance to block. Deals 5...11 damage to adjacent foes whenever you block a projectile attack.'),
  (451, 'Melandru''s Resilience', 'Elite Stance. For 8...20 seconds, you gain +4 Health regeneration and +1 Energy regeneration for each condition and hex you are suffering.', 'Elite Stance. (8...20 seconds.) You have +4 Health regeneration and +1 Energy regeneration for each condition and hex on you.', 'Melandru''s Resilience', 'Elite Stance. For 8...20 seconds, you gain +4 Health regeneration and +1 Energy regeneration for each condition and hex you are suffering.', 'Elite Stance. (8...20 seconds.) You have +4 Health regeneration and +1 Energy regeneration for each condition and hex on you.'),
  (452, 'Dryder''s Defenses', 'Stance. For 5...11 seconds, you gain 75% chance to block attacks and 34...60 armor against elemental damage.', 'Stance. (5...11 seconds.) You have 75% chance to block and +34...60 armor against elemental damage.', 'Dryder''s Defenses', 'Stance. For 5...11 seconds, you gain 75% chance to block attacks and 34...60 armor against elemental damage.', 'Stance. (5...11 seconds.) You have 75% chance to block and +34...60 armor against elemental damage.'),
  (453, 'Lightning Reflexes', 'Stance. For 5...11 seconds, you have a 75% chance to block melee and projectile attacks, and you attack 33% faster.', 'Stance. (5...11 seconds.) You attack 33% faster and have 75% chance to block.', 'Lightning Reflexes (PvP)', 'Stance. For 5...11 seconds, you have a 75% chance to block melee and projectile attacks, and you attack 33% faster.', 'Stance. (5...11 seconds.) You attack 33% faster and have 75% chance to block.'),
  (454, 'Tiger''s Fury', 'Stance. All your non-attack skills are disabled for 5 seconds. For 5...11 seconds, you attack 25% faster.', 'Stance. (5...11 seconds.) You attack 25% faster. Disables your non-attack skills (5 seconds).', 'Tiger''s Fury', 'Stance. All your non-attack skills are disabled for 5 seconds. For 5...11 seconds, you attack 25% faster.', 'Stance. (5...11 seconds.) You attack 25% faster. Disables your non-attack skills (5 seconds).'),
  (455, 'Storm Chaser', 'Stance. For 8...20 seconds, you move 25% faster, and you gain 1...5 Energy whenever you take elemental damage.', 'Stance. (8...20 seconds.) You move 25% faster and gain 1...5 Energy whenever you take elemental damage.', 'Storm Chaser', 'Stance. For 8...20 seconds, you move 25% faster, and you gain 1...5 Energy whenever you take elemental damage.', 'Stance. (8...20 seconds.) You move 25% faster and gain 1...5 Energy whenever you take elemental damage.'),
  (456, 'Serpent''s Quickness', 'Stance. For 15...30 seconds, recharge times for your skills are reduced by 33%. Serpent''s Quickness ends if your Health drops below 50%.', 'Stance. (15...30 seconds.) Your skills recharge 33% faster. Ends if your Health drops below 50%.', 'Serpent''s Quickness', 'Stance. For 15...30 seconds, recharge times for your skills are reduced by 33%. Serpent''s Quickness ends if your Health drops below 50%.', 'Stance. (15...30 seconds.) Your skills recharge 33% faster. Ends if your Health drops below 50%.'),
  (457, 'Dust Trap', 'Trap. When Dust Trap is triggered, every second (for 5 seconds total), all nearby foes are Blinded for 3...8 seconds and take 10...25 damage. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted. Dust Trap ends after 90 seconds.', 'Trap. (90 seconds.) Affects nearby foes. Deals 10...25 damage every second (5 seconds). Inflicts Blindness condition (3...8 seconds) every second (5 seconds). Easily interrupted.', 'Dust Trap', 'Trap. When Dust Trap is triggered, every second (for 5 seconds total), all nearby foes are Blinded for 3...8 seconds and take 10...25 damage. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted. Dust Trap ends after 90 seconds.', 'Trap. (90 seconds.) Affects nearby foes. Deals 10...25 damage every second (5 seconds). Inflicts Blindness condition (3...8 seconds) every second (5 seconds). Easily interrupted.'),
  (458, 'Barbed Trap', 'Trap. When Barbed Trap is triggered, all nearby foes are struck for 7...23 piercing damage, become Crippled, and begin Bleeding for 3...25 seconds. Barbed Trap ends after 90 seconds. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted.', 'Trap. (90 seconds.) Affects nearby foes. Deals 7...23 piercing damage. Inflicts Crippled and Bleeding conditions (3...25 seconds). Easily interrupted.', 'Barbed Trap', 'Trap. When Barbed Trap is triggered, all nearby foes are struck for 7...23 piercing damage, become Crippled, and begin Bleeding for 3...25 seconds. Barbed Trap ends after 90 seconds. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted.', 'Trap. (90 seconds.) Affects nearby foes. Deals 7...23 piercing damage. Inflicts Crippled and Bleeding conditions (3...25 seconds). Easily interrupted.'),
  (459, 'Flame Trap', 'Trap. When Flame Trap is triggered, every second (for 3 seconds total), all nearby foes are struck for 5...20 fire damage and set on fire for 1...3 seconds. Flame Trap ends after 90 seconds. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted.', 'Trap. (90 seconds.) Affects nearby foes. Deals 5...20 fire damage every second (3 seconds). Inflicts Burning condition (1...3 seconds). Easily interrupted.', 'Flame Trap', 'Trap. When Flame Trap is triggered, every second (for 3 seconds total), all nearby foes are struck for 5...20 fire damage and set on fire for 1...3 seconds. Flame Trap ends after 90 seconds. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted.', 'Trap. (90 seconds.) Affects nearby foes. Deals 5...20 fire damage every second (3 seconds). Inflicts Burning condition (1...3 seconds). Easily interrupted.'),
  (460, 'Healing Spring', 'Trap. For 10 seconds, all adjacent allies are healed for 15...60 every 2 seconds. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted.', 'Trap. (10 seconds.) Affects adjacent allies. Heals for 15...60 every 2 seconds. Easily interrupted.', 'Healing Spring', 'Trap. For 10 seconds, all adjacent allies are healed for 15...60 every 2 seconds. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted.', 'Trap. (10 seconds.) Affects adjacent allies. Heals for 15...60 every 2 seconds. Easily interrupted.'),
  (461, 'Spike Trap', 'Elite Trap. When Spike Trap is triggered, every second (for 2 seconds total), all nearby foes are struck for 10...40 piercing damage, become Crippled for 3...25 seconds, and are knocked down. Spike Trap ends after 90 seconds. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted.', 'Elite Trap. (90 seconds.) Affects nearby foes. Every second (for 2 seconds), this trap deals 10...40 piercing damage, causes knock-down, and inflicts Crippled condition (3...25 seconds). Easily interrupted.', 'Spike Trap', 'Elite Trap. When Spike Trap is triggered, every second (for 2 seconds total), all nearby foes are struck for 10...40 piercing damage, become Crippled for 3...25 seconds, and are knocked down. Spike Trap ends after 90 seconds. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted.', 'Elite Trap. (90 seconds.) Affects nearby foes. Every second (for 2 seconds), this trap deals 10...40 piercing damage, causes knock-down, and inflicts Crippled condition (3...25 seconds). Easily interrupted.'),
  (462, 'Winter', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For creatures within its range, all elemental damage is cold damage instead. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Converts elemental damage to cold damage for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.', 'Winter', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For creatures within its range, all elemental damage is cold damage instead. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Converts elemental damage to cold damage for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.'),
  (463, 'Winnowing', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. Non-spirit creatures within range take 4 additional damage whenever they take physical damage. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Increase physical damage by +4 for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.', 'Winnowing', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. Non-spirit creatures within range take 4 additional damage whenever they take physical damage. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Increase physical damage by +4 for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.'),
  (464, 'Edge of Extinction', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. If a non-spirit creature within range dies, Edge of Extinction deals 14...50 damage to all creatures of the same type that are below 90% Health and within range of the spirit. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Deals 14...50 damage to creatures in its range whenever a creature of the same type dies. Does not affect spirits. No damage to creatures above 90% Health.', 'Edge of Extinction', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. If a non-spirit creature within range dies, Edge of Extinction deals 14...50 damage to all creatures of the same type that are below 90% Health and within range of the spirit. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Deals 14...50 damage to creatures in its range whenever a creature of the same type dies. Does not affect spirits. No damage to creatures above 90% Health.'),
  (465, 'Greater Conflagration', 'Elite Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, all physical damage is fire damage instead. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Elite Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Converts physical damage to fire damage for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.', 'Greater Conflagration', 'Elite Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, all physical damage is fire damage instead. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Elite Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Converts physical damage to fire damage for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.'),
  (466, 'Conflagration', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, all arrows that hit strike for fire damage. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). All arrows deal fire damage for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.', 'Conflagration', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, all arrows that hit strike for fire damage. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). All arrows deal fire damage for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.'),
  (467, 'Fertile Season', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. Non-spirit creatures within range have +50...150 maximum Health and gain +8 armor. This spirit dies after 15...90 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (15...90 second lifespan). Creatures in range have +50...150 maximum Health and +8 armor. Does not affect spirits.', 'Fertile Season', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. Non-spirit creatures within range have +50...150 maximum Health and gain +8 armor. This spirit dies after 15...90 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (15...90 second lifespan). Creatures in range have +50...150 maximum Health and +8 armor. Does not affect spirits.'),
