  (469, 'Primal Echoes', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, signets cost 10 Energy to use. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Signets cost 10 Energy for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.', 'Primal Echoes', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, signets cost 10 Energy to use. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Signets cost 10 Energy for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.'),
  (470, 'Predatory Season', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, all healing is reduced by 20%. If any of your attacks hit, you gain 5 Health. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Creatures in range receive 20% less from healing. Creatures gain 5 Health each time they hit with an attack. Does not affect spirits.', 'Predatory Season', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, all healing is reduced by 20%. If any of your attacks hit, you gain 5 Health. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Creatures in range receive 20% less from healing. Creatures gain 5 Health each time they hit with an attack. Does not affect spirits.'),
  (471, 'Frozen Soil', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. Non-spirit creatures within its range cannot activate resurrection skills. This spirit dies after 30...180 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...180 second lifespan). Creatures in range cannot activate resurrection skills. Does not affect spirits.', 'Frozen Soil', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. Non-spirit creatures within its range cannot activate resurrection skills. This spirit dies after 30...180 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...180 second lifespan). Creatures in range cannot activate resurrection skills. Does not affect spirits.'),
  (472, 'Favorable Winds', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, arrows move twice as fast and strike for +6 damage. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Arrows move twice as fast and hit for +6 damage for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.', 'Favorable Winds', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, arrows move twice as fast and strike for +6 damage. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Arrows move twice as fast and hit for +6 damage for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.'),
  (474, 'Energizing Wind', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...6 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, all skills cost 15 less Energy (minimum cost 10 Energy), and skills recharge 25% slower. This spirit dies after 1...60 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...6 spirit (1...60 second lifespan). Skills cost 15 less Energy (minimum cost 10 Energy) and recharge 25% slower for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.', 'Energizing Wind', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...6 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, all skills cost 15 less Energy (minimum cost 10 Energy), and skills recharge 25% slower. This spirit dies after 1...60 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...6 spirit (1...60 second lifespan). Skills cost 15 less Energy (minimum cost 10 Energy) and recharge 25% slower for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.'),
  (475, 'Quickening Zephyr', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, all skills recharge twice as fast and cost 30% more of the base Energy to cast. This spirit dies after 15...90 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (15...90 second lifespan). Skills cost 30% more Energy and recharge twice as fast for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.', 'Quickening Zephyr', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, all skills recharge twice as fast and cost 30% more of the base Energy to cast. This spirit dies after 15...90 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (15...90 second lifespan). Skills cost 30% more Energy and recharge twice as fast for creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.'),
  (476, 'Nature''s Renewal', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For 30...240 seconds, enchantments and hexes cast by non-spirit creatures take twice as long to cast, and it costs twice as much Energy to maintain enchantments. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). For creatures in range, enchantments and Hexes take twice as long to cast and it costs twice as much Energy to maintain enchantments. Does not affect spirits.', 'Nature''s Renewal (PvP)', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. For 30...240 seconds, enchantments and hexes cast by non-spirit creatures take 50...75% longer to cast, and it costs twice as much Energy to maintain enchantments. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). For creatures in range, enchantments and Hexes take 50...75% longer to cast and it costs twice as much Energy to maintain enchantments. Does not affect spirits.'),
  (477, 'Muddy Terrain', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. Non-spirit creatures within its range move 10% slower and speed boosts have no effect. This spirit dies after 30...180 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...180 second lifespan). Creatures in range have 10% slower movement; also negates speed boosts. Does not affect spirits.', 'Muddy Terrain', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. Non-spirit creatures within its range move 10% slower and speed boosts have no effect. This spirit dies after 30...180 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...180 second lifespan). Creatures in range have 10% slower movement; also negates speed boosts. Does not affect spirits.'),
  (570, 'Mark of Insecurity', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 5...25 seconds, target foe suffers from -1...5 Health degeneration, and enchantments and stances on that foe expire 20...60% faster. All of your non-Assassin skills are disabled for 5 seconds.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (5...25 seconds.) Causes -1...5 Health degeneration. Enchantments and stances expire 20...60% faster on target foe. Disables your non-Assassin skills (5 seconds).', 'Mark of Insecurity', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 5...25 seconds, target foe suffers from -1...5 Health degeneration, and enchantments and stances on that foe expire 20...60% faster. All of your non-Assassin skills are disabled for 5 seconds.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (5...25 seconds.) Causes -1...5 Health degeneration. Enchantments and stances expire 20...60% faster on target foe. Disables your non-Assassin skills (5 seconds).'),
  (571, 'Disrupting Dagger', 'Spell. Send out a Disrupting Dagger at target foe that strikes for 10...35 earth damage. If that foe was activating a skill, that skill is interrupted. This spell has half the normal range.', 'Half Range Spell. Projectile: deals 10...35 earth damage. Interrupts a skill.', 'Disrupting Dagger', 'Spell. Send out a Disrupting Dagger at target foe that strikes for 10...35 earth damage. If that foe was activating a skill, that skill is interrupted. This spell has half the normal range.', 'Half Range Spell. Projectile: deals 10...35 earth damage. Interrupts a skill.'),
  (572, 'Deadly Paradox', 'Stance. All of your attack skills are disabled for 10 seconds. For 5...15 seconds, your Assassin skills activate and recharge 33% faster.', 'Stance. (5...15 seconds.) Your Assassin skills activate and recharge 33% faster. Disables your attack skills (10 seconds).', 'Deadly Paradox', 'Stance. All of your attack skills are disabled for 10 seconds. For 5...15 seconds, your Assassin skills activate and recharge 33% faster.', 'Stance. (5...15 seconds.) Your Assassin skills activate and recharge 33% faster. Disables your attack skills (10 seconds).'),
  (763, 'Jaundiced Gaze', 'Enchantment Spell. Remove an enchantment from target foe. If an enchantment is removed, for the next 1...20 seconds, your next enchantment spell casts 0...1 seconds faster and costs 1...10 less Energy.', 'Enchantment Spell. Removes an enchantment from target foe. Removal effect: your next enchantment casts 0...1 seconds faster and costs 1...10 less Energy. (1...20 seconds)', 'Jaundiced Gaze', 'Enchantment Spell. Remove an enchantment from target foe. If an enchantment is removed, for the next 1...20 seconds, your next enchantment spell casts 0...1 seconds faster and costs 1...10 less Energy.', 'Enchantment Spell. Removes an enchantment from target foe. Removal effect: your next enchantment casts 0...1 seconds faster and costs 1...10 less Energy. (1...20 seconds)'),
  (764, 'Wail of Doom', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 2...6 seconds, all of target foe''s attributes are set to 0.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (2...6 seconds.) Target foe''s attributes are 0.', 'Wail of Doom', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 2...6 seconds, all of target foe''s attributes are set to 0.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (2...6 seconds.) Target foe''s attributes are 0.'),
  (766, 'Gaze of Contempt', 'Spell. If target foe has more than 50% Health, that foe loses all enchantments.', 'Spell. Removes target foe''s enchantments. No effect unless this foe has more than 50% Health.', 'Gaze of Contempt', 'Spell. If target foe has more than 50% Health, that foe loses all enchantments.', 'Spell. Removes target foe''s enchantments. No effect unless this foe has more than 50% Health.'),
  (769, 'Viper''s Defense', 'Spell. All adjacent foes are Poisoned for 5...20 seconds. Shadow Step to a nearby location directly away from your target.', 'Spell. Inflict Poisoned condition (5...20 seconds) on all adjacent foes and Shadow Step to a nearby location directly away from your target.', 'Viper''s Defense', 'Spell. All adjacent foes are Poisoned for 5...20 seconds. Shadow Step to a nearby location directly away from your target.', 'Spell. Inflict Poisoned condition (5...20 seconds) on all adjacent foes and Shadow Step to a nearby location directly away from your target.'),
  (770, 'Return', 'Spell. All adjacent foes are Crippled for 3...8 seconds. Shadow Step to target other ally''s location.', 'Spell. Inflicts Crippled condition (3...8 seconds) on all foes adjacent to you. You Shadow Step to target ally''s location. Cannot self-target.', 'Return', 'Spell. All adjacent foes are Crippled for 3...8 seconds. Shadow Step to target other ally''s location.', 'Spell. Inflicts Crippled condition (3...8 seconds) on all foes adjacent to you. You Shadow Step to target ally''s location. Cannot self-target.'),
  (771, 'Aura of Displacement', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. When you cast Aura of Displacement, Shadow Step to target foe. When you stop maintaining Aura of Displacement you return to your original location.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Shadow Step to target foe. End effect: return to your original location.', 'Aura of Displacement', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. When you cast Aura of Displacement, Shadow Step to target foe. When you stop maintaining Aura of Displacement you return to your original location.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Shadow Step to target foe. End effect: return to your original location.'),
  (772, 'Generous Was Tsungrai', 'Item Spell. Hold Tsungrai''s ashes for up to 15...60 seconds and gain +50...140 maximum Health. When you drop his ashes, you gain 100...280 Health.', 'Item Spell. (15...60 seconds.) You have +50...140 maximum Health. Drop effect: you gain 100...280 Health.', 'Generous Was Tsungrai', 'Item Spell. Hold Tsungrai''s ashes for up to 15...60 seconds and gain +50...140 maximum Health. When you drop his ashes, you gain 100...280 Health.', 'Item Spell. (15...60 seconds.) You have +50...140 maximum Health. Drop effect: you gain 100...280 Health.'),
  (773, 'Mighty Was Vorizun', 'Item Spell. Hold Vorizun''s ashes for up to 15...60 seconds. While you hold his ashes, you gain +15 armor and +30 maximum Energy.', 'Item Spell. (15...60 seconds.) You have +15 armor and +30 maximum Energy.', 'Mighty Was Vorizun', 'Item Spell. Hold Vorizun''s ashes for up to 15...60 seconds. While you hold his ashes, you gain +15 armor and +30 maximum Energy.', 'Item Spell. (15...60 seconds.) You have +15 armor and +30 maximum Energy.'),
  (775, 'Death Blossom', 'Dual Attack. Must follow an off-hand attack. If it hits, Death Blossom strikes target foe for +20...45 damage and all adjacent foes take 20...45 damage.', 'Dual Attack. Deals +20...45 damage. Also affects foes adjacent to target foe. Must follow an off-hand attack.', 'Death Blossom (PvP)', 'Dual Attack. Must follow an off-hand attack. If it hits, Death Blossom strikes target foe for +20...45 damage and all adjacent foes take 20...45 damage.', 'Dual Attack. Deals +20...45 damage. Also affects foes adjacent to target foe. Must follow an off-hand attack.'),
  (776, 'Twisting Fangs', 'Dual Attack. Must follow an off-hand attack. If it hits, Twisting Fangs strikes for +10...20 damage and struck foe suffers from Bleeding and Deep Wound for 5...20 seconds.', 'Dual Attack. Deals +10...20 damage. Inflicts Bleeding and Deep Wound conditions (5...20 seconds). Must follow an off-hand attack.', 'Twisting Fangs', 'Dual Attack. Must follow an off-hand attack. If it hits, Twisting Fangs strikes for +10...20 damage and struck foe suffers from Bleeding and Deep Wound for 5...20 seconds.', 'Dual Attack. Deals +10...20 damage. Inflicts Bleeding and Deep Wound conditions (5...20 seconds). Must follow an off-hand attack.'),
  (777, 'Horns of the Ox', 'Dual Attack. Must follow an off-hand attack. If it hits, Horns of the Ox strikes for +1...11 damage. If struck foe is not adjacent to any allies, that foe is knocked down.', 'Dual Attack. Deals +1...11 damage. Causes knock-down if target foe is not adjacent to any of its allies. Must follow an off-hand attack.', 'Horns of the Ox', 'Dual Attack. Must follow an off-hand attack. If it hits, Horns of the Ox strikes for +1...11 damage. If struck foe is not adjacent to any allies, that foe is knocked down.', 'Dual Attack. Deals +1...11 damage. Causes knock-down if target foe is not adjacent to any of its allies. Must follow an off-hand attack.'),
  (778, 'Falling Spider', 'Off-Hand Attack. Must strike a knocked-down foe. If it hits, Falling Spider strikes for +15...35 damage and target foe is Poisoned for 5...20 seconds.', 'Off-Hand Attack. Deals +15...35 damage. Inflicts Poisoned condition (5...20 seconds). No effect unless target foe is knocked-down.', 'Falling Spider', 'Off-Hand Attack. Must strike a knocked-down foe. If it hits, Falling Spider strikes for +15...35 damage and target foe is Poisoned for 5...20 seconds.', 'Off-Hand Attack. Deals +15...35 damage. Inflicts Poisoned condition (5...20 seconds). No effect unless target foe is knocked-down.'),
  (779, 'Black Lotus Strike', 'Lead Attack. If it hits, Black Lotus Strike strikes for +10...31 damage. If target foe is suffering from a hex, you gain 5...13 Energy.', 'Lead Attack. Deals +10...31 damage. You gain 5...13 Energy if target foe is hexed.', 'Black Lotus Strike', 'Lead Attack. If it hits, Black Lotus Strike strikes for +10...31 damage. If target foe is suffering from a hex, you gain 5...13 Energy.', 'Lead Attack. Deals +10...31 damage. You gain 5...13 Energy if target foe is hexed.'),
  (780, 'Fox Fangs', 'Off-Hand Attack. Must follow a lead attack. Fox Fangs cannot be blocked and strikes for +10...35 damage if it hits.', 'Off-Hand Attack. Deals +10...35 damage. Unblockable. Must follow a lead attack.', 'Fox Fangs (PvP)', 'Off-Hand Attack. Must follow a lead attack. Fox Fangs cannot be blocked and strikes for +10...25 damage if it hits.', 'Off-Hand Attack. Deals +10...25 damage. Unblockable. Must follow a lead attack.'),
  (781, 'Moebius Strike', 'Elite Off-Hand Attack. Must follow a Dual Attack. If it hits, Moebius Strike strikes for +10...35 damage. If you strike a foe whose Health is below 50%, all your other attack skills are recharged.', 'Elite Off-Hand Attack. Deals +10...35 damage. Recharges all your other attack skills if target foe''s Health is below 50%. Must follow a dual attack.', 'Moebius Strike', 'Elite Off-Hand Attack. Must follow a Dual Attack. If it hits, Moebius Strike strikes for +10...35 damage. If you strike a foe whose Health is below 50%, all your other attack skills are recharged.', 'Elite Off-Hand Attack. Deals +10...35 damage. Recharges all your other attack skills if target foe''s Health is below 50%. Must follow a dual attack.'),
  (782, 'Jagged Strike', 'Lead Attack. If Jagged Strike hits, your target suffers from Bleeding for 5...20 seconds.', 'Lead Attack. Inflicts Bleeding condition (5...20 seconds).', 'Jagged Strike', 'Lead Attack. If Jagged Strike hits, your target suffers from Bleeding for 5...20 seconds.', 'Lead Attack. Inflicts Bleeding condition (5...20 seconds).'),
  (783, 'Unsuspecting Strike', 'Lead Attack. If this attack hits, you strike for +19...31 damage. If your target was above 90% Health you deal an additional 15...75 damage.', 'Lead Attack. Deals +19...31 damage. Deals 15...75 more damage if target foe''s Health is above 90%.', 'Unsuspecting Strike', 'Lead Attack. If this attack hits, you strike for +19...31 damage. If your target was above 90% Health you deal an additional 15...75 damage.', 'Lead Attack. Deals +19...31 damage. Deals 15...75 more damage if target foe''s Health is above 90%.'),
  (784, 'Entangling Asp', 'Spell. Entangling Asp must follow a lead attack. Target foe is knocked down and becomes Poisoned for 5...20 seconds.', 'Spell. Causes knock-down. Inflicts Poisoned condition (5...20 seconds). Must follow a lead attack.', 'Entangling Asp', 'Spell. Entangling Asp must follow a lead attack. Target foe is knocked down and becomes Poisoned for 5...20 seconds.', 'Spell. Causes knock-down. Inflicts Poisoned condition (5...20 seconds). Must follow a lead attack.'),
  (785, 'Mark of Death', 'Hex Spell. For 4...10 seconds, target foe gains 50% less benefit from healing.', 'Hex Spell. (4...10 seconds.) Target foe receives 50% less from healing.', 'Mark of Death', 'Hex Spell. For 4...10 seconds, target foe gains 50% less benefit from healing.', 'Hex Spell. (4...10 seconds.) Target foe receives 50% less from healing.'),
  (786, 'Iron Palm', 'Skill. Target touched foe suffers 5...50 damage, and if that foe is suffering from a hex or condition that foe is knocked down. Iron Palm counts as a lead attack.', 'Touch Skill. Deals 5...50 damage. Causes knock-down if target foe is hexed or has a condition. Counts as a lead attack.', 'Iron Palm', 'Skill. Target touched foe suffers 5...50 damage, and if that foe is suffering from a hex or condition that foe is knocked down. Iron Palm counts as a lead attack.', 'Touch Skill. Deals 5...50 damage. Causes knock-down if target foe is hexed or has a condition. Counts as a lead attack.'),
  (787, 'Resilient Weapon', 'Weapon Spell. For 3...12 seconds, target ally has a Resilient Weapon. While suffering from a hex or condition, that ally gains +1...6 Health regeneration and +24 armor.', 'Weapon Spell. (3...12 seconds.) +1...6 Health regeneration and +24 armor. No effect unless target ally is hexed or has a condition.', 'Resilient Weapon', 'Weapon Spell. For 3...12 seconds, target ally has a Resilient Weapon. While suffering from a hex or condition, that ally gains +1...6 Health regeneration and +24 armor.', 'Weapon Spell. (3...12 seconds.) +1...6 Health regeneration and +24 armor. No effect unless target ally is hexed or has a condition.'),
  (788, 'Blind Was Mingson', 'Item Spell. Hold Mingson''s ashes for up to 15...60 seconds. When you drop his ashes, all nearby foes are Blinded for 3...8 seconds.', 'Item Spell. (15...60 seconds.) Drop effect: inflicts Blindness condition (3...8 seconds) on all nearby foes.', 'Blind Was Mingson', 'Item Spell. Hold Mingson''s ashes for up to 15...60 seconds. When you drop his ashes, all nearby foes are Blinded for 3...8 seconds.', 'Item Spell. (15...60 seconds.) Drop effect: inflicts Blindness condition (3...8 seconds) on all nearby foes.'),
  (789, 'Grasping Was Kuurong', 'Elite Item Spell. Hold Kuurong''s ashes for up to 15...60 seconds. When you drop his ashes, all foes in the area are struck for 15...75 damage and knocked down.', 'Elite Item Spell. (15...60 seconds.) Drop effect: deals 15...75 damage and knocks-down all foes in the area.', 'Grasping Was Kuurong', 'Elite Item Spell. Hold Kuurong''s ashes for up to 15...60 seconds. When you drop his ashes, all foes in the area are struck for 15...75 damage and knocked down.', 'Elite Item Spell. (15...60 seconds.) Drop effect: deals 15...75 damage and knocks-down all foes in the area.'),
  (790, 'Vengeful Was Khanhei', 'Elite Item Spell. Hold Khanhei''s ashes for 5...11 seconds. Whenever a foe strikes you in combat while you are holding Khanhei''s ashes, you steal 10...45 Health from that foe.', 'Elite Item Spell. (5...11 seconds.) You steal 10...45 Health from every foe that hits you with an attack.', 'Vengeful Was Khanhei', 'Elite Item Spell. Hold Khanhei''s ashes for 5...11 seconds. Whenever a foe strikes you in combat while you are holding Khanhei''s ashes, you steal 10...45 Health from that foe.', 'Elite Item Spell. (5...11 seconds.) You steal 10...45 Health from every foe that hits you with an attack.'),
  (791, 'Flesh of My Flesh', 'Spell. Lose half your Health. Resurrect target party member with your current Health and 5...20% Energy.', 'Spell. Resurrects target party member (half your current Health and 5...20% Energy). Lose half your Health.', 'Flesh of My Flesh (PvP)', 'Spell. Lose half your Health. Resurrect target party member with your current Health and 5...20% Energy.', 'Spell. Resurrects target party member (half your current Health and 5...20% Energy). Lose half your Health.'),
  (792, 'Splinter Weapon', 'Weapon Spell. For 20 seconds, target ally has a Splinter Weapon. Target ally''s next 1...5 attacks deal 5...50 damage to up to 4 adjacent foes.', 'Weapon Spell. (20 seconds.) Attacks deal 5...50 damage to 3 adjacent foes. Ends after 1...5 attacks.', 'Splinter Weapon (PvP)', 'Weapon Spell. For 20 seconds, target ally has a Splinter Weapon. Target ally''s next 1...5 attacks deal 5...40 damage to up to 4 adjacent foes.', 'Weapon Spell. (20 seconds.) Attacks deal 5...40 damage to 3 adjacent foes. Ends after 1...5 attacks.'),
  (793, 'Weapon of Warding', 'Weapon Spell. For 3...8 seconds, target ally has a Weapon of Warding, granting that ally +2...4 Health regeneration and a 50% chance to block.', 'Weapon Spell. (3...8 seconds.) +2...4 Health regeneration. 50% chance to block.', 'Weapon of Warding (PvP)', 'Weapon Spell. For 3...8 seconds, target ally has a Weapon of Warding, granting that ally +2...4 Health regeneration and a 50% chance to block. Weapon of Warding ends if that ally attacks.', 'Weapon Spell. (3...8 seconds.) +2...4 Health regeneration. 50% chance to block. Ends if target ally attacks.'),
  (794, 'Wailing Weapon', 'Weapon Spell. For 3...14 seconds, target ally has a Wailing Weapon. Whenever the Wailing Weapon strikes an attacking foe, that foe is interrupted.', 'Weapon Spell. (3...14 seconds.) Attacks interrupt attacking foes.', 'Wailing Weapon', 'Weapon Spell. For 3...14 seconds, target ally has a Wailing Weapon. Whenever the Wailing Weapon strikes an attacking foe, that foe is interrupted.', 'Weapon Spell. (3...14 seconds.) Attacks interrupt attacking foes.'),
  (795, 'Nightmare Weapon', 'Weapon Spell. For 12 seconds, target ally has a Nightmare Weapon. Target ally''s next 3 attacks are reduced by 10...50 damage and steal up to 10...50 Health.', 'Weapon Spell. (12 seconds.) Target ally''s attacks steal 10...50 Health but deal 10...50 less damage. Ends after 3 attacks.', 'Nightmare Weapon', 'Weapon Spell. For 12 seconds, target ally has a Nightmare Weapon. Target ally''s next 3 attacks are reduced by 10...50 damage and steal up to 10...50 Health.', 'Weapon Spell. (12 seconds.) Target ally''s attacks steal 10...50 Health but deal 10...50 less damage. Ends after 3 attacks.'),
  (799, 'Beguiling Haze', 'Elite Spell. Shadow Step to target foe. That foe becomes Dazed for 3...9 seconds.', 'Elite Spell. You Shadow Step to this foe. Inflicts Dazed condition (3...9 seconds).', 'Beguiling Haze', 'Elite Spell. Shadow Step to target foe. That foe becomes Dazed for 3...9 seconds.', 'Elite Spell. You Shadow Step to this foe. Inflicts Dazed condition (3...9 seconds).'),
  (800, 'Enduring Toxin', 'Hex Spell. For 5 seconds, target foe suffers -1...5 Health degeneration. If that foe is moving when Enduring Toxin would end, Enduring Toxin is renewed for another 5 seconds.', 'Hex Spell. (5 seconds.) Causes -1...5 Health degeneration. Renewal: if target foe is moving when this hex ends.', 'Enduring Toxin', 'Hex Spell. For 5 seconds, target foe suffers -1...5 Health degeneration. If that foe is moving when Enduring Toxin would end, Enduring Toxin is renewed for another 5 seconds.', 'Hex Spell. (5 seconds.) Causes -1...5 Health degeneration. Renewal: if target foe is moving when this hex ends.'),
  (801, 'Shroud of Silence', 'Elite Hex Spell. All of your spells are disabled for 15 seconds. For 1...6 seconds, target touched foe cannot cast spells.', 'Elite Touch Hex Spell. (1...6 seconds.) Target foe cannot cast spells. Your spells are disabled for 15 seconds.', 'Shroud of Silence', 'Elite Hex Spell. All of your spells are disabled for 15 seconds. For 1...6 seconds, target touched foe cannot cast spells.', 'Elite Touch Hex Spell. (1...6 seconds.) Target foe cannot cast spells. Your spells are disabled for 15 seconds.'),
  (802, 'Expose Defenses', 'Hex Spell. For 1...11 seconds, target foe cannot block your attacks.', 'Hex Spell. (1...11 seconds.) Target foe cannot block your attacks.', 'Expose Defenses', 'Hex Spell. For 1...11 seconds, target foe cannot block your attacks.', 'Hex Spell. (1...11 seconds.) Target foe cannot block your attacks.'),
  (803, 'Power Leech', 'Elite Hex Spell. If target foe is casting a spell or chant, that skill is interrupted and for 10 seconds, whenever that foe casts a spell, you steal up to 5...15 Energy from that foe.', 'Elite Hex Spell. Interrupt a spell or a chant. Interruption effect: steal 5...15 Energy whenever target foe casts a spell (10 seconds).', 'Power Leech', 'Elite Hex Spell. If target foe is casting a spell or chant, that skill is interrupted and for 10 seconds, whenever that foe casts a spell, you steal up to 5...15 Energy from that foe.', 'Elite Hex Spell. Interrupt a spell or a chant. Interruption effect: steal 5...15 Energy whenever target foe casts a spell (10 seconds).'),
  (804, 'Arcane Languor', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 1...10 seconds, all spells cast by the target foe cause 10 Overcast.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (1...10 seconds.) Target foe''s spells cause 10 Overcast.', 'Arcane Languor', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 1...10 seconds, all spells cast by the target foe cause 10 Overcast.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (1...10 seconds.) Target foe''s spells cause 10 Overcast.'),
  (805, 'Animate Vampiric Horror', 'Spell. Exploit nearest corpse to animate a level 1...17 Vampiric Horror. Whenever a Vampiric Horror you control deals damage, you gain the same amount of Health.', 'Spell. Creates a level 1...17 vampiric horror. You gain Health equal to the damage it deals. Exploits a fresh corpse.', 'Animate Vampiric Horror', 'Spell. Exploit nearest corpse to animate a level 1...17 Vampiric Horror. Whenever a Vampiric Horror you control deals damage, you gain the same amount of Health.', 'Spell. Creates a level 1...17 vampiric horror. You gain Health equal to the damage it deals. Exploits a fresh corpse.'),
  (806, 'Cultist''s Fervor', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 5 seconds and 3 seconds longer for every rank of Soul Reaping, your Necromancer spells cost -1...6 Energy to cast, but you suffer from Bleeding for 10 seconds each time you cast a Necromancer spell.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (5 seconds plus 3 seconds more for every rank of Soul Reaping.) Your Necromancer spells cost 1...6 less Energy. You suffer from Bleeding (10 seconds) each time you cast a Necromancer spell.', 'Cultist''s Fervor', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 5 seconds and 3 seconds longer for every rank of Soul Reaping, your Necromancer spells cost -1...6 Energy to cast, but you suffer from Bleeding for 10 seconds each time you cast a Necromancer spell.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (5 seconds plus 3 seconds more for every rank of Soul Reaping.) Your Necromancer spells cost 1...6 less Energy. You suffer from Bleeding (10 seconds) each time you cast a Necromancer spell.'),
  (808, 'Reaper''s Mark', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 30 seconds, target foe suffers -1...5 Health degeneration. If that foe dies while hexed with Reaper''s Mark, you gain 5...15 Energy.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (30 seconds.) Causes -1...5 Health degeneration. You gain 5...15 Energy if target foe dies while suffering from this hex.', 'Reaper''s Mark', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 30 seconds, target foe suffers -1...5 Health degeneration. If that foe dies while hexed with Reaper''s Mark, you gain 5...15 Energy.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (30 seconds.) Causes -1...5 Health degeneration. You gain 5...15 Energy if target foe dies while suffering from this hex.'),
  (809, 'Shatterstone', 'Elite Hex Spell. Target foe is struck for 25...100 cold damage, moves 66% slower, and is hexed with Shatterstone for 3 seconds. When Shatterstone ends, that foe and all nearby foes are struck for 25...100 cold damage.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (3 seconds.) Initial effect: deals 25...100 cold damage and target moves 66% slower. End effect: deals 25...100 cold damage to target and all nearby foes.', 'Shatterstone', 'Elite Hex Spell. Target foe is struck for 25...100 cold damage, moves 66% slower, and is hexed with Shatterstone for 3 seconds. When Shatterstone ends, that foe and all nearby foes are struck for 25...100 cold damage.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (3 seconds.) Initial effect: deals 25...100 cold damage and target moves 66% slower. End effect: deals 25...100 cold damage to target and all nearby foes.'),
  (810, 'Protector''s Defense', 'Skill. For 5...11 seconds, allies adjacent to you have a 75% chance to block incoming attacks. Protector''s Defense ends if you move.', 'Skill. (5...11 seconds.) Allies adjacent to you have 75% chance to block. Ends if you move.', 'Protector''s Defense (PvP)', 'Skill. For 4...8 seconds, allies adjacent to you have a 75% chance to block incoming attacks. Protector''s Defense ends if you move.', 'Skill. (4...8 seconds.) Allies adjacent to you have 75% chance to block. Ends if you move.'),
  (811, 'Run as One', 'Stance. For 5...15 seconds, you and your pet run 25% faster.', 'Stance. (5...15 seconds.) You and your pet move 25% faster.', 'Run as One', 'Stance. For 5...15 seconds, you and your pet run 25% faster.', 'Stance. (5...15 seconds.) You and your pet move 25% faster.'),
  (812, 'Defiant Was Xinrae', 'Elite Item Spell. Hold Xinrae''s ashes for up to 15...60 seconds. While you hold her ashes, you cannot lose more than 20% of your max Health from a single hit. When you drop her ashes, you steal 5...50 Health from all nearby foes.', 'Elite Item Spell. (15...60 seconds.) You cannot lose more than 20% of your max Health from a single hit. Drop effect: steal 5...50 Health from nearby foes.', 'Defiant Was Xinrae', 'Elite Item Spell. Hold Xinrae''s ashes for up to 15...60 seconds. While you hold her ashes, you cannot lose more than 20% of your max Health from a single hit. When you drop her ashes, you steal 5...50 Health from all nearby foes.', 'Elite Item Spell. (15...60 seconds.) You cannot lose more than 20% of your max Health from a single hit. Drop effect: steal 5...50 Health from nearby foes.'),
  (813, 'Lyssa''s Aura', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 10 seconds, you have +0...5 Energy regeneration. This enchantment reapplies itself every time you cast a spell on a foe.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (10 seconds.) You have +0...5 Energy regeneration. Renewal: every time you cast a spell on an enemy.', 'Lyssa''s Aura', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 10 seconds, you have +0...5 Energy regeneration. This enchantment reapplies itself every time you cast a spell on a foe.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (10 seconds.) You have +0...5 Energy regeneration. Renewal: every time you cast a spell on an enemy.'),
  (814, 'Shadow Refuge', 'Enchantment Spell. For 6 seconds, you gain 5...10 Health regeneration. When Shadow Refuge ends, you gain 40...100 Health if you are attacking.', 'Enchantment Spell. (6 seconds.) You have +5...10 Health regeneration. End effect: heals you for 40...100 if you are attacking.', 'Shadow Refuge', 'Enchantment Spell. For 6 seconds, you gain 5...10 Health regeneration. When Shadow Refuge ends, you gain 40...100 Health if you are attacking.', 'Enchantment Spell. (6 seconds.) You have +5...10 Health regeneration. End effect: heals you for 40...100 if you are attacking.'),
  (815, 'Scorpion Wire', 'Hex Spell. For 8...20 seconds, the next time you and target foe are more than 75'' apart, you Shadow Step to that foe and that foe is knocked down. This spell has half the normal range.', 'Half Range Hex Spell. (8...20 seconds.) Shadow Step to target foe and cause knock-down the next time this foe is more than 75'' away from you.', 'Scorpion Wire', 'Hex Spell. For 8...20 seconds, the next time you and target foe are more than 75'' apart, you Shadow Step to that foe and that foe is knocked down. This spell has half the normal range.', 'Half Range Hex Spell. (8...20 seconds.) Shadow Step to target foe and cause knock-down the next time this foe is more than 75'' away from you.'),
  (816, 'Mirrored Stance', 'Hex Spell. For 10...35 seconds, whenever target foe enters a stance, you enter the same stance.', 'Hex Spell. (10...35 seconds.) You enter any stance used by target foe.', 'Mirrored Stance', 'Hex Spell. For 10...35 seconds, whenever target foe enters a stance, you enter the same stance.', 'Hex Spell. (10...35 seconds.) You enter any stance used by target foe.'),
  (817, 'Discord', 'Elite Spell. If target foe is suffering from a condition and under the effects of a hex or an enchantment, that foe suffers 30...110 damage.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 30...110 damage. No effect unless target foe has a condition and is either hexed or enchanted.', 'Discord (PvP)', 'Elite Spell. If target foe is suffering from a condition and under the effects of a hex or an enchantment, that foe suffers 30...110 damage.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 30...110 damage. No effect unless target foe has a condition and is either hexed or enchanted.'),
  (818, 'Well of Weariness', 'Well Spell. Exploit target corpse or sacrifice 66% health to create a Well of Weariness for 10...55 seconds. Enemies within the Well of Weariness suffer -1 Energy degeneration.', 'Well Spell. (10...55 seconds.) Foes in this well have -1 Energy degeneration. Exploits a fresh corpse or sacrifices 66% health.', 'Well of Weariness', 'Well Spell. Exploit target corpse or sacrifice 66% health to create a Well of Weariness for 10...55 seconds. Enemies within the Well of Weariness suffer -1 Energy degeneration.', 'Well Spell. (10...55 seconds.) Foes in this well have -1 Energy degeneration. Exploits a fresh corpse or sacrifices 66% health.'),
  (819, 'Vampiric Spirit', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Steal up to 15...60 Health from target foe. For 10 seconds, you have +5...10 Health regeneration.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Steal 15...60 Health from target foe. You have +5...10 Health regeneration (10 seconds).', 'Vampiric Spirit', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Steal up to 15...60 Health from target foe. For 10 seconds, you have +5...10 Health regeneration.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Steal 15...60 Health from target foe. You have +5...10 Health regeneration (10 seconds).'),
  (820, 'Depravity', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 5...20 seconds, whenever target foe casts a spell, that foe and one nearby foe lose 1...5 Energy.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (5...20 seconds.) Causes 1...5 Energy loss whenever target foe casts a spell. One foe near your target also loses Energy.', 'Depravity', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 5...20 seconds, whenever target foe casts a spell, that foe and one nearby foe lose 1...5 Energy.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (5...20 seconds.) Causes 1...5 Energy loss whenever target foe casts a spell. One foe near your target also loses Energy.'),
  (821, 'Icy Veins', 'Elite Hex Spell. Target foe is struck for 10...90 cold damage. For 10...35 seconds, if target foe dies all nearby foes are struck for 20...110 cold damage.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (10...35 seconds.) Deals 20...110 cold damage to nearby foes if target foe dies. Initial effect: deals 10...90 cold damage.', 'Icy Veins', 'Elite Hex Spell. Target foe is struck for 10...90 cold damage. For 10...35 seconds, if target foe dies all nearby foes are struck for 20...110 cold damage.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (10...35 seconds.) Deals 20...110 cold damage to nearby foes if target foe dies. Initial effect: deals 10...90 cold damage.'),
  (822, 'Weaken Knees', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 1...16 seconds, target foe suffers -1...4 Health degeneration and takes 5...20 damage while moving.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (1...16 seconds.) Target foe has -1...4 Health degeneration and takes 5...20 damage while moving.', 'Weaken Knees', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 1...16 seconds, target foe suffers -1...4 Health degeneration and takes 5...20 damage while moving.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (1...16 seconds.) Target foe has -1...4 Health degeneration and takes 5...20 damage while moving.'),
  (823, 'Burning Speed', 'Enchantment Spell. For 7 seconds, you are set on fire and move 30...45% faster. When Burning Speed ends, all adjacent foes are set on fire for 3...9 seconds.', 'Enchantment Spell. (7 seconds.) You move 30...45% faster. You suffer from Burning (7 seconds). End effect: inflicts Burning condition (3...9 seconds) on adjacent foes.', 'Burning Speed', 'Enchantment Spell. For 7 seconds, you are set on fire and move 30...45% faster. When Burning Speed ends, all adjacent foes are set on fire for 3...9 seconds.', 'Enchantment Spell. (7 seconds.) You move 30...45% faster. You suffer from Burning (7 seconds). End effect: inflicts Burning condition (3...9 seconds) on adjacent foes.'),
  (824, 'Lava Arrows', 'Spell. Lava Arrows fly toward up to 3 foes near your target and strike for 20...65 fire damage if they hit.', 'Spell. Projectile: deals 20...65 fire damage. Bonus effect: sends projectiles at 2 other foes near your target.', 'Lava Arrows', 'Spell. Lava Arrows fly toward up to 3 foes near your target and strike for 20...65 fire damage if they hit.', 'Spell. Projectile: deals 20...65 fire damage. Bonus effect: sends projectiles at 2 other foes near your target.'),
  (825, 'Bed of Coals', 'Spell. Create a Bed of Coals at target foe''s location. For 5 seconds, foes adjacent to target foe are struck for 5...29 fire damage each second. Any foe knocked down on the Bed of Coals is set on fire for 3...7 seconds.', 'Spell. Deals 5...29 fire damage each second (5 seconds) to location of target foe. Hits foes adjacent to your target. Inflicts Burning condition (3...7 seconds) on knocked down foes.', 'Bed of Coals', 'Spell. Create a Bed of Coals at target foe''s location. For 5 seconds, foes adjacent to target foe are struck for 5...29 fire damage each second. Any foe knocked down on the Bed of Coals is set on fire for 3...7 seconds.', 'Spell. Deals 5...29 fire damage each second (5 seconds) to location of target foe. Hits foes adjacent to your target. Inflicts Burning condition (3...7 seconds) on knocked down foes.'),
  (826, 'Shadow Form', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 5...21 seconds, you cannot be the target of enemy spells, and you gain 5 damage reduction for each Assassin enchantment on you. You cannot deal more than 5...25 damage with a single skill or attack.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (5...21 seconds.) Enemy spells cannot target you. Gain 5 damage reduction for each Assassin enchantment on you. You cannot deal more than 5...25 damage with a single skill or attack.', 'Shadow Form (PvP)', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 5...15 seconds, all hostile spells that target you fail and all attacks against you miss. When Shadow Form ends, lose all but 5...50 Health.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (5...15 seconds.) Hostile spells targeting you fail, and attacks against you miss. End effect: lose all but 5...50 Health.'),
  (827, 'Siphon Strength', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 5...20 seconds, target foe deals -5...50 damage with attacks and all of your attacks against that foe have an additional 50% chance of being a critical hit.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (5...20 seconds.) Target foe deals -5...50 attack damage. You have +50% chance to land a critical hit on this foe.', 'Siphon Strength', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 5...20 seconds, target foe deals -5...50 damage with attacks and all of your attacks against that foe have an additional 50% chance of being a critical hit.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (5...20 seconds.) Target foe deals -5...50 attack damage. You have +50% chance to land a critical hit on this foe.'),
  (828, 'Vile Miasma', 'Hex Spell. Target foe is struck for 10...65 cold damage. If suffering from a condition, that foe is hexed with Vile Miasma and suffers -1...5 Health degeneration for 10 seconds.', 'Hex Spell. Causes -1...5 Health degeneration (10 seconds). Initial effect: deals 10...65 cold damage. Hex is only applied if target foe has a condition.', 'Vile Miasma', 'Hex Spell. Target foe is struck for 10...65 cold damage. If suffering from a condition, that foe is hexed with Vile Miasma and suffers -1...5 Health degeneration for 10 seconds.', 'Hex Spell. Causes -1...5 Health degeneration (10 seconds). Initial effect: deals 10...65 cold damage. Hex is only applied if target foe has a condition.'),
  (830, 'Ray of Judgment', 'Elite Spell. Invoke a Ray of Judgment at target foe''s location. For 5 seconds, foes adjacent to that location are struck for 10...50 holy damage and begin Burning for 1...3 seconds every second.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 10...50 holy damage and inflicts Burning (1...3 seconds) every second (5 seconds). Hits foes adjacent to target''s initial location.', 'Ray of Judgment', 'Elite Spell. Invoke a Ray of Judgment at target foe''s location. For 5 seconds, foes adjacent to that location are struck for 10...50 holy damage and begin Burning for 1...3 seconds every second.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 10...50 holy damage and inflicts Burning (1...3 seconds) every second (5 seconds). Hits foes adjacent to target''s initial location.'),
  (831, 'Primal Rage', 'Elite Stance. For 1...9 seconds, you attack 33% faster and move 33% faster, but you take 150...125% damage.', 'Elite Stance. (1...9 seconds.) You attack 33% faster and move 33% faster. You take 150...125% damage.', 'Primal Rage (PvP)', 'Elite Stance. For 1...9 seconds, you attack 33% faster and move 33% faster, but you take 200...150% damage.', 'Elite Stance. (1...9 seconds.) You attack 33% faster and move 33% faster. You take 200...150% damage.'),
  (832, 'Animate Flesh Golem', 'Elite Spell. Exploit nearest corpse to animate a level 3...25 Flesh Golem. The Flesh Golem leaves 1...4 exploitable corpses. You can have only one Flesh Golem at a time.', 'Elite Spell. Creates a level 3...25 flesh golem which leaves 1...4 fresh corpses when it dies. Exploits a fresh corpse. You can have only one flesh golem at a time.', 'Animate Flesh Golem', 'Elite Spell. Exploit nearest corpse to animate a level 3...25 Flesh Golem. The Flesh Golem leaves 1...4 exploitable corpses. You can have only one Flesh Golem at a time.', 'Elite Spell. Creates a level 3...25 flesh golem which leaves 1...4 fresh corpses when it dies. Exploits a fresh corpse. You can have only one flesh golem at a time.'),
  (834, 'Reckless Haste', 'Hex Spell. For 6...12 seconds, target foe and all adjacent foes are hexed with Reckless Haste. While hexed, they attack 25% faster but have a 50% chance to miss with attacks.', 'Hex Spell. Also hexes foes adjacent to your target (6...12 seconds). These foes have 50% chance to miss, but attack 25% faster.', 'Reckless Haste', 'Hex Spell. For 6...12 seconds, target foe and all adjacent foes are hexed with Reckless Haste. While hexed, they attack 25% faster but have a 50% chance to miss with attacks.', 'Hex Spell. Also hexes foes adjacent to your target (6...12 seconds). These foes have 50% chance to miss, but attack 25% faster.'),
  (835, 'Blood Bond', 'Hex Spell. For 3...12 seconds, target foe and all adjacent foes are hexed with Blood Bond. Whenever an ally hits one of them with an attack, that ally gains 5...20 Health. If one of these foes dies while hexed, all allies adjacent to that foe are healed for 20...100 Health.', 'Hex Spell. Also hexes foes adjacent to your target (3...12 seconds). Allies hitting these foes gain 5...20 Health. If any of these foes dies while hexed, adjacent allies are healed for 20...100.', 'Blood Bond', 'Hex Spell. For 3...12 seconds, target foe and all adjacent foes are hexed with Blood Bond. Whenever an ally hits one of them with an attack, that ally gains 5...20 Health. If one of these foes dies while hexed, all allies adjacent to that foe are healed for 20...100 Health.', 'Hex Spell. Also hexes foes adjacent to your target (3...12 seconds). Allies hitting these foes gain 5...20 Health. If any of these foes dies while hexed, adjacent allies are healed for 20...100.'),
  (836, 'Ride the Lightning', 'Elite Spell. You Ride the Lightning to target. All adjacent foes are Blinded for 1...5 seconds. If your target is a foe, it is struck for 10...70 lightning damage. This spell has 25% armor penetration.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 10...70 lightning damage. 25% armor penetration. Blinds all adjacent foes (1...5 seconds). You instantly move to your target. May target allies.', 'Ride the Lightning (PvP)', 'Elite Spell. You Ride the Lightning to target. All adjacent foes are Blinded for 1...5 seconds. If your target is a foe, it is struck for 10...70 lightning damage. This spell has 25% armor penetration.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 10...70 lightning damage. 25% armor penetration. Blinds all adjacent foes (1...5 seconds). You instantly move to your target. May target allies.'),
  (837, 'Energy Boon', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 36...60 seconds, Energy Boon raises the maximum Health of you and target ally by 1...3 for each point of your respective maximum Energy. When this enchantment is first applied, you and your target gain 1...12 Energy. You gain an additional 1 Energy for every 2 points you have in Energy Storage.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (36...60 seconds.) Maximum Health for you and target ally is increased by 1...3 for each point of maximum Energy. Initial effect: Both gain 1...12 Energy. You gain +1 Energy for every 2 points of Energy Storage.', 'Energy Boon', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 36...60 seconds, Energy Boon raises the maximum Health of you and target ally by 1...3 for each point of your respective maximum Energy. When this enchantment is first applied, you and your target gain 1...12 Energy. You gain an additional 1 Energy for every 2 points you have in Energy Storage.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (36...60 seconds.) Maximum Health for you and target ally is increased by 1...3 for each point of maximum Energy. Initial effect: Both gain 1...12 Energy. You gain +1 Energy for every 2 points of Energy Storage.'),
  (838, 'Dwayna''s Sorrow', 'Enchantment Spell. For 30 seconds, target ally and all nearby allies are enchanted with Dwayna''s Sorrow. If an ally dies while under the effects of Dwayna''s Sorrow, your party is healed for 5...50.', 'Enchantment Spell. Enchants allies near your target (30 seconds). Your party is healed for 5...50 whenever one of these allies dies.', 'Dwayna''s Sorrow', 'Enchantment Spell. For 30 seconds, target ally and all nearby allies are enchanted with Dwayna''s Sorrow. If an ally dies while under the effects of Dwayna''s Sorrow, your party is healed for 5...50.', 'Enchantment Spell. Enchants allies near your target (30 seconds). Your party is healed for 5...50 whenever one of these allies dies.'),
  (839, '"Retreat!"', 'Shout. If there are any dead allies within earshot, your party moves 33% faster for 5...11 seconds.', 'Shout. (5...11 seconds.) Party members in earshot move 33% faster. No effect unless there are dead allies within earshot.', '"Retreat!"', 'Shout. If there are any dead allies within earshot, your party moves 33% faster for 5...11 seconds.', 'Shout. (5...11 seconds.) Party members in earshot move 33% faster. No effect unless there are dead allies within earshot.'),
  (840, 'Poisoned Heart', 'Spell. You and all adjacent foes are Poisoned for 5...15 seconds.', 'Spell. Inflicts Poisoned condition (5...15 seconds) to adjacent foes. You are also Poisoned.', 'Poisoned Heart', 'Spell. You and all adjacent foes are Poisoned for 5...15 seconds.', 'Spell. Inflicts Poisoned condition (5...15 seconds) to adjacent foes. You are also Poisoned.'),
  (841, 'Fetid Ground', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 15...65 cold damage. If that foe is knocked down, that foe becomes Poisoned for 5...20 seconds.', 'Spell. Deals 15...65 cold damage. Inflicts Poisoned condition (5...20 seconds) if target foe is knocked-down.', 'Fetid Ground', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 15...65 cold damage. If that foe is knocked down, that foe becomes Poisoned for 5...20 seconds.', 'Spell. Deals 15...65 cold damage. Inflicts Poisoned condition (5...20 seconds) if target foe is knocked-down.'),
  (842, 'Arc Lightning', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 5...40 lightning damage. If you are Overcast, two foes near your target are struck for 15...85 lightning damage. Damage from Arc Lightning has 25% armor penetration.', 'Spell. Deals 5...40 lightning damage. Deals 15...85 lightning damage to two nearby foes if you are Overcast. 25% armor penetration.', 'Arc Lightning', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 5...40 lightning damage. If you are Overcast, two foes near your target are struck for 15...85 lightning damage. Damage from Arc Lightning has 25% armor penetration.', 'Spell. Deals 5...40 lightning damage. Deals 15...85 lightning damage to two nearby foes if you are Overcast. 25% armor penetration.'),
  (843, 'Gust', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 5...11 seconds, both you and target ally move 33% faster. When you cast this spell, all foes adjacent to you and your target take 15...70 cold damage. Foes struck by Gust while attacking or moving are knocked down.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (5...11 seconds.) You and target ally move 33% faster. Initial effect: Foes adjacent to you and target ally are struck for 15...70 cold damage. Attacking or moving foes are knocked down.', 'Gust', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 5...11 seconds, both you and target ally move 33% faster. When you cast this spell, all foes adjacent to you and your target take 15...70 cold damage. Foes struck by Gust while attacking or moving are knocked down.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (5...11 seconds.) You and target ally move 33% faster. Initial effect: Foes adjacent to you and target ally are struck for 15...70 cold damage. Attacking or moving foes are knocked down.'),
  (844, 'Churning Earth', 'Spell. Create Churning Earth at target foe''s location. For the next 5 seconds, Churning Earth strikes foes near that location for 10...40 earth damage each second. Any foe moving faster than normal when struck by Churning Earth is knocked down.', 'Spell. Deals 10...40 earth damage each second (5 seconds). Hits foes near target''s initial location. Causes knock-down to foes moving faster than normal.', 'Churning Earth', 'Spell. Create Churning Earth at target foe''s location. For the next 5 seconds, Churning Earth strikes foes near that location for 10...40 earth damage each second. Any foe moving faster than normal when struck by Churning Earth is knocked down.', 'Spell. Deals 10...40 earth damage each second (5 seconds). Hits foes near target''s initial location. Causes knock-down to foes moving faster than normal.'),
  (845, 'Liquid Flame', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 7...112 fire damage. If that foe is attacking or casting a spell, nearby foes are also struck for 7...112 fire damage.', 'Spell. Deals 7...112 fire damage. Deals 7...112 fire damage to foes near your target if this foe is attacking or casting.', 'Liquid Flame', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 7...112 fire damage. If that foe is attacking or casting a spell, nearby foes are also struck for 7...112 fire damage.', 'Spell. Deals 7...112 fire damage. Deals 7...112 fire damage to foes near your target if this foe is attacking or casting.'),
  (846, 'Steam', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 20...60 cold damage. If target foe is on fire, Steam Blinds that foe for 5...10 seconds and they take an additional 20...60 fire damage.', 'Spell. Deals 20...60 cold damage. Inflicts Blindness condition (5...10 seconds) and does 20...60 fire damage if target foe is Burning.', 'Steam', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 20...60 cold damage. If target foe is on fire, Steam Blinds that foe for 5...10 seconds and they take an additional 20...60 fire damage.', 'Spell. Deals 20...60 cold damage. Inflicts Blindness condition (5...10 seconds) and does 20...60 fire damage if target foe is Burning.'),
  (847, 'Boon Signet', 'Elite Signet. Heal target ally for 20...80 Health. Your next Healing or Protection Prayer spell that targets an ally heals for an additional 20...100 Health.', 'Elite Signet. Heals for 20...80. Your next Healing or Protection Prayer spell that targets an ally heals for +20...100 Health.', 'Boon Signet', 'Elite Signet. Heal target ally for 20...80 Health. Your next Healing or Protection Prayer spell that targets an ally heals for an additional 20...100 Health.', 'Elite Signet. Heals for 20...80. Your next Healing or Protection Prayer spell that targets an ally heals for +20...100 Health.'),
  (848, 'Reverse Hex', 'Enchantment Spell. Remove one hex from target ally. If a hex was removed in this way, for 5...10 seconds, the next time target ally would take damage, that damage is reduced by 5...50.', 'Enchantment Spell. (5...10 seconds.) Removes one hex from target ally. The next damage this ally takes is reduced by 5...50. No effect unless this ally is hexed.', 'Reverse Hex', 'Enchantment Spell. Remove one hex from target ally. If a hex was removed in this way, for 5...10 seconds, the next time target ally would take damage, that damage is reduced by 5...50.', 'Enchantment Spell. (5...10 seconds.) Removes one hex from target ally. The next damage this ally takes is reduced by 5...50. No effect unless this ally is hexed.'),
  (849, 'Lacerating Chop', 'Axe Attack. If Lacerating Chop hits, you deal +5...20 damage. If it strikes a knocked down foe your target suffers from Bleeding for 5...20 seconds.', 'Axe Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. Inflicts Bleeding condition (5...20 seconds) if target foe is knocked-down.', 'Lacerating Chop', 'Axe Attack. If Lacerating Chop hits, you deal +5...20 damage. If it strikes a knocked down foe your target suffers from Bleeding for 5...20 seconds.', 'Axe Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. Inflicts Bleeding condition (5...20 seconds) if target foe is knocked-down.'),
  (850, 'Fierce Blow', 'Hammer Attack. If Fierce Blow hits, you strike for +5...20 damage. If target foe was suffering from Weakness, that foe also suffers from a Deep Wound for 1...8 seconds.', 'Hammer Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. Inflicts Deep Wound (1...8 seconds) if target foe is Weakened.', 'Fierce Blow', 'Hammer Attack. If Fierce Blow hits, you strike for +5...20 damage. If target foe was suffering from Weakness, that foe also suffers from a Deep Wound for 1...8 seconds.', 'Hammer Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. Inflicts Deep Wound (1...8 seconds) if target foe is Weakened.'),
  (851, 'Sun and Moon Slash', 'Sword Attack. Attack target foe twice. These attacks cannot be blocked.', 'Sword Attack. You attack target foe twice. Unblockable.', 'Sun and Moon Slash', 'Sword Attack. Attack target foe twice. These attacks cannot be blocked.', 'Sword Attack. You attack target foe twice. Unblockable.'),
  (852, 'Splinter Shot', 'Bow Attack. If Splinter Shot hits, you deal +3...15 damage. If Splinter Shot is blocked, all foes in the area of your target take 5...65 damage.', 'Bow Attack. Deals +3...15 damage. Deals 5...65 damage to foes in the area if blocked.', 'Splinter Shot', 'Bow Attack. If Splinter Shot hits, you deal +3...15 damage. If Splinter Shot is blocked, all foes in the area of your target take 5...65 damage.', 'Bow Attack. Deals +3...15 damage. Deals 5...65 damage to foes in the area if blocked.'),
  (853, 'Melandru''s Shot', 'Elite Bow Attack. If Melandru''s Shot hits, your target begins Bleeding for 5...25 seconds. If it hits a foe that is moving or knocked down, that foe takes +10...25 damage and is Crippled for 5...15 seconds.', 'Elite Bow Attack. Inflicts Bleeding (5...25 seconds). Deals +10...25 damage and inflicts Crippled (5...15 seconds) if target foe was moving or knocked down.', 'Melandru''s Shot (PvP)', 'Elite Bow Attack. If Melandru''s Shot hits, your target begins Bleeding for 5...25 seconds. If it hits a foe that is moving or knocked down, that foe takes +10...25 damage and is Crippled for 5...15 seconds.', 'Elite Bow Attack. Inflicts Bleeding (5...25 seconds). Deals +10...25 damage and inflicts Crippled (5...15 seconds) if target foe was moving or knocked down.'),
  (854, 'Snare', 'Trap. When Snare is triggered, all nearby foes become Crippled for 3...15 seconds. Snare ends after 90 seconds. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted.', 'Trap. (90 seconds.) Affects nearby foes. Inflicts Crippled condition (3...15 seconds). Easily interrupted.', 'Snare', 'Trap. When Snare is triggered, all nearby foes become Crippled for 3...15 seconds. Snare ends after 90 seconds. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted.', 'Trap. (90 seconds.) Affects nearby foes. Inflicts Crippled condition (3...15 seconds). Easily interrupted.'),
  (858, 'Dancing Daggers', 'Spell. Send out three Dancing Daggers at target foe, each striking for 5...35 earth damage if they hit. Dancing Daggers has half the normal range. This skill counts as a lead attack.', 'Half Range Spell. Three projectiles: each deals 5...35 earth damage. Counts as a lead attack.', 'Dancing Daggers', 'Spell. Send out three Dancing Daggers at target foe, each striking for 5...35 earth damage if they hit. Dancing Daggers has half the normal range. This skill counts as a lead attack.', 'Half Range Spell. Three projectiles: each deals 5...35 earth damage. Counts as a lead attack.'),
  (859, 'Conjure Nightmare', 'Hex Spell. For 2...16 seconds, target foe suffers -8 Health degeneration.', 'Hex Spell. (2...16 seconds.) Causes -8 Health degeneration.', 'Conjure Nightmare', 'Hex Spell. For 2...16 seconds, target foe suffers -8 Health degeneration.', 'Hex Spell. (2...16 seconds.) Causes -8 Health degeneration.'),
  (860, 'Signet of Disruption', 'Signet. If target foe is casting a spell, the spell is interrupted and that foe suffers 10...51 damage. If that foe is hexed, Signet of Disruption can interrupt any non-spell skills.', 'Signet. Interrupts a spell. Can interrupt any skill if target foe is hexed. Interruption effect: deals 10...51 damage.', 'Signet of Disruption', 'Signet. If target foe is casting a spell, the spell is interrupted and that foe suffers 10...51 damage. If that foe is hexed, Signet of Disruption can interrupt any non-spell skills.', 'Signet. Interrupts a spell. Can interrupt any skill if target foe is hexed. Interruption effect: deals 10...51 damage.'),
  (862, 'Ravenous Gaze', 'Elite Spell. Deal 20...40 damage and steal 20...40 Health from target foe and all nearby foes.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 20...40 damage and steals 20...40 Health from target and nearby foes.', 'Ravenous Gaze', 'Elite Spell. Deal 20...40 damage and steal 20...40 Health from target foe and all nearby foes.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 20...40 damage and steals 20...40 Health from target and nearby foes.'),
  (863, 'Order of Apostasy', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 5 seconds, whenever a party member hits a foe with physical damage, that foe loses one enchantment. For each Monk enchantment removed, you lose 10...3% maximum Health.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Enchants all party members (5 seconds). These party members remove one enchantment when they deal physical damage. Removal cost: for each Monk enchantment, you lose 10...3% maximum Health.', 'Order of Apostasy', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 5 seconds, whenever a party member hits a foe with physical damage, that foe loses one enchantment. For each Monk enchantment removed, you lose 10...3% maximum Health.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Enchants all party members (5 seconds). These party members remove one enchantment when they deal physical damage. Removal cost: for each Monk enchantment, you lose 10...3% maximum Health.'),
  (864, 'Oppressive Gaze', 'Spell. Target foe and adjacent foes take 10...30 shadow damage. Foes already suffering from a condition are Poisoned and Weakened for 3...12 seconds.', 'Spell. Deals 10...30 damage to target and adjacent foes. Inflicts Poison and Weakness (3...12 seconds) on foes suffering from a condition.', 'Oppressive Gaze', 'Spell. Target foe and adjacent foes take 10...30 shadow damage. Foes already suffering from a condition are Poisoned and Weakened for 3...12 seconds.', 'Spell. Deals 10...30 damage to target and adjacent foes. Inflicts Poison and Weakness (3...12 seconds) on foes suffering from a condition.'),
  (865, 'Lightning Hammer', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 10...100 lightning damage and applies Cracked Armor for 5...20 seconds. Lightning Hammer has 25% armor penetration.', 'Spell. Deals 10...100 lightning damage. Applies Cracked Armor (5...20 seconds). 25% armor penetration.', 'Lightning Hammer (PvP)', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 10...100 lightning damage. Lightning Hammer has 25% armor penetration.', 'Spell. Deals 10...100 lightning damage. 25% armor penetration.'),
  (866, 'Vapor Blade', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 15...135 cold damage. Vapor Blade deals half damage if that foe has any enchantments on them.', 'Spell. Deals 15...135 cold damage. Half damage if target foe is enchanted.', 'Vapor Blade', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 15...135 cold damage. Vapor Blade deals half damage if that foe has any enchantments on them.', 'Spell. Deals 15...135 cold damage. Half damage if target foe is enchanted.'),
  (867, 'Healing Light', 'Elite Spell. Heal target ally for 40...120 Health. If your target has an enchantment, you gain 1...3 Energy.', 'Elite Spell. Heals for 40...120. You gain 1...3 Energy if target ally is enchanted.', 'Healing Light', 'Elite Spell. Heal target ally for 40...120 Health. If your target has an enchantment, you gain 1...3 Energy.', 'Elite Spell. Heals for 40...120. You gain 1...3 Energy if target ally is enchanted.'),
  (869, '"Coward!"', 'Elite Shout. If target foe is moving, that foe is knocked down.', 'Elite Shout. Causes knock-down if target foe is moving.', '"Coward!" (PvP)', 'Elite Shout. If target foe is moving, that foe is knocked down.', 'Elite Shout. Causes knock-down if target foe is moving.'),
  (870, 'Pestilence', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. When any non-spirit creature within its range dies, conditions on that creature spread to any creature in the area already suffering from a condition. This spirit dies after 30...180 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...180 second lifespan). When any creature in range dies, conditions on this creature spread to any creature in the area with a condition. Spirits are not affected.', 'Pestilence', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. When any non-spirit creature within its range dies, conditions on that creature spread to any creature in the area already suffering from a condition. This spirit dies after 30...180 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...180 second lifespan). When any creature in range dies, conditions on this creature spread to any creature in the area with a condition. Spirits are not affected.'),
  (871, 'Shadowsong', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. This spirit''s attacks deal 5...20 damage and cause Blindness for 1...6 seconds. This spirit dies after 30 seconds.', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30-second lifespan). Its attacks deal 5...20 damage and inflict Blindness condition (1...6 seconds).', 'Shadowsong (PvP)', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...6 spirit. This spirit''s attacks deal 5...20 damage and cause Blindness for 1...6 seconds. This spirit dies after 30 seconds.', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...6 spirit (30-second lifespan). Its attacks deal 5...20 damage and inflict Blindness condition (1...6 seconds).'),
  (876, 'Signet of Shadows', 'Signet. Target foe takes 5...35 damage. If your target was Blinded, that foe suffers an additional 15...60 damage.', 'Signet. Deals 5...35 damage. Deals 15...60 more damage if target foe is Blinded.', 'Signet of Shadows', 'Signet. Target foe takes 5...35 damage. If your target was Blinded, that foe suffers an additional 15...60 damage.', 'Signet. Deals 5...35 damage. Deals 15...60 more damage if target foe is Blinded.'),
  (877, 'Lyssa''s Balance', 'Spell. Target foe loses one enchantment. If you have more enchantments than target foe, this skill has no effect.', 'Spell. Removes one enchantment from target foe. No effect if you have more enchantments than this foe.', 'Lyssa''s Balance', 'Spell. Target foe loses one enchantment. If you have more enchantments than target foe, this skill has no effect.', 'Spell. Removes one enchantment from target foe. No effect if you have more enchantments than this foe.'),
  (878, 'Visions of Regret', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 10 seconds, target foe and adjacent foes take 15...45 damage whenever they use a skill and 5...50 additional damage if not under the effects of another Mesmer hex.', 'Elite Hex Spell. Also hexes foes adjacent to target (10 seconds). These foes take 15...45 damage whenever they use a skill and 5...50 additional damage if not under the effects of another Mesmer hex.', 'Visions of Regret (PvP)', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 10 seconds, target foe and adjacent foes take 10...30 damage whenever they use a skill and 5...40 additional damage if not under the effects of another Mesmer hex.', 'Elite Hex Spell. Also hexes foes adjacent to target (10 seconds). These foes take 10...30 damage whenever they use a skill and 5...40 additional damage if not under the effects of another Mesmer hex.'),
  (879, 'Illusion of Pain', 'Hex Spell. For 8 seconds, target foe has -3...10 Health degeneration and takes 3...10 damage each second. When Illusion of Pain ends, that foe is healed for 36...120.', 'Hex Spell. (8 seconds.) Causes -3...10 Health degeneration and target foe takes 3...10 damage each second. End effect: that foe is healed for 36...120.', 'Illusion of Pain (PvP)', 'Hex Spell. For 8 seconds, target foe has -3...10 Health degeneration and takes 3...10 damage each second. When Illusion of Pain ends or is reapplied, that foe is healed for 36...120.', 'Hex Spell. (8 seconds.) Causes -3...10 Health degeneration and target foe takes 3...10 damage each second. End effect: that foe is healed for 36...120. Ends if reapplied.'),
  (880, 'Stolen Speed', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 1...10 seconds, spells cast by the target foe and all adjacent foes take 100% longer to cast. Spells targeting these foes that are cast by you or your allies take 50% less time to cast.', 'Elite Hex Spell. Also hexes adjacent foes (1...10 seconds). Doubles spell casting time. Spells cast by you or your allies on hexed foes have -50% casting time.', 'Stolen Speed (PvP)', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 1...10 seconds, spells cast by the target foe and all adjacent foes take 100% longer to cast. Spells you cast that target these foes take 50% less time to cast.', 'Elite Hex Spell. Also hexes adjacent foes (1...10 seconds). Doubles spell casting time. Spells you cast on hexed foes have -50% casting time.'),
  (881, 'Ether Signet', 'Signet. If you have less than 5...10 Energy, gain 10...20 Energy.', 'Signet. You gain 10...20 Energy. No effect unless you have less than 5...10 Energy.', 'Ether Signet', 'Signet. If you have less than 5...10 Energy, gain 10...20 Energy.', 'Signet. You gain 10...20 Energy. No effect unless you have less than 5...10 Energy.'),
  (882, 'Signet of Disenchantment', 'Signet. Lose all Energy. Target foe loses one enchantment.', 'Signet. Removes one enchantment. You lose all Energy.', 'Signet of Disenchantment', 'Signet. Lose all Energy. Target foe loses one enchantment.', 'Signet. Removes one enchantment. You lose all Energy.'),
  (883, 'Vocal Minority', 'Hex Spell. For 5...20 seconds, target foe and all nearby foes cannot use shouts or chants.', 'Hex Spell. Also hexes foes near target (5...20 seconds). These foes cannot use shouts or chants.', 'Vocal Minority', 'Hex Spell. For 5...20 seconds, target foe and all nearby foes cannot use shouts or chants.', 'Hex Spell. Also hexes foes near target (5...20 seconds). These foes cannot use shouts or chants.'),
  (884, 'Searing Flames', 'Elite Spell. Target foe and all nearby foes are struck with Searing Flames. Foes already on fire when this skill is cast are struck for 10...100 fire damage. Foes not already on fire begin Burning for 1...7 seconds.', 'Elite Spell. Hits foes near your target. Deals 10...100 fire damage to foes already Burning. Inflicts Burning condition (1...7 seconds) to foes not Burning.', 'Searing Flames', 'Elite Spell. Target foe and all nearby foes are struck with Searing Flames. Foes already on fire when this skill is cast are struck for 10...100 fire damage. Foes not already on fire begin Burning for 1...7 seconds.', 'Elite Spell. Hits foes near your target. Deals 10...100 fire damage to foes already Burning. Inflicts Burning condition (1...7 seconds) to foes not Burning.'),
  (885, 'Shield Guardian', 'Enchantment Spell. For 2...6 seconds, all party members in earshot have a 75% chance to block attacks. If an attack is blocked, all allies in earshot are healed for 10...40 Health and Shield Guardian ends.', 'Enchantment Spell. (2...6 seconds). Party members in earshot have a 75% chance to block attacks. Block effect: Allies in earshot are healed for 10...40 and Shield Guardian ends.', 'Shield Guardian (PvP)', 'Enchantment Spell. For 1...4 seconds, all party members in earshot have a 75% chance to block attacks. If an attack is blocked, all allies in earshot are healed for 10...35 Health and Shield Guardian ends.', 'Enchantment Spell. (1...4 seconds). Party members in earshot have a 75% chance to block attacks. Block effect: Allies in earshot are healed for 10...35 and Shield Guardian ends.'),
  (886, 'Restful Breeze', 'Enchantment Spell. For 8...18 seconds, target ally has +10 Health regeneration. This enchantment ends if that ally attacks or uses a skill.', 'Enchantment Spell. (8...18 seconds.) +10 Health regeneration. Ends if target ally attacks or uses a skill.', 'Restful Breeze', 'Enchantment Spell. For 8...18 seconds, target ally has +10 Health regeneration. This enchantment ends if that ally attacks or uses a skill.', 'Enchantment Spell. (8...18 seconds.) +10 Health regeneration. Ends if target ally attacks or uses a skill.'),
  (887, 'Signet of Rejuvenation', 'Signet. Heal target ally for 15...75. If target ally is casting a spell or attacking, that ally is healed for an additional 15...75 Health.', 'Signet. Heals for 15...75. Heals for 15...75 more if target ally is casting a spell or attacking.', 'Signet of Rejuvenation', 'Signet. Heal target ally for 15...75. If target ally is casting a spell or attacking, that ally is healed for an additional 15...75 Health.', 'Signet. Heals for 15...75. Heals for 15...75 more if target ally is casting a spell or attacking.'),
  (888, 'Whirling Axe', 'Elite Axe Attack. If Whirling Axe hits, you strike for +5...20 damage and any stance being used by your target ends. This attack cannot be blocked.', 'Elite Axe Attack. Deals +5...20 damage and removes a stance. Unblockable.', 'Whirling Axe', 'Elite Axe Attack. If Whirling Axe hits, you strike for +5...20 damage and any stance being used by your target ends. This attack cannot be blocked.', 'Elite Axe Attack. Deals +5...20 damage and removes a stance. Unblockable.'),
  (889, 'Forceful Blow', 'Elite Hammer Attack. If Forceful Blow hits, you strike for +10...30 damage and any stance being used by target foe ends. Target foe suffers from Weakness for 5...20 seconds. This attack cannot be blocked.', 'Elite Hammer Attack. Deals +10...30 damage. Removes target foe''s stance. Inflicts Weakness condition (5...20 seconds). Unblockable.', 'Forceful Blow', 'Elite Hammer Attack. If Forceful Blow hits, you strike for +10...30 damage and any stance being used by target foe ends. Target foe suffers from Weakness for 5...20 seconds. This attack cannot be blocked.', 'Elite Hammer Attack. Deals +10...30 damage. Removes target foe''s stance. Inflicts Weakness condition (5...20 seconds). Unblockable.'),
  (891, '"None Shall Pass!"', 'Shout. All nearby foes that are moving are knocked down. This skill recharges 1...8 seconds faster for each foe knocked down (maximum 25 seconds).', 'Shout. Knocks down all nearby moving foes. Recharges 1...8 seconds faster for each affected foe (maximum 25 seconds).', '"None Shall Pass!"', 'Shout. All nearby foes that are moving are knocked down. This skill recharges 1...8 seconds faster for each foe knocked down (maximum 25 seconds).', 'Shout. Knocks down all nearby moving foes. Recharges 1...8 seconds faster for each affected foe (maximum 25 seconds).'),
  (892, 'Quivering Blade', 'Elite Sword Attack. If Quivering Blade hits, you strike for +10...40 damage. If this attack hits a moving foe, that foe is Dazed for 10 seconds.', 'Elite Sword Attack. Deals +10...40 damage. Inflicts Dazed condition (10 seconds) if target foe was moving.', 'Quivering Blade', 'Elite Sword Attack. If Quivering Blade hits, you strike for +10...40 damage. If this attack hits a moving foe, that foe is Dazed for 10 seconds.', 'Elite Sword Attack. Deals +10...40 damage. Inflicts Dazed condition (10 seconds) if target foe was moving.'),
  (893, 'Seeking Arrows', 'Preparation. For 3...14 seconds, your arrows cannot be blocked. Seeking Arrows ends if you fail to hit.', 'Preparation. (3...14 seconds.) Your arrows are unblockable. Ends if you fail to hit.', 'Seeking Arrows', 'Preparation. For 3...14 seconds, your arrows cannot be blocked. Seeking Arrows ends if you fail to hit.', 'Preparation. (3...14 seconds.) Your arrows are unblockable. Ends if you fail to hit.'),
  (898, 'Overload', 'Hex Spell. For 5 seconds, target foe suffers -1...3 Health degeneration. If target foe is using a skill, Overload deals 15...75 damage to that foe and 75% of that damage to all adjacent foes.', 'Hex Spell. (5 seconds.) Causes -1...3 Health degeneration. If target foe is using a skill, that foe takes 15...75 damage and all adjacent foes take 75% of that damage.', 'Overload', 'Hex Spell. For 5 seconds, target foe suffers -1...3 Health degeneration. If target foe is using a skill, Overload deals 15...75 damage to that foe and 75% of that damage to all adjacent foes.', 'Hex Spell. (5 seconds.) Causes -1...3 Health degeneration. If target foe is using a skill, that foe takes 15...75 damage and all adjacent foes take 75% of that damage.'),
  (899, 'Images of Remorse', 'Hex Spell. For 5...10 seconds, target foe suffers -1...3 Health degeneration. If that foe was attacking, that foe takes 10...52 damage.', 'Hex Spell. (5...10 seconds.) Causes -1...3 Health degeneration. Initial effect: 10...52 damage if target foe is attacking.', 'Images of Remorse', 'Hex Spell. For 5...10 seconds, target foe suffers -1...3 Health degeneration. If that foe was attacking, that foe takes 10...52 damage.', 'Hex Spell. (5...10 seconds.) Causes -1...3 Health degeneration. Initial effect: 10...52 damage if target foe is attacking.'),
  (900, 'Shared Burden', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 5...20 seconds, target foe and all foes in the area attack, cast spells, and move 50% slower.', 'Elite Hex Spell. Also hexes foes in the area of your target (5...20 seconds). These foes attack, cast spells, and move 50% slower.', 'Shared Burden (PvP)', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 5...20 seconds, target foe and all foes in the area attack, cast spells, and move 33% slower.', 'Elite Hex Spell. Also hexes foes in the area of your target (5...20 seconds). These foes attack, cast spells, and move 33% slower.'),
  (901, 'Soul Bind', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 30 seconds, every time target foe is healed, the healer takes 20...80 damage. This hex ends if target is suffering from a Smiting Prayers hex.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (30 seconds.) Every time target foe is healed, the healer takes 20...80 damage. Ends if target is suffering from a Smiting Prayers hex.', 'Soul Bind', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 30 seconds, every time target foe is healed, the healer takes 20...80 damage. This hex ends if target is suffering from a Smiting Prayers hex.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (30 seconds.) Every time target foe is healed, the healer takes 20...80 damage. Ends if target is suffering from a Smiting Prayers hex.'),
  (902, 'Blood of the Aggressor', 'Spell. Steal up to 5...45 Health from target foe. If that foe was attacking, that foe suffers Weakness for 3...12 seconds.', 'Spell. Steals 5...45 Health. Inflicts Weakness (3...12 seconds) if target foe was attacking.', 'Blood of the Aggressor', 'Spell. Steal up to 5...45 Health from target foe. If that foe was attacking, that foe suffers Weakness for 3...12 seconds.', 'Spell. Steals 5...45 Health. Inflicts Weakness (3...12 seconds) if target foe was attacking.'),
  (903, 'Icy Prism', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 15...75 cold damage. If that foe has a Water Magic hex, Icy Prism deals +15...75 cold damage to all other nearby foes.', 'Spell. Deals 15...75 cold damage. Deals +15...75 cold damage to other nearby foes if target has a Water Magic hex.', 'Icy Prism', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 15...75 cold damage. If that foe has a Water Magic hex, Icy Prism deals +15...75 cold damage to all other nearby foes.', 'Spell. Deals 15...75 cold damage. Deals +15...75 cold damage to other nearby foes if target has a Water Magic hex.'),
  (904, 'Furious Axe', 'Axe Attack. If Furious Axe hits, you strike for +5...35 damage. If it is blocked you gain 3 strikes worth of adrenaline.', 'Axe Attack. Deals +5...35 damage. Gives you 3 strikes of adrenaline if blocked.', 'Furious Axe', 'Axe Attack. If Furious Axe hits, you strike for +5...35 damage. If it is blocked you gain 3 strikes worth of adrenaline.', 'Axe Attack. Deals +5...35 damage. Gives you 3 strikes of adrenaline if blocked.'),
  (905, 'Auspicious Blow', 'Hammer Attack. If Auspicious Blow hits, you strike for +5...20 damage and gain 3...8 Energy. If target foe is suffering from Weakness, this attack is unblockable.', 'Hammer Attack. Deals +5...20 damage and you gain 3...8 Energy. Unblockable if target foe is Weakened.', 'Auspicious Blow (PvP)', 'Hammer Attack. If Auspicious Blow hits, you strike for +5...20 damage and gain 2...4 Energy. If target foe is suffering from Weakness, this attack is unblockable.', 'Hammer Attack. Deals +5...20 damage and you gain 2...4 Energy. Unblockable if target foe is Weakened.'),
  (906, '"On Your Knees!"', 'Shout. Lose all adrenaline. If any adjacent foes are knocked down, all of your stances are recharged.', 'Shout. Recharges all your stances if you are adjacent to a knocked-down foe. You lose all adrenaline.', '"On Your Knees!"', 'Shout. Lose all adrenaline. If any adjacent foes are knocked down, all of your stances are recharged.', 'Shout. Recharges all your stances if you are adjacent to a knocked-down foe. You lose all adrenaline.'),
  (907, 'Dragon Slash', 'Elite Sword Attack. If Dragon Slash hits, you strike for +10...40 damage and gain 1...5 strikes of adrenaline.', 'Elite Sword Attack. Deals +10...40 damage. You gain 1...5 strikes of adrenaline if it hits.', 'Dragon Slash', 'Elite Sword Attack. If Dragon Slash hits, you strike for +10...40 damage and gain 1...5 strikes of adrenaline.', 'Elite Sword Attack. Deals +10...40 damage. You gain 1...5 strikes of adrenaline if it hits.'),
  (908, 'Marauder''s Shot', 'Bow Attack. If Marauder''s Shot hits, you strike for +25...55 damage and all your non-attack skills are disabled for 5 seconds.', 'Bow Attack. Deals +25...55 damage. Your non-attack skills are disabled (5 seconds) if this attack hits.', 'Marauder''s Shot', 'Bow Attack. If Marauder''s Shot hits, you strike for +25...55 damage and all your non-attack skills are disabled for 5 seconds.', 'Bow Attack. Deals +25...55 damage. Your non-attack skills are disabled (5 seconds) if this attack hits.'),
  (909, 'Focused Shot', 'Bow Attack. This shot moves three times faster, cannot be blocked, and strikes for +10...40 damage but all of your other attack skills are disabled for 8...4 seconds.', 'Bow Attack. Deals +10...40 damage. Unblockable. This shot moves three times faster.Your other attack skills are disabled (8...4 seconds).', 'Focused Shot', 'Bow Attack. This shot moves three times faster, cannot be blocked, and strikes for +10...40 damage but all of your other attack skills are disabled for 8...4 seconds.', 'Bow Attack. Deals +10...40 damage. Unblockable. This shot moves three times faster.Your other attack skills are disabled (8...4 seconds).'),
  (910, 'Spirit Rift', 'Spell. Open a Spirit Rift at target foe''s location. After 3 seconds, all adjacent foes are struck for 25...125 lightning damage and suffer from Cracked Armor for 1...20 seconds.', 'Spell. After 3 seconds, affects foes adjacent to target''s initial location. Deals 25...125 lightning damage and inflicts Cracked Armor (1...20 seconds).', 'Spirit Rift', 'Spell. Open a Spirit Rift at target foe''s location. After 3 seconds, all adjacent foes are struck for 25...125 lightning damage and suffer from Cracked Armor for 1...20 seconds.', 'Spell. After 3 seconds, affects foes adjacent to target''s initial location. Deals 25...125 lightning damage and inflicts Cracked Armor (1...20 seconds).'),
  (911, 'Union', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...12 spirit. Whenever a non-spirit ally in its range takes damage or life steal, it is reduced by 15 and the spirit takes 15 damage. This spirit dies after 30...60 seconds.', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...12 spirit (30...60 second lifespan). Whenever a non-spirit ally within range takes damage or life steal, it is reduced by 15 and the spirit takes 15 damage.', 'Union (PvP)', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...8 spirit. Whenever a non-spirit ally in its range takes damage or life steal, it is reduced by 15 and the spirit takes 15 damage. This spirit dies after 30...60 seconds.', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...8 spirit (30...60 second lifespan). Whenever a non-spirit ally within range takes damage or life steal, it is reduced by 15 and the spirit takes 15 damage.'),
  (913, 'Tranquil Was Tanasen', 'Elite Item Spell. Hold Tanasen''s ashes for up to 5...20 seconds. While you hold his ashes, you have +10...25 armor and cannot be interrupted.', 'Elite Item Spell. (5...20 seconds.) You have +10...25 armor. You cannot be interrupted.', 'Tranquil Was Tanasen', 'Elite Item Spell. Hold Tanasen''s ashes for up to 5...20 seconds. While you hold his ashes, you have +10...25 armor and cannot be interrupted.', 'Elite Item Spell. (5...20 seconds.) You have +10...25 armor. You cannot be interrupted.'),
  (914, 'Consume Soul', 'Elite Spell. You steal 5...70 Health from target foe. All hostile summoned creatures in earshot of that foe take 25...125 damage.', 'Elite Spell. Steals 5...70 Health. Deal 25...125 damage to hostile summoned creatures within earshot of target foe.', 'Consume Soul', 'Elite Spell. You steal 5...70 Health from target foe. All hostile summoned creatures in earshot of that foe take 25...125 damage.', 'Elite Spell. Steals 5...70 Health. Deal 25...125 damage to hostile summoned creatures within earshot of target foe.'),
  (915, 'Spirit Light', 'Spell. Target ally is healed for 60...180. If any spirits are within earshot, you don''t sacrifice Health.', 'Spell. Heals for 60...180. You don''t sacrifice Health if you are within earshot of any spirits.', 'Spirit Light', 'Spell. Target ally is healed for 60...180. If any spirits are within earshot, you don''t sacrifice Health.', 'Spell. Heals for 60...180. You don''t sacrifice Health if you are within earshot of any spirits.'),
  (916, 'Lamentation', 'Hex Spell. For 5...20 seconds, target foe and all nearby foes suffer -0...3 Health degeneration. When this hex is applied, these foes take 10...50 damage if you are within earshot of a spirit or corpse.', 'Hex Spell. Also hexes foes near target (5...20 seconds). Causes -0...3 Health degeneration. Initial effect: deals 10...50 damage to these foes if you are within earshot of a spirit or corpse.', 'Lamentation', 'Hex Spell. For 5...20 seconds, target foe and all nearby foes suffer -0...3 Health degeneration. When this hex is applied, these foes take 10...50 damage if you are within earshot of a spirit or corpse.', 'Hex Spell. Also hexes foes near target (5...20 seconds). Causes -0...3 Health degeneration. Initial effect: deals 10...50 damage to these foes if you are within earshot of a spirit or corpse.'),
  (917, 'Rupture Soul', 'Spell. Target allied spirit is destroyed. All nearby enemies are struck for 50...140 lightning damage and become blinded for 3...12 seconds.', 'Spell. Destroys target allied spirit. Deals 50...140 lightning damage and inflicts Blindness condition (3...12 seconds) to nearby foes.', 'Rupture Soul', 'Spell. Target allied spirit is destroyed. All nearby enemies are struck for 50...140 lightning damage and become blinded for 3...12 seconds.', 'Spell. Destroys target allied spirit. Deals 50...140 lightning damage and inflicts Blindness condition (3...12 seconds) to nearby foes.'),
  (918, 'Spirit to Flesh', 'Spell. Target touched allied spirit is destroyed. All nearby allies are healed for 30...240.', 'Touch Spell. Destroys target touched allied spirit. Heals nearby allies for 30...240.', 'Spirit to Flesh', 'Spell. Target touched allied spirit is destroyed. All nearby allies are healed for 30...240.', 'Touch Spell. Destroys target touched allied spirit. Heals nearby allies for 30...240.'),
  (919, 'Spirit Burn', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 5...50 lightning damage. If any spirits are within earshot, Spirit Burn causes Burning for 1...5 seconds.', 'Spell. Deals 5...50 lightning damage. Inflicts Burning condition (1...5 seconds) if you are within earshot of a spirit.', 'Spirit Burn', 'Spell. Target foe is struck for 5...50 lightning damage. If any spirits are within earshot, Spirit Burn causes Burning for 1...5 seconds.', 'Spell. Deals 5...50 lightning damage. Inflicts Burning condition (1...5 seconds) if you are within earshot of a spirit.'),
  (920, 'Destruction', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...14 Spirit that dies after 30 seconds. When this Spirit dies, all foes in the area take 5...25 damage for each second the Spirit was alive (maximum 150 damage).', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...14 Spirit that dies after 30 seconds. When this Spirit dies, all foes in the area take 5...25 damage for each second the Spirit was alive (maximum 150 damage).', 'Destruction (PvP)', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...10 Spirit that dies after 30 seconds. When this Spirit dies, all foes in the area take 1...10 damage for each second the Spirit was alive (maximum of 150 damage).', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30 second lifespan). On death, it deals 1...10 damage for each second it was alive to all foes in the area (maximum 150 damage).'),
  (921, 'Dissonance', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...12 spirit. This spirit deals 5...20 damage and anyone struck by its attack is interrupted. This spirit dies after 10...25 seconds.', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...12 spirit (10...25 second lifespan). Its attacks deal 5...20 damage and interrupt actions.', 'Dissonance (PvP)', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...8 spirit. This spirit deals 5...20 damage and anyone struck by its attack is interrupted. This spirit dies after 10...25 seconds.', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...8 spirit (10...25 second lifespan). Its attacks deal 5...20 damage and interrupt actions.'),
  (923, 'Disenchantment', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...12 spirit. This spirit deals 5...20 damage and anyone struck by its attack loses one enchantment. This spirit dies after 10...35 seconds.', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...12 spirit (10...35 second lifespan). Its attacks deal 5...20 damage and remove one enchantment.', 'Disenchantment (PvP)', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...8 spirit. This spirit deals 5...20 damage and anyone struck by its attack loses one enchantment. This spirit dies after 15...40 seconds.', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...8 spirit (15...40 second lifespan). Its attacks deal 5...20 damage and remove one enchantment.'),
  (925, 'Recall', 'Enchantment Spell. While you maintain Recall, nothing happens. When Recall ends, you Shadow Step to the ally you targeted when you activated this skill, and all of your skills are disabled for 3 seconds.', 'Enchantment Spell. End effect: Shadow Step to target ally. Cannot self-target and disables all of your skills for 3 seconds when it ends.', 'Recall', 'Enchantment Spell. While you maintain Recall, nothing happens. When Recall ends, you Shadow Step to the ally you targeted when you activated this skill, and all of your skills are disabled for 3 seconds.', 'Enchantment Spell. End effect: Shadow Step to target ally. Cannot self-target and disables all of your skills for 3 seconds when it ends.'),
  (926, 'Sharpen Daggers', 'Enchantment Spell. For 5...30 seconds, your dagger attacks cause Bleeding for 5...15 seconds.', 'Enchantment Spell. (5...30 seconds.) Your dagger attacks inflict the Bleeding condition (5...15 seconds).', 'Sharpen Daggers', 'Enchantment Spell. For 5...30 seconds, your dagger attacks cause Bleeding for 5...15 seconds.', 'Enchantment Spell. (5...30 seconds.) Your dagger attacks inflict the Bleeding condition (5...15 seconds).'),
  (927, 'Shameful Fear', 'Hex Spell. For 10 seconds, target foe moves 10% faster than normal. For each second, if that foe is moving, that foe takes 5...20 damage.', 'Hex Spell. (10 seconds.) Target foe takes 5...20 damage each second while moving, but moves 10% faster.', 'Shameful Fear', 'Hex Spell. For 10 seconds, target foe moves 10% faster than normal. For each second, if that foe is moving, that foe takes 5...20 damage.', 'Hex Spell. (10 seconds.) Target foe takes 5...20 damage each second while moving, but moves 10% faster.'),
  (928, 'Shadow Shroud', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 3...9 seconds, target foe cannot be the target of enchantments.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (3...9 seconds.) Target foe cannot be the target of enchantments.', 'Shadow Shroud (PvP)', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 2...7 seconds, target foe cannot be the target of enchantments.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (2...7 seconds.) Target foe cannot be the target of enchantments.'),
  (929, 'Shadow of Haste', 'Stance. For 10...40 seconds you move 15% faster than normal. When Shadow of Haste ends, you Shadow Step to your original location.', 'Stance. (10...40 seconds.) You move 15% faster. End effect: return to your original location.', 'Shadow of Haste', 'Stance. For 10...40 seconds you move 15% faster than normal. When Shadow of Haste ends, you Shadow Step to your original location.', 'Stance. (10...40 seconds.) You move 15% faster. End effect: return to your original location.'),
  (930, 'Auspicious Incantation', 'Enchantment Spell. For 20 seconds, the next spell you cast is disabled for an additional 10...5 seconds, and you gain 110...200% of that spell''s Energy cost.', 'Enchantment Spell. (20 seconds.) Your next spell gives you 110...200% of its Energy cost. That spell takes 10...5 seconds longer to recharge.', 'Auspicious Incantation', 'Enchantment Spell. For 20 seconds, the next spell you cast is disabled for an additional 10...5 seconds, and you gain 110...200% of that spell''s Energy cost.', 'Enchantment Spell. (20 seconds.) Your next spell gives you 110...200% of its Energy cost. That spell takes 10...5 seconds longer to recharge.'),
  (931, 'Power Return', 'Spell. If target foe is casting a spell or chant, that skill is interrupted and target foe gains 10...5 Energy.', 'Spell. Interrupts a spell or chant. Interruption effect: target foe gains 10...5 Energy.', 'Power Return', 'Spell. If target foe is casting a spell or chant, that skill is interrupted and target foe gains 10...5 Energy.', 'Spell. Interrupts a spell or chant. Interruption effect: target foe gains 10...5 Energy.'),
  (932, 'Complicate', 'Spell. If target foe is using a skill, that skill is interrupted and disabled for target foe and all foes in the area for an additional 5...12 seconds.', 'Spell. Interrupts a skill. Interruption effect: disables interrupted skill (+5...12 seconds) for target foe and all foes in the area.', 'Complicate', 'Spell. If target foe is using a skill, that skill is interrupted and disabled for target foe and all foes in the area for an additional 5...12 seconds.', 'Spell. Interrupts a skill. Interruption effect: disables interrupted skill (+5...12 seconds) for target foe and all foes in the area.'),
  (933, 'Shatter Storm', 'Elite Spell. Target foe loses all enchantments. For each enchantment removed this way, Shatter Storm is disabled for an additional 7 seconds.', 'Elite Spell. Removes all enchantments. Removal cost: Shatter Storm is disabled for +7 seconds for each enchantment removed.', 'Shatter Storm', 'Elite Spell. Target foe loses all enchantments. For each enchantment removed this way, Shatter Storm is disabled for an additional 7 seconds.', 'Elite Spell. Removes all enchantments. Removal cost: Shatter Storm is disabled for +7 seconds for each enchantment removed.'),
  (934, 'Unnatural Signet', 'Signet. Target foe takes 15...75 damage. If that foe is under the effects of a hex or enchantment, foes adjacent to your target take 5...50 damage.', 'Signet. Deals 15...75 damage. Deals 5...50 damage to other adjacent foes if the target is hexed or enchanted.', 'Unnatural Signet (PvP)', 'Signet. Target foe takes 10...60 damage. If that foe is under the effects of a hex or enchantment, foes adjacent to your target take 10...60 damage. All your non-Mesmer skills except signets are disabled for 10 seconds.', 'Signet. Deals 10...60 damage. Deals 10...60 damage to other adjacent foes if the target is hexed or enchanted. Your non-Mesmer skills except signets are disabled (10 seconds).'),
  (935, 'Rising Bile', 'Hex Spell. For 20 seconds, this hex does nothing. When Rising Bile ends, that foe and all foes in the area take 1...6 damage for each second Rising Bile was in effect.', 'Hex Spell. (20 seconds.) End effect: deals 1...6 damage for each second Rising Bile was in effect. Also damages other foes in the area.', 'Rising Bile', 'Hex Spell. For 20 seconds, this hex does nothing. When Rising Bile ends, that foe and all foes in the area take 1...6 damage for each second Rising Bile was in effect.', 'Hex Spell. (20 seconds.) End effect: deals 1...6 damage for each second Rising Bile was in effect. Also damages other foes in the area.'),
  (936, 'Envenom Enchantments', 'Spell. Target foe loses one enchantment. For every remaining enchantment, target foe is poisoned for 3...10 seconds.', 'Spell. Removes one enchantment from target foe. Inflicts Poisoned condition (3...10 seconds for each remaining enchantment on that foe).', 'Envenom Enchantments', 'Spell. Target foe loses one enchantment. For every remaining enchantment, target foe is poisoned for 3...10 seconds.', 'Spell. Removes one enchantment from target foe. Inflicts Poisoned condition (3...10 seconds for each remaining enchantment on that foe).'),
  (937, 'Shockwave', 'Elite Spell. All foes in the area take 15...60 earth damage and are Weakened for 1...10 seconds. Nearby foes also take +15...60 earth damage and have Cracked Armor for 1...10 seconds. Adjacent foes suffer the previous effects, take +15...60 earth damage, and are Blinded for 1...10 seconds.', 'Elite Spell. Foes in the area take 15...60 earth damage and are Weakened (1...10 seconds). Nearby foes also take +15...60 earth damage and have Cracked Armor (1...10 seconds). Adjacent foes also take +15...60 earth damage and are Blinded (1...10 seconds).', 'Shockwave', 'Elite Spell. All foes in the area take 15...60 earth damage and are Weakened for 1...10 seconds. Nearby foes also take +15...60 earth damage and have Cracked Armor for 1...10 seconds. Adjacent foes suffer the previous effects, take +15...60 earth damage, and are Blinded for 1...10 seconds.', 'Elite Spell. Foes in the area take 15...60 earth damage and are Weakened (1...10 seconds). Nearby foes also take +15...60 earth damage and have Cracked Armor (1...10 seconds). Adjacent foes also take +15...60 earth damage and are Blinded (1...10 seconds).'),
  (938, 'Ward of Stability', 'Ward Spell. Create a Ward of Stability at your current location. For 10...25 seconds, non-spirit allies cannot be knocked down.', 'Ward Spell. (10...25 seconds.) Allies in this ward cannot be knocked-down. Allied spirits are not affected.', 'Ward of Stability', 'Ward Spell. Create a Ward of Stability at your current location. For 10...25 seconds, non-spirit allies cannot be knocked down.', 'Ward Spell. (10...25 seconds.) Allies in this ward cannot be knocked-down. Allied spirits are not affected.'),
  (939, 'Icy Shackles', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 1...10 seconds, target foe''s movement speed is reduced by 66%. While under the effects of an enchantment, that foe''s movement is reduced by 90%.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (1...10 seconds.) Target foe moves 66% slower. This foe moves 90% slower if enchanted.', 'Icy Shackles', 'Elite Hex Spell. For 1...10 seconds, target foe''s movement speed is reduced by 66%. While under the effects of an enchantment, that foe''s movement is reduced by 90%.', 'Elite Hex Spell. (1...10 seconds.) Target foe moves 66% slower. This foe moves 90% slower if enchanted.'),
  (941, 'Blessed Light', 'Elite Spell. Heal target ally for 10...120 Health and remove one condition and one hex.', 'Elite Spell. Heals for 10...120. Removes one condition and one hex.', 'Blessed Light', 'Elite Spell. Heal target ally for 10...120 Health and remove one condition and one hex.', 'Elite Spell. Heals for 10...120. Removes one condition and one hex.'),
  (942, 'Withdraw Hexes', 'Elite Spell. Remove all hexes from target ally and all adjacent allies. This spell takes an additional 2 seconds to recharge for each hex removed in this way. (50% failure chance with Divine Favor 4 or less.)', 'Elite Spell. Removes all hexes. Also affects adjacent allies. Removal cost: +2 seconds recharge for each hex removed. 50% failure chance unless Divine Favor 5 or more.', 'Withdraw Hexes', 'Elite Spell. Remove all hexes from target ally and all adjacent allies. This spell takes an additional 2 seconds to recharge for each hex removed in this way. (50% failure chance with Divine Favor 4 or less.)', 'Elite Spell. Removes all hexes. Also affects adjacent allies. Removal cost: +2 seconds recharge for each hex removed. 50% failure chance unless Divine Favor 5 or more.'),
  (943, 'Extinguish', 'Spell. Remove one condition from each party member. Party members relieved of Burning are healed for 10...100 Health.', 'Spell. Affects all party members. Removes one condition. Party members relieved of Burning are healed for 10...100.', 'Extinguish', 'Spell. Remove one condition from each party member. Party members relieved of Burning are healed for 10...100 Health.', 'Spell. Affects all party members. Removes one condition. Party members relieved of Burning are healed for 10...100.'),
