  (1023, 'Leaping Mantis Sting', 'Lead Attack. If Mantis Sting hits, target foe takes +5...15 damage. If this attack strikes a moving foe, that foe is Crippled for 3...15 seconds.', 'Lead Attack. Deals +5...15 damage. Inflicts Crippled condition (3...15 seconds) if target foe is moving.', 'Leaping Mantis Sting', 'Lead Attack. If Mantis Sting hits, target foe takes +5...15 damage. If this attack strikes a moving foe, that foe is Crippled for 3...15 seconds.', 'Lead Attack. Deals +5...15 damage. Inflicts Crippled condition (3...15 seconds) if target foe is moving.'),
