  (1028, 'Way of Perfection', 'Enchantment Spell. For 60 seconds, whenever you successfully land a critical hit, you gain 10...40 Health.', 'Enchantment Spell. (60 seconds.) Your critical hits heal you for 10...40.', 'Way of Perfection', 'Enchantment Spell. For 60 seconds, whenever you successfully land a critical hit, you gain 10...40 Health.', 'Enchantment Spell. (60 seconds.) Your critical hits heal you for 10...40.'),
