  (1030, 'Locust''s Fury', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 10...35 seconds, you have an additional 50% chance to double strike while using daggers.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (10...35 seconds.) You have +50% chance to double strike. No effect unless you are wielding daggers.', 'Locust''s Fury', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 10...35 seconds, you have an additional 50% chance to double strike while using daggers.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (10...35 seconds.) You have +50% chance to double strike. No effect unless you are wielding daggers.'),
