  (1037, 'Dark Escape', 'Stance. For 5...15 seconds, you move 25% faster and take half damage. Dark Escape ends if you successfully hit with an attack.', 'Stance. (5...15 seconds.) You move 25% faster and take half damage. Ends if you hit with an attack.', 'Dark Escape', 'Stance. For 5...15 seconds, you move 25% faster and take half damage. Dark Escape ends if you successfully hit with an attack.', 'Stance. (5...15 seconds.) You move 25% faster and take half damage. Ends if you hit with an attack.'),
