  (1040, 'Spirit Walk', 'Spell. Shadow Step to target spirit.', 'Spell. Shadow Step to target Spirit.', 'Spirit Walk', 'Spell. Shadow Step to target spirit.', 'Spell. Shadow Step to target Spirit.'),
