  (1081, 'Teinai''s Wind', 'Spell. Target foe and all adjacent foes take 10...40 cold damage. Burning foes struck by Teinai''s Wind take an additional 40...80 damage and are interrupted.', 'Spell. Deals 10...40 cold damage. Burning foes take +40...80 damage and are interrupted. Also strikes adjacent.', 'Teinai''s Wind', 'Spell. Target foe and all adjacent foes take 10...40 cold damage. Burning foes struck by Teinai''s Wind take an additional 40...80 damage and are interrupted.', 'Spell. Deals 10...40 cold damage. Burning foes take +40...80 damage and are interrupted. Also strikes adjacent.'),
  (1082, 'Shock Arrow', 'Spell. Send out a Shock Arrow that flies swiftly toward target foe, striking for 5...50 lightning damage. If Shock Arrow strikes a foe suffering from Cracked Armor, you gain 5 Energy plus 1 Energy for every 2 ranks of Energy Storage. Shock Arrow has 25% armor penetration.', 'Spell. Rapid projectile: deals 5...50 lightning damage. Gain 5 Energy plus 1 Energy for every 2 ranks of Energy Storage if you hit a foe suffering from Cracked Armor. 25% armor penetration.', 'Shock Arrow', 'Spell. Send out a Shock Arrow that flies swiftly toward target foe, striking for 5...50 lightning damage. If Shock Arrow strikes a foe suffering from Cracked Armor, you gain 5 Energy plus 1 Energy for every 2 ranks of Energy Storage. Shock Arrow has 25% armor penetration.', 'Spell. Rapid projectile: deals 5...50 lightning damage. Gain 5 Energy plus 1 Energy for every 2 ranks of Energy Storage if you hit a foe suffering from Cracked Armor. 25% armor penetration.'),
  (1083, 'Unsteady Ground', 'Elite Spell. You create Unsteady Ground at target foe''s location. For 5 seconds, nearby foes take 10...40 earth damage each second. Attacking foes struck by Unsteady Ground are knocked down.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 10...40 earth damage each second (5 seconds) and causes knock-down to attacking foes. Hits foes near target''s initial location.', 'Unsteady Ground', 'Elite Spell. You create Unsteady Ground at target foe''s location. For 5 seconds, nearby foes take 10...40 earth damage each second. Attacking foes struck by Unsteady Ground are knocked down.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 10...40 earth damage each second (5 seconds) and causes knock-down to attacking foes. Hits foes near target''s initial location.'),
  (1084, 'Sliver Armor', 'Enchantment Spell. For 5...11 seconds, you have 25...50% chance to block attacks and whenever you are the target of a hostile spell or attack one nearby foe is struck for 5...35 earth damage.', 'Enchantment Spell. (5...11 seconds.) You have 25...50% chance to block. Deals 5...35 earth damage to one nearby foe whenever you are the target of a hostile spell or attack.', 'Sliver Armor', 'Enchantment Spell. For 5...11 seconds, you have 25...50% chance to block attacks and whenever you are the target of a hostile spell or attack one nearby foe is struck for 5...35 earth damage.', 'Enchantment Spell. (5...11 seconds.) You have 25...50% chance to block. Deals 5...35 earth damage to one nearby foe whenever you are the target of a hostile spell or attack.'),
  (1085, 'Ash Blast', 'Hex Spell. Target and adjacent foes are struck for 35...65 earth damage. Burning foes struck by Ash Blast are hexed for 5 seconds and have a 20...75% chance to miss with attacks.', 'Hex Spell. Deals 35...65 earth damage. Burning foes are hexed for 5 seconds and miss 20...75% of attacks. Also strikes adjacent.', 'Ash Blast', 'Hex Spell. Target and adjacent foes are struck for 35...65 earth damage. Burning foes struck by Ash Blast are hexed for 5 seconds and have a 20...75% chance to miss with attacks.', 'Hex Spell. Deals 35...65 earth damage. Burning foes are hexed for 5 seconds and miss 20...75% of attacks. Also strikes adjacent.'),
  (1086, 'Dragon''s Stomp', 'Spell. You invoke a Dragon''s Stomp at target foe''s location. All foes near this location are knocked down and are struck for 26...100 earth damage.', 'Spell. Deals 26...100 earth damage. Causes knock-down. Also hits foes near this foe.', 'Dragon''s Stomp', 'Spell. You invoke a Dragon''s Stomp at target foe''s location. All foes near this location are knocked down and are struck for 26...100 earth damage.', 'Spell. Deals 26...100 earth damage. Causes knock-down. Also hits foes near this foe.'),
  (1088, 'Second Wind', 'Elite Spell. You gain 1 Energy and 5 Health for each point of Energy restricted by Overcast. You lose all enchantments.', 'Elite Spell. You gain 1 Energy and 5 Health for each point of Overcast. You lose all enchantments.', 'Second Wind', 'Elite Spell. You gain 1 Energy and 5 Health for each point of Energy restricted by Overcast. You lose all enchantments.', 'Elite Spell. You gain 1 Energy and 5 Health for each point of Overcast. You lose all enchantments.'),
  (1090, 'Smoldering Embers', 'Hex Spell. Target foe is struck for 10...70 fire damage. If you are Overcast, that foe is hexed with Smoldering Embers for 3 seconds and takes 5...25 additional fire damage each second.', 'Hex Spell. Deals 10...70 fire damage to target. If you are Overcast, foe is hexed for 3 seconds, taking 5...25 fire damage each second.', 'Smoldering Embers', 'Hex Spell. Target foe is struck for 10...70 fire damage. If you are Overcast, that foe is hexed with Smoldering Embers for 3 seconds and takes 5...25 additional fire damage each second.', 'Hex Spell. Deals 10...70 fire damage to target. If you are Overcast, foe is hexed for 3 seconds, taking 5...25 fire damage each second.'),
  (1091, 'Double Dragon', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Invoke the power of the Dragon. For 8 seconds, you and target ally are enchanted with Double Dragon. Adjacent foes are dealt 10...40 fire damage each second. Additionally, when you or your ally use skills that target a foe, that foe is set on fire for 1...4 seconds.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (8 seconds.) Enchants you and target ally. Adjacent foes take 10...40 fire damage each second. Skills that target a foe also inflict Burning (1...4 seconds).', 'Double Dragon', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Invoke the power of the Dragon. For 8 seconds, you and target ally are enchanted with Double Dragon. Adjacent foes are dealt 10...40 fire damage each second. Additionally, when you or your ally use skills that target a foe, that foe is set on fire for 1...4 seconds.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (8 seconds.) Enchants you and target ally. Adjacent foes take 10...40 fire damage each second. Skills that target a foe also inflict Burning (1...4 seconds).'),
  (1093, 'Teinai''s Heat', 'Ward Spell. Place a ward of Teinai''s Heat at your location for 10...15 seconds. Foes within the ward suffer 2...5 health degeneration. Weakened foes attack 33% slower. This skill is disabled for 20 seconds.', 'Ward Spell. (10...15 seconds.) Causes -2...5 health degeneration. Weakened foes in the ward attack 33% slower. Disabled for 20 seconds.', 'Teinai''s Heat', 'Ward Spell. Place a ward of Teinai''s Heat at your location for 10...15 seconds. Foes within the ward suffer 2...5 health degeneration. Weakened foes attack 33% slower. This skill is disabled for 20 seconds.', 'Ward Spell. (10...15 seconds.) Causes -2...5 health degeneration. Weakened foes in the ward attack 33% slower. Disabled for 20 seconds.'),
  (1094, 'Breath of Fire', 'Spell. Create Breath of Fire at target foe''s current location. For 5 seconds, foes adjacent to that location are struck for 10...40 fire damage each second.', 'Spell. Deals 10...40 fire damage each second (5 seconds). Hits foes adjacent to target''s initial location.', 'Breath of Fire', 'Spell. Create Breath of Fire at target foe''s current location. For 5 seconds, foes adjacent to that location are struck for 10...40 fire damage each second.', 'Spell. Deals 10...40 fire damage each second (5 seconds). Hits foes adjacent to target''s initial location.'),
  (1095, 'Star Burst', 'Elite Spell. Target touched foe and all foes in the area are struck for 7...112 fire damage and set on fire for 1...4 seconds. For each foe you hit, gain 2 Energy.', 'Elite Touch Spell. Deals 7...112 fire damage. Inflicts Burning (1...4 seconds). Gain 2 Energy for each foe struck. Also hits foes in the area.', 'Star Burst', 'Elite Spell. Target touched foe and all foes in the area are struck for 7...112 fire damage and set on fire for 1...4 seconds. For each foe you hit, gain 2 Energy.', 'Elite Touch Spell. Deals 7...112 fire damage. Inflicts Burning (1...4 seconds). Gain 2 Energy for each foe struck. Also hits foes in the area.'),
  (1096, 'Glyph of Essence', 'Glyph. For 15 seconds, your next spell casts instantly but causes you to lose all Energy.', 'Glyph. (15 seconds.) Your next spell casts instantly. You lose all Energy.', 'Glyph of Essence', 'Glyph. For 15 seconds, your next spell casts instantly but causes you to lose all Energy.', 'Glyph. (15 seconds.) Your next spell casts instantly. You lose all Energy.'),
  (1097, 'Teinai''s Prison', 'Hex Spell. For 1...8 seconds, target foe''s legs are encased in ice, causing the foe to move 66% slower. If that foe has Cracked Armor, the chill seeps through causing 5...9 Health degeneration.', 'Hex Spell. (1...8 seconds.) Target foe moves 66% slower. Foes with Cracked Armor have 5...9 Health degeneration.', 'Teinai''s Prison', 'Hex Spell. For 1...8 seconds, target foe''s legs are encased in ice, causing the foe to move 66% slower. If that foe has Cracked Armor, the chill seeps through causing 5...9 Health degeneration.', 'Hex Spell. (1...8 seconds.) Target foe moves 66% slower. Foes with Cracked Armor have 5...9 Health degeneration.'),
  (1098, 'Mirror of Ice', 'Elite Hex Spell. Shatter a Mirror of Ice. All foes near you and target ally take 15...70 cold damage and move 66% slower for 2...6 seconds. If you strike a foe hexed with Water Magic, Mirror of Ice recharges 50% faster.', 'Elite Hex Spell. Deals 15...70 cold damage and slows foes by 66% (2...6 seconds). Hits foes near you and target ally. Recharges 50% faster if it hits a foe hexed with Water Magic.', 'Mirror of Ice', 'Elite Hex Spell. Shatter a Mirror of Ice. All foes near you and target ally take 15...70 cold damage and move 66% slower for 2...6 seconds. If you strike a foe hexed with Water Magic, Mirror of Ice recharges 50% faster.', 'Elite Hex Spell. Deals 15...70 cold damage and slows foes by 66% (2...6 seconds). Hits foes near you and target ally. Recharges 50% faster if it hits a foe hexed with Water Magic.'),
  (1099, 'Teinai''s Crystals', 'Spell. Target foe takes 20...40 damage. If target foe has a Water Magic hex, this spell strikes target and nearby foes for an additional 20...40 damage, and nearby foes also suffer Cracked Armor for 5...15 seconds.', 'Spell. Deals 20...40 damage to target. Deals +20...40 more damage and causes Cracked Armor (5...15 seconds) nearby if that foe had a Water Magic hex.', 'Teinai''s Crystals', 'Spell. Target foe takes 20...40 damage. If target foe has a Water Magic hex, this spell strikes target and nearby foes for an additional 20...40 damage, and nearby foes also suffer Cracked Armor for 5...15 seconds.', 'Spell. Deals 20...40 damage to target. Deals +20...40 more damage and causes Cracked Armor (5...15 seconds) nearby if that foe had a Water Magic hex.'),
  (1113, 'Kirin''s Wrath', 'Spell. For 5 seconds, foes adjacent to the location in which the spell was cast take 8...32 holy damage each second.', 'Spell. Deals 8...32 holy damage each second (5 seconds). Hits foes adjacent to your initial location.', 'Kirin''s Wrath', 'Spell. For 5 seconds, foes adjacent to the location in which the spell was cast take 8...32 holy damage each second.', 'Spell. Deals 8...32 holy damage each second (5 seconds). Hits foes adjacent to your initial location.'),
  (1114, 'Spirit Bond', 'Enchantment Spell. For 8 seconds, whenever target ally takes more than 50 damage from the next 10 attacks or spells, that ally is healed for 30...90 Health.', 'Enchantment Spell. (8 seconds.) Heals for 30...90 whenever target ally takes more than 50 damage. Ends after this ally takes damage from 10 attacks or spells.', 'Spirit Bond (PvP)', 'Enchantment Spell. For 8 seconds, whenever target ally takes more than 50 damage from the next 10 attacks or spells, that ally is healed for 30...90 Health.', 'Enchantment Spell. (8 seconds.) Heals for 30...90 whenever target ally takes more than 50 damage. Ends after this ally takes damage from 10 attacks or spells.'),
  (1115, 'Air of Enchantment', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 4...10 seconds, enchantments cast on target other ally cost 10 less Energy (minimum 1 Energy).', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (4...10 seconds.) Enchantments cast on target ally cost 10 less Energy (minimum 1 Energy). Cannot self-target.', 'Air of Enchantment', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 4...10 seconds, enchantments cast on target other ally cost 10 less Energy (minimum 1 Energy).', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (4...10 seconds.) Enchantments cast on target ally cost 10 less Energy (minimum 1 Energy). Cannot self-target.'),
  (1117, 'Heaven''s Delight', 'Spell. Heals you and party members within earshot for 15...60 points.', 'Spell. Heals you and party members within earshot for 15...60.', 'Heaven''s Delight', 'Spell. Heals you and party members within earshot for 15...60 points.', 'Spell. Heals you and party members within earshot for 15...60.'),
  (1118, 'Healing Burst', 'Elite Spell. Target ally is healed for 20...120. All party members in earshot of your target gain Health equal to the Divine Favor bonus from this spell. Your Smiting Prayers are disabled for 20 seconds.', 'Elite Spell. Heals for 20...120. Party members in earshot of your target gain Health equal to the Divine Favor bonus. Disables your Smiting Prayers (20 seconds).', 'Healing Burst', 'Elite Spell. Target ally is healed for 20...120. All party members in earshot of your target gain Health equal to the Divine Favor bonus from this spell. Your Smiting Prayers are disabled for 20 seconds.', 'Elite Spell. Heals for 20...120. Party members in earshot of your target gain Health equal to the Divine Favor bonus. Disables your Smiting Prayers (20 seconds).'),
  (1119, 'Karei''s Healing Circle', 'Spell. Heal yourself and all adjacent creatures for 30...180 points.', 'Spell. Heals you for 30...180. Also heals adjacent creatures.', 'Karei''s Healing Circle', 'Spell. Heal yourself and all adjacent creatures for 30...180 points.', 'Spell. Heals you for 30...180. Also heals adjacent creatures.'),
  (1120, 'Jamei''s Gaze', 'Spell. Heal target other ally for 35...180 Health.', 'Spell. Heals for 35...180. Cannot self-target.', 'Jamei''s Gaze', 'Spell. Heal target other ally for 35...180 Health.', 'Spell. Heals for 35...180. Cannot self-target.'),
  (1121, 'Gift of Health', 'Spell. All of your other Healing Prayers skills are disabled for 10...5 seconds. Target other ally is healed for 15...150 Health.', 'Spell. Heals for 15...150. Disables your other Healing Prayers skills (10...5 seconds). Cannot self-target.', 'Gift of Health', 'Spell. All of your other Healing Prayers skills are disabled for 10...5 seconds. Target other ally is healed for 15...150 Health.', 'Spell. Heals for 15...150. Disables your other Healing Prayers skills (10...5 seconds). Cannot self-target.'),
  (1123, 'Life Sheath', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Remove 0...2 conditions from target ally. For 8 seconds, the next time that ally would take damage or life steal, that ally gains that amount of Health instead (maximum 20...100).', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (8 seconds.) Converts the next incoming damage or life steal (maximum 20...100) to healing. Initial effect: Removes 0...2 conditions.', 'Life Sheath', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. Remove 0...2 conditions from target ally. For 8 seconds, the next time that ally would take damage or life steal, that ally gains that amount of Health instead (maximum 20...100).', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (8 seconds.) Converts the next incoming damage or life steal (maximum 20...100) to healing. Initial effect: Removes 0...2 conditions.'),
  (1126, 'Empathic Removal', 'Elite Spell. You and target other ally lose 1 condition and 1 hex, and are healed for 50.', 'Elite Spell. Removes one condition and hex from target ally and yourself, and heals for 50. Cannot self-target.', 'Empathic Removal', 'Elite Spell. You and target other ally lose 1 condition and 1 hex, and are healed for 50.', 'Elite Spell. Removes one condition and hex from target ally and yourself, and heals for 50. Cannot self-target.'),
  (1128, 'Resurrection Chant', 'Spell. Resurrect target party member with up to your current Health and 5...35% Energy. This spell has half the normal range.', 'Half Range Spell. Resurrects target party member at your current Health and with 5...35% Energy.', 'Resurrection Chant', 'Spell. Resurrect target party member with up to your current Health and 5...35% Energy. This spell has half the normal range.', 'Half Range Spell. Resurrects target party member at your current Health and with 5...35% Energy.'),
  (1129, 'Word of Censure', 'Elite Spell. Target foe takes 30...130 holy damage. If your target was below 50% Health, Word of Censure takes 20 additional seconds to recharge.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 30...130 holy damage. +20 recharge time if target foe is below 50% Health.', 'Word of Censure', 'Elite Spell. Target foe takes 30...130 holy damage. If your target was below 50% Health, Word of Censure takes 20 additional seconds to recharge.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 30...130 holy damage. +20 recharge time if target foe is below 50% Health.'),
  (1130, 'Spear of Light', 'Spell. Spear of Light flies toward target foe and deals 26...56 holy damage if it hits. Spear of Light deals +15...60 damage if it hits an attacking foe.', 'Spell. Projectile: deals 26...56 holy damage. Deals 15...60 more damage if target foe is attacking.', 'Spear of Light', 'Spell. Spear of Light flies toward target foe and deals 26...56 holy damage if it hits. Spear of Light deals +15...60 damage if it hits an attacking foe.', 'Spell. Projectile: deals 26...56 holy damage. Deals 15...60 more damage if target foe is attacking.'),
  (1131, 'Stonesoul Strike', 'Skill. Touched target foe takes 10...55 holy damage. If knocked down, your target takes an additional 10...55 holy damage.', 'Touch Skill. Deals 10...55 holy damage. Deals 10...55 more holy damage if target foe is knocked-down.', 'Stonesoul Strike', 'Skill. Touched target foe takes 10...55 holy damage. If knocked down, your target takes an additional 10...55 holy damage.', 'Touch Skill. Deals 10...55 holy damage. Deals 10...55 more holy damage if target foe is knocked-down.'),
  (1133, 'Drunken Blow', 'Melee Attack. If this attack hits, you strike for +10...40 damage and your target suffers from one of the following conditions: Deep Wound (for 20 seconds), Weakness (for 20 seconds), Bleeding (for 25 seconds), or Crippled (for 15 seconds). After making a Drunken Blow, you are knocked down.', 'Melee Attack. Deals +10...40 damage. Inflicts one of the following random conditions: Deep Wound (20 seconds), Weakness (20 seconds), Bleeding (25 seconds), or Crippled (15 seconds). You are knocked-down.', 'Drunken Blow', 'Melee Attack. If this attack hits, you strike for +10...40 damage and your target suffers from one of the following conditions: Deep Wound (for 20 seconds), Weakness (for 20 seconds), Bleeding (for 25 seconds), or Crippled (for 15 seconds). After making a Drunken Blow, you are knocked down.', 'Melee Attack. Deals +10...40 damage. Inflicts one of the following random conditions: Deep Wound (20 seconds), Weakness (20 seconds), Bleeding (25 seconds), or Crippled (15 seconds). You are knocked-down.'),
  (1134, 'Leviathan''s Sweep', 'Melee Attack. If this attack hits, you strike for +5...20 damage. If this attack is blocked, your target is knocked down and suffers 10...34 damage.', 'Melee Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. Causes knock-down and deals 10...34 damage if blocked.', 'Leviathan''s Sweep', 'Melee Attack. If this attack hits, you strike for +5...20 damage. If this attack is blocked, your target is knocked down and suffers 10...34 damage.', 'Melee Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. Causes knock-down and deals 10...34 damage if blocked.'),
  (1135, 'Jaizhenju Strike', 'Sword Attack. If Jaizhenju Strike hits, you strike for +1...30 damage. If you are not using a stance, Jaizhenju Strike cannot be blocked.', 'Sword Attack. Deals +1...30 damage. Unblockable unless you are in a stance.', 'Jaizhenju Strike', 'Sword Attack. If Jaizhenju Strike hits, you strike for +1...30 damage. If you are not using a stance, Jaizhenju Strike cannot be blocked.', 'Sword Attack. Deals +1...30 damage. Unblockable unless you are in a stance.'),
  (1136, 'Penetrating Chop', 'Axe Attack. If this attack hits, you strike for +10...25 damage. This axe attack has 20% armor penetration.', 'Axe Attack. Deals +10...25 damage. 20% armor penetration.', 'Penetrating Chop', 'Axe Attack. If this attack hits, you strike for +10...25 damage. This axe attack has 20% armor penetration.', 'Axe Attack. Deals +10...25 damage. 20% armor penetration.'),
  (1137, 'Yeti Smash', 'Hammer Attack. Lose all adrenaline. Attack all adjacent foes. If this attack strikes a foe suffering from a condition, that foe is knocked down. (50% failure chance with Hammer Mastery 4 or less.)', 'Hammer Attack. Attack all adjacent foes. Knocks down foes suffering from a condition. You lose all adrenaline. 50% failure chance unless Hammer Mastery is 5 or more.', 'Yeti Smash', 'Hammer Attack. Lose all adrenaline. Attack all adjacent foes. If this attack strikes a foe suffering from a condition, that foe is knocked down. (50% failure chance with Hammer Mastery 4 or less.)', 'Hammer Attack. Attack all adjacent foes. Knocks down foes suffering from a condition. You lose all adrenaline. 50% failure chance unless Hammer Mastery is 5 or more.'),
  (1141, '"You Will Die!"', 'Shout. If target foe is below 90% Health, you gain 1...3 strikes of adrenaline.', 'Shout. You gain 1...3 strikes of adrenaline. No effect unless target foe is under 90% Health.', '"You Will Die!"', 'Shout. If target foe is below 90% Health, you gain 1...3 strikes of adrenaline.', 'Shout. You gain 1...3 strikes of adrenaline. No effect unless target foe is under 90% Health.'),
  (1142, 'Auspicious Parry', 'Elite Stance. For 8 seconds, the next attack against you is blocked. You gain 1...4 strikes of adrenaline when this stance ends.', 'Elite Stance. (8 seconds.) Blocks one attack. End effect: you gain 1...4 strikes of adrenaline.', 'Auspicious Parry', 'Elite Stance. For 8 seconds, the next attack against you is blocked. You gain 1...4 strikes of adrenaline when this stance ends.', 'Elite Stance. (8 seconds.) Blocks one attack. End effect: you gain 1...4 strikes of adrenaline.'),
  (1144, 'Silverwing Slash', 'Sword Attack. This attack strikes for +1...40 damage if it hits.', 'Sword Attack. Deals +1...40 damage.', 'Silverwing Slash', 'Sword Attack. This attack strikes for +1...40 damage if it hits.', 'Sword Attack. Deals +1...40 damage.'),
  (1146, 'Shove', 'Elite Skill. Target touched foe takes 15...75 damage, their stance ends, and they are knocked down.', 'Elite Touch Skill. Target touched foe takes 15...75 damage, their stance ends, and they are knocked down.', 'Shove', 'Elite Skill. Target touched foe takes 15...75 damage, their stance ends, and they are knocked down.', 'Elite Touch Skill. Target touched foe takes 15...75 damage, their stance ends, and they are knocked down.'),
  (1191, 'Sundering Attack', 'Bow Attack. If Sundering Attack hits, you strike for +5...25 damage and this attack has 10% armor penetration.', 'Bow Attack. Deals +5...25 damage. 10% armor penetration.', 'Sundering Attack (PvP)', 'Bow Attack. If Sundering Attack hits, you strike for +5...15 damage and this attack has 10% armor penetration.', 'Bow Attack. Deals +5...15 damage. 10% armor penetration.'),
  (1192, 'Zojun''s Shot', 'Bow Attack. Shoot an arrow that has half the normal range, but strikes for +10...40 damage.', 'Half Range Bow Attack. Deals +10...40 damage.', 'Zojun''s Shot', 'Bow Attack. Shoot an arrow that has half the normal range, but strikes for +10...40 damage.', 'Half Range Bow Attack. Deals +10...40 damage.'),
  (1194, 'Predatory Bond', 'Shout. For 5...20 seconds, your animal companion attacks 25% faster and heals you for 1...31 Health with each successful attack.', 'Shout. (5...20 seconds.) Your pet attacks 25% faster and you gain 1...31 Health whenever your pet makes a successful attack.', 'Predatory Bond (PvP)', 'Shout. For 5...20 seconds, successful attacks by your animal companion heal you for 1...31 Health.', 'Shout. (5...20 seconds.) You gain 1...31 Health whenever your pet makes a successful attack.'),
  (1195, 'Heal as One', 'Elite Skill. For 15 seconds, your animal companion steals 1...20 Health whenever it hits with an attack. You and your companion are both healed for 20...104 Health. If your companion is dead, it''s resurrected with 50% Health. If you have this skill equipped, your companion will travel with you.', 'Elite Skill. (15 seconds.) Your pet''s attacks steal 1...20 Health. Initial effect: heals you and your pet for 20...104; resurrects your pet (50% Health) if dead. If you have this skill equipped, your pet will travel with you.', 'Heal as One (PvP)', 'Elite Skill. If you or your animal companion are below 75% Health, you are both healed for 25...145 Health. If your companion is dead, it is resurrected with 50% Health.', 'Elite Skill. Heals you and your pet for 25...145. If your pet is dead, it is resurrected with 50% Health. No effect if neither you nor your pet are below 75% Health.'),
  (1196, 'Zojun''s Haste', 'Stance. For 5...11 seconds, you move 33% faster and have a 27...75% chance to block incoming projectiles. Zojun''s Haste ends if you attack.', 'Stance. (5...11 seconds.) You move 33% faster and have 27...75% chance to block projectiles. Ends if you attack.', 'Zojun''s Haste', 'Stance. For 5...11 seconds, you move 33% faster and have a 27...75% chance to block incoming projectiles. Zojun''s Haste ends if you attack.', 'Stance. (5...11 seconds.) You move 33% faster and have 27...75% chance to block projectiles. Ends if you attack.'),
  (1197, 'Needling Shot', 'Bow Attack. Needling Shot strikes for only 10...30 damage and moves faster than normal. If Needling Shot strikes a foe below 50% Health, Needling Shot recharges instantly. Your other attack skills are disabled for 2 seconds.', 'Bow Attack. Fast-moving arrow. Deals 10...30 damage. Recharges instantly if target foe is below 50% Health. Your other attack skills are disabled (2 seconds).', 'Needling Shot', 'Bow Attack. Needling Shot strikes for only 10...30 damage and moves faster than normal. If Needling Shot strikes a foe below 50% Health, Needling Shot recharges instantly. Your other attack skills are disabled for 2 seconds.', 'Bow Attack. Fast-moving arrow. Deals 10...30 damage. Recharges instantly if target foe is below 50% Health. Your other attack skills are disabled (2 seconds).'),
  (1198, 'Broad Head Arrow', 'Elite Bow Attack. You shoot a broad head arrow that moves slower than normal. If it hits, target foe is Dazed for 5...20 seconds, and if target foe is casting a spell that spell is interrupted.', 'Elite Bow Attack. Slow-moving arrow. Interrupts a spell. Inflicts Dazed condition (5...20 seconds).', 'Broad Head Arrow', 'Elite Bow Attack. You shoot a broad head arrow that moves slower than normal. If it hits, target foe is Dazed for 5...20 seconds, and if target foe is casting a spell that spell is interrupted.', 'Elite Bow Attack. Slow-moving arrow. Interrupts a spell. Inflicts Dazed condition (5...20 seconds).'),
  (1199, 'Glass Arrows', 'Elite Preparation. For 10...35 seconds, your arrows strike for +6...20 damage if they hit and cause Bleeding for 10...20 seconds if they are Blocked.', 'Elite Preparation. (10...35 seconds.) Your arrows deal +6...20 damage. Inflicts Bleeding condition if blocked (10...20 seconds).', 'Glass Arrows (PvP)', 'Elite Preparation. For 10...35 seconds, your arrows strike for +6...18 damage if they hit and cause Bleeding for 10...20 seconds if they are Blocked.', 'Elite Preparation. (10...35 seconds.) Your arrows deal +6...18 damage. Inflicts Bleeding condition if blocked (10...20 seconds).'),
  (1200, 'Archer''s Signet', 'Elite Signet. For 1...24 seconds, conditions you apply while wielding a bow last 150% longer.', 'Elite Signet. (1...24 seconds.) Conditions you apply while wielding a bow last 150% longer.', 'Archer''s Signet', 'Elite Signet. For 1...24 seconds, conditions you apply while wielding a bow last 150% longer.', 'Elite Signet. (1...24 seconds.) Conditions you apply while wielding a bow last 150% longer.'),
  (1201, 'Savage Pounce', 'Pet Attack. Your animal companion attempts a Savage Pounce that deals +5...20 damage. If the attack strikes a foe who is casting a spell, that foe is knocked down.', 'Pet Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. Causes knock-down if target foe is casting a spell.', 'Savage Pounce', 'Pet Attack. Your animal companion attempts a Savage Pounce that deals +5...20 damage. If the attack strikes a foe who is casting a spell, that foe is knocked down.', 'Pet Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. Causes knock-down if target foe is casting a spell.'),
  (1202, 'Enraged Lunge', 'Elite Pet Attack. Your animal companion attempts an Enraged Lunge that applies a Deep Wound to target foe for 5...20 seconds and deals +10...50 damage.', 'Elite Pet Attack. Inflicts Deep Wound condition (5...20 seconds) and deals +10...50 damage.', 'Enraged Lunge (PvP)', 'Elite Pet Attack. Your animal companion attempts an Enraged Lunge that deals +3...23 damage (maximum bonus 60) for each recharging Beast Mastery skill.', 'Elite Pet Attack. Deals +3...23 damage (maximum 60) for each of your recharging Beast Mastery skills.'),
  (1203, 'Bestial Mauling', 'Pet Attack. Your animal companion attempts a Bestial Mauling that deals +5...20 damage. If the attack strikes a knocked-down foe, that foe is Dazed for 4...10 seconds.', 'Pet Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. Inflicts Dazed condition (4...10 seconds) if target foe is knocked-down.', 'Bestial Mauling', 'Pet Attack. Your animal companion attempts a Bestial Mauling that deals +5...20 damage. If the attack strikes a knocked-down foe, that foe is Dazed for 4...10 seconds.', 'Pet Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. Inflicts Dazed condition (4...10 seconds) if target foe is knocked-down.'),
  (1205, 'Poisonous Bite', 'Pet Attack. Your animal companion attempts a Poisonous Bite that Poisons target foe for 5...20 seconds.', 'Pet Attack. Inflicts Poisoned condition (5...20 seconds).', 'Poisonous Bite', 'Pet Attack. Your animal companion attempts a Poisonous Bite that Poisons target foe for 5...20 seconds.', 'Pet Attack. Inflicts Poisoned condition (5...20 seconds).'),
  (1206, 'Pounce', 'Pet Attack. Your animal companion''s next attack is a Pounce that deals +5...20 damage. If the attack strikes a moving foe, that foe is knocked down.', 'Pet Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. Causes knock-down if target foe is moving.', 'Pounce', 'Pet Attack. Your animal companion''s next attack is a Pounce that deals +5...20 damage. If the attack strikes a moving foe, that foe is knocked down.', 'Pet Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. Causes knock-down if target foe is moving.'),
  (1209, 'Bestial Fury', 'Stance. All your non-attack skills are disabled for 5 seconds. For 5...11 seconds, you attack 25% faster.', 'Stance. (5...11 seconds.) You attack 25% faster. Your non-attack skills are disabled (5 seconds).', 'Bestial Fury', 'Stance. All your non-attack skills are disabled for 5 seconds. For 5...11 seconds, you attack 25% faster.', 'Stance. (5...11 seconds.) You attack 25% faster. Your non-attack skills are disabled (5 seconds).'),
  (1211, 'Viper''s Nest', 'Trap. Create a Viper''s Nest. When it is triggered, all nearby foes are struck for 5...35 piercing damage and become Poisoned for 5...20 seconds. Viper''s Nest expires after 90 seconds. This Trap is easily interrupted.', 'Trap. (90 seconds.) Affects nearby foes. Deals 5...35 piercing damage. Inflicts Poisoned condition (5...20 seconds). Easily interrupted.', 'Viper''s Nest', 'Trap. Create a Viper''s Nest. When it is triggered, all nearby foes are struck for 5...35 piercing damage and become Poisoned for 5...20 seconds. Viper''s Nest expires after 90 seconds. This Trap is easily interrupted.', 'Trap. (90 seconds.) Affects nearby foes. Deals 5...35 piercing damage. Inflicts Poisoned condition (5...20 seconds). Easily interrupted.'),
  (1212, 'Equinox', 'Elite Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. Spells cast within its range that cause Overcast cause an additional 10 Overcast. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Elite Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Overcast-causing spells cast within range cause an additional 10 Overcast.', 'Equinox', 'Elite Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. Spells cast within its range that cause Overcast cause an additional 10 Overcast. This spirit dies after 30...240 seconds.', 'Elite Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...240 second lifespan). Overcast-causing spells cast within range cause an additional 10 Overcast.'),
  (1213, 'Tranquility', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. Enchantments cast by non-spirit creatures within its range expire 20...50% faster. This spirit dies after 15...120 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (15...120 second lifespan). Enchantments expire 20...50% faster on creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.', 'Tranquility (PvP)', 'Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. Enchantments cast by non-spirit creatures within its range expire 10...30% faster. This spirit dies after 15...120 seconds.', 'Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (15...120 second lifespan). Enchantments expire 10...30% faster on creatures in range. Does not affect spirits.'),
  (1215, 'Clamor of Souls', 'Elite Spell. Target foe and all nearby foes take 10...65 lightning damage. If you are within earshot of a spirit or holding a bundle item, you gain 10 Energy.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 10...65 lightning damage to target and nearby foes. You gain 10 Energy if you are within earshot of a spirit or holding a bundle item.', 'Clamor of Souls', 'Elite Spell. Target foe and all nearby foes take 10...65 lightning damage. If you are within earshot of a spirit or holding a bundle item, you gain 10 Energy.', 'Elite Spell. Deals 10...65 lightning damage to target and nearby foes. You gain 10 Energy if you are within earshot of a spirit or holding a bundle item.'),
  (1217, 'Ritual Lord', 'Elite Skill. For 5...35 seconds, your Ritualist attributes are boosted by 2...4 for your next skill. If that skill is a Binding Ritual, it recharges 10...60% faster and Ritual Lord recharges instantly.', 'Elite Skill. (5...35 seconds.) You have +2...4 to all Ritualist attributes for your next skill. If that skill is a Binding Ritual, it recharges 10...60% faster and Ritual Lord recharges instantly.', 'Ritual Lord', 'Elite Skill. For 5...35 seconds, your Ritualist attributes are boosted by 2...4 for your next skill. If that skill is a Binding Ritual, it recharges 10...60% faster and Ritual Lord recharges instantly.', 'Elite Skill. (5...35 seconds.) You have +2...4 to all Ritualist attributes for your next skill. If that skill is a Binding Ritual, it recharges 10...60% faster and Ritual Lord recharges instantly.'),
  (1218, 'Cruel Was Daoshen', 'Item Spell. Hold Daoshen''s ashes for up to 15...60 seconds. While you hold his ashes, all Ritualist skills have 10% armor penetration. When you drop his ashes, all nearby foes are struck for 15...85 lightning damage.', 'Item Spell. (15...60 seconds.) Your Ritualist skills have 10% armor penetration. Drop effect: deals 15...85 lightning damage to all nearby foes.', 'Cruel Was Daoshen', 'Item Spell. Hold Daoshen''s ashes for up to 15...60 seconds. While you hold his ashes, all Ritualist skills have 10% armor penetration. When you drop his ashes, all nearby foes are struck for 15...85 lightning damage.', 'Item Spell. (15...60 seconds.) Your Ritualist skills have 10% armor penetration. Drop effect: deals 15...85 lightning damage to all nearby foes.'),
  (1219, 'Protective Was Kaolai', 'Item Spell. Hold Kaolai''s ashes for up to 15...60 seconds. While you hold his ashes, you gain 20 armor. When you drop his ashes, all party members are healed for 20...95 Health.', 'Item Spell. (15...60 seconds.) You have +20 armor. Drop effect: all party members are healed for 20...95.', 'Protective Was Kaolai', 'Item Spell. Hold Kaolai''s ashes for up to 15...60 seconds. While you hold his ashes, you gain 20 armor. When you drop his ashes, all party members are healed for 20...95 Health.', 'Item Spell. (15...60 seconds.) You have +20 armor. Drop effect: all party members are healed for 20...95.'),
  (1220, 'Attuned Was Songkai', 'Elite Item Spell. Hold Songkai''s ashes for up to 45 seconds. While you hold her ashes, your spells and binding rituals cost -5...50% of the base Energy to cast.', 'Elite Item Spell. (45 seconds.) Your spells and binding rituals cost -5...50% of the base Energy.', 'Attuned Was Songkai', 'Elite Item Spell. Hold Songkai''s ashes for up to 45 seconds. While you hold her ashes, your spells and binding rituals cost -5...50% of the base Energy to cast.', 'Elite Item Spell. (45 seconds.) Your spells and binding rituals cost -5...50% of the base Energy.'),
  (1221, 'Resilient Was Xiko', 'Item Spell. Hold Xiko''s ashes for up to 5...20 seconds. For each hex or condition you are suffering from while holding her ashes, you gain +3 Health regeneration. When you drop her ashes, you lose 1...4 conditions.', 'Item Spell. (5...20 seconds.) You have +3 Health regeneration for each hex or condition on you. Drop effect: you lose 1...4 conditions.', 'Resilient Was Xiko', 'Item Spell. Hold Xiko''s ashes for up to 5...20 seconds. For each hex or condition you are suffering from while holding her ashes, you gain +3 Health regeneration. When you drop her ashes, you lose 1...4 conditions.', 'Item Spell. (5...20 seconds.) You have +3 Health regeneration for each hex or condition on you. Drop effect: you lose 1...4 conditions.'),
  (1222, 'Lively Was Naomei', 'Item Spell. Hold Naomei''s ashes for up to 45 seconds. When you drop her ashes, all party members in the area are resurrected with 15...75% Health and zero Energy.', 'Item Spell. (45 seconds.) Drop effect: resurrects party members in the area (15...75% Health and zero Energy).', 'Lively Was Naomei', 'Item Spell. Hold Naomei''s ashes for up to 45 seconds. When you drop her ashes, all party members in the area are resurrected with 15...75% Health and zero Energy.', 'Item Spell. (45 seconds.) Drop effect: resurrects party members in the area (15...75% Health and zero Energy).'),
  (1223, 'Anguished Was Lingwah', 'Item Spell. Hold Lingwah''s ashes for up to 10...60 seconds. While you hold her ashes, your Ritualist hexes cost 1...5 less energy and last 50% longer. When you drop her ashes all your Ritualist hexes are recharged.', 'Item Spell. (10...60 seconds.) Your Ritualist hexes cost 1...5 less energy and last 50% longer. Drop effect: all your Ritualist hexes are recharged.', 'Anguished Was Lingwah', 'Item Spell. Hold Lingwah''s ashes for up to 10...60 seconds. While you hold her ashes, your Ritualist hexes cost 1...5 less energy and last 50% longer. When you drop her ashes all your Ritualist hexes are recharged.', 'Item Spell. (10...60 seconds.) Your Ritualist hexes cost 1...5 less energy and last 50% longer. Drop effect: all your Ritualist hexes are recharged.'),
