  (1236, 'Binding Chains', 'Hex Spell. For 3 seconds, target foe and all nearby foes move 90% slower and take 1...30 damage each second while moving.', 'Hex Spell. Also hexes foes near your target (3 seconds). These foes move 90% slower and take 1...30 damage each second while moving.', 'Binding Chains', 'Hex Spell. For 3 seconds, target foe and all nearby foes move 90% slower and take 1...30 damage each second while moving.', 'Hex Spell. Also hexes foes near your target (3 seconds). These foes move 90% slower and take 1...30 damage each second while moving.'),
