  (1393, 'Healer''s Boon', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 10...55 seconds. Healing Prayers spells cast 50% faster and heal for 50% more Health.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (10...55 seconds.) Healing Prayers spells cast 50% faster and heal for 50% more.', 'Healer''s Boon', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 10...55 seconds. Healing Prayers spells cast 50% faster and heal for 50% more Health.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (10...55 seconds.) Healing Prayers spells cast 50% faster and heal for 50% more.'),
