  (1408, 'Rage of the Ntouka', 'Elite Skill. Gain 1...7 strikes of adrenaline. For 8 seconds, whenever you use an adrenal skill, that skill recharges for 3 seconds.', 'Elite Skill. You gain 1...7 adrenaline. For 8 seconds, adrenal skills have a 3 second recharge when used.', 'Rage of the Ntouka', 'Elite Skill. Gain 1...7 strikes of adrenaline. For 8 seconds, whenever you use an adrenal skill, that skill recharges for 3 seconds.', 'Elite Skill. You gain 1...7 adrenaline. For 8 seconds, adrenal skills have a 3 second recharge when used.'),
