  (1466, 'Burning Arrow', 'Elite Bow Attack. If this attack hits, you strike for +10...30 damage and cause Burning for 2...8 seconds.', 'Elite Bow Attack. Deals +10...30 damage. Inflicts Burning condition (2...8 seconds).', 'Burning Arrow', 'Elite Bow Attack. If this attack hits, you strike for +10...30 damage and cause Burning for 2...8 seconds.', 'Elite Bow Attack. Deals +10...30 damage. Inflicts Burning condition (2...8 seconds).'),
