  (1473, 'Quicksand', 'Elite Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. All non-spirit creatures within its range lose 1 Energy each time they attack or use a skill. This spirit dies after 30...180 seconds.', 'Elite Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...180 second lifespan). Creatures lose 1 Energy each time they attack or use a skill. Does not affect spirits.', 'Quicksand', 'Elite Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. All non-spirit creatures within its range lose 1 Energy each time they attack or use a skill. This spirit dies after 30...180 seconds.', 'Elite Nature Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...180 second lifespan). Creatures lose 1 Energy each time they attack or use a skill. Does not affect spirits.'),
