  (1573, 'Awe', 'Skill. If this skill hits a knocked-down foe, that foe becomes Dazed for 5...15 seconds.', 'Skill. Inflicts Dazed condition (5...15 seconds). No effect unless target is knocked-down.', 'Awe', 'Skill. If this skill hits a knocked-down foe, that foe becomes Dazed for 5...15 seconds.', 'Skill. Inflicts Dazed condition (5...15 seconds). No effect unless target is knocked-down.'),
