  (1577, 'Finale of Restoration', 'Echo. For 10...35 seconds, whenever a chant or shout ends on target non-spirit ally, that ally is healed for 15...75 Health.', 'Echo. (10...35 seconds.) Target ally gains 15...75 Health whenever a shout or chant ends on that ally. Cannot target spirits.', 'Finale of Restoration (PvP)', 'Echo. For 10...35 seconds, the next 5 times that a chant or shout ends on target non-spirit ally, that ally is healed for 15...75 Health.', 'Echo. (10...35 seconds.) Target ally gains 15...75 Health the next 5 times a shout or chant ends on that ally. Cannot target spirits.'),
