  (1579, 'Purifying Finale', 'Echo. For 10...35 seconds, target non-spirit ally loses 1 condition whenever a chant or shout ends on that ally.', 'Echo. (10...35 seconds.) Target ally loses one condition whenever a chant or shout ends on that ally. Cannot target spirits.', 'Purifying Finale', 'Echo. For 10...35 seconds, target non-spirit ally loses 1 condition whenever a chant or shout ends on that ally.', 'Echo. (10...35 seconds.) Target ally loses one condition whenever a chant or shout ends on that ally. Cannot target spirits.'),
  (1580, 'Bladeturn Refrain', 'Echo. For 20 seconds, target non-spirit ally has a 5...20% chance to block incoming attacks. This echo is reapplied every time a chant or shout ends on that ally.', 'Echo. (20 seconds.) Target ally has a 5...20% chance to block. Renewal: Whenever a chant or shout ends on that ally. Cannot target spirits.', 'Bladeturn Refrain (PvP)', 'Echo. For 20 seconds, target non-spirit ally has +10...40 armor against slashing damage. This echo is reapplied every time a chant or shout ends on that ally.', 'Echo. (20 seconds.) Target ally has +10...40 armor against slashing damage. Renewal: Whenever a chant or shout ends on that ally. Cannot target spirits.'),
