  (1633, 'Malicious Strike', 'Melee Attack. If this attack hits a foe suffering from a condition, you deal +10...30 damage and this attack results in a critical hit.', 'Melee Attack. If target foe has a condition, this attack deals +10...30 damage and is a critical hit.', 'Malicious Strike', 'Melee Attack. If this attack hits a foe suffering from a condition, you deal +10...30 damage and this attack results in a critical hit.', 'Melee Attack. If target foe has a condition, this attack deals +10...30 damage and is a critical hit.'),
