  (1641, 'Feigned Neutrality', 'Enchantment Spell. For 4...10 seconds, you have +7 Health regeneration and +80 armor. This enchantment ends if you successfully hit with an attack or use a skill.', 'Enchantment Spell. (4...10 seconds.) You have +7 Health regeneration and +80 armor. Ends if you hit with an attack or use a skill.', 'Feigned Neutrality', 'Enchantment Spell. For 4...10 seconds, you have +7 Health regeneration and +80 armor. This enchantment ends if you successfully hit with an attack or use a skill.', 'Enchantment Spell. (4...10 seconds.) You have +7 Health regeneration and +80 armor. Ends if you hit with an attack or use a skill.'),
