  (1649, 'Way of the Assassin', 'Elite Stance. For the next 20 seconds while wielding daggers, you attack 5...20% faster and have a +5...35% chance to land a critical hit.', 'Elite Stance. (20 seconds.) While wielding daggers, you attack 5...20% faster and have +5...35% chance to land a critical hit.', 'Way of the Assassin', 'Elite Stance. For the next 20 seconds while wielding daggers, you attack 5...20% faster and have a +5...35% chance to land a critical hit.', 'Elite Stance. (20 seconds.) While wielding daggers, you attack 5...20% faster and have +5...35% chance to land a critical hit.'),
