  (1658, 'Symbolic Posture', 'Stance. For 5...20 seconds, the next signet you activate recharges 20...80% faster.', 'Stance. (5...20 seconds.) Your next signet recharges 20...80% faster.', 'Symbolic Posture', 'Stance. For 5...20 seconds, the next signet you activate recharges 20...80% faster.', 'Stance. (5...20 seconds.) Your next signet recharges 20...80% faster.'),
