  (1660, 'Well of Silence', 'Well Spell. Exploit target corpse or sacrifice 66% health to create a Well of Silence for 10...30 seconds. Foes within the well cannot use shouts or chants and suffer -1...4 Health degeneration.', 'Well Spell. (10...30 seconds.) Foes in this well cannot use shouts and chants and have -1...4 Health degeneration. Exploits a fresh corpse or sacrifices 66% health.', 'Well of Silence', 'Well Spell. Exploit target corpse or sacrifice 66% health to create a Well of Silence for 10...30 seconds. Foes within the well cannot use shouts or chants and suffer -1...4 Health degeneration.', 'Well Spell. (10...30 seconds.) Foes in this well cannot use shouts and chants and have -1...4 Health degeneration. Exploits a fresh corpse or sacrifices 66% health.'),
  (1661, 'Glowstone', 'Spell. Send a projectile that strikes for 5...50 earth damage if it hits. If this spell hits a weakened foe, you gain 5 Energy plus 1 Energy for every 2 ranks of Energy Storage.', 'Spell. Projectile: deals 5...50 earth damage. You gain 5 Energy plus 1 Energy for every 2 ranks of Energy Storage if target foe is Weakened.', 'Glowstone', 'Spell. Send a projectile that strikes for 5...50 earth damage if it hits. If this spell hits a weakened foe, you gain 5 Energy plus 1 Energy for every 2 ranks of Energy Storage.', 'Spell. Projectile: deals 5...50 earth damage. You gain 5 Energy plus 1 Energy for every 2 ranks of Energy Storage if target foe is Weakened.'),
