  (1695, 'Soldier''s Strike', 'Melee Attack. If this attack hits, you deal +10...40 more damage. If you are under the effects of a chant or shout, this attack cannot be blocked.', 'Melee Attack. Deals +10...40 damage. Unblockable if you are under the effects of a chant or shout.', 'Soldier''s Strike', 'Melee Attack. If this attack hits, you deal +10...40 more damage. If you are under the effects of a chant or shout, this attack cannot be blocked.', 'Melee Attack. Deals +10...40 damage. Unblockable if you are under the effects of a chant or shout.'),
  (1696, 'Decapitate', 'Elite Axe Attack. You lose all adrenaline and all Energy. This attack is unblockable, you deal +5...80 damage, and cause a Deep Wound for 5...20 seconds. This attack is always critical and if foe is killed, nearby foes are Weakened for 8 seconds.', 'Elite Axe Attack. Deals +5...80 damage. Inflicts Deep Wound condition (5...20 seconds). Automatic critical hit. If foe is killed, nearby foes are Weakened (8 seconds). You lose all adrenaline and Energy.', 'Decapitate', 'Elite Axe Attack. You lose all adrenaline and all Energy. This attack is unblockable, you deal +5...80 damage, and cause a Deep Wound for 5...20 seconds. This attack is always critical and if foe is killed, nearby foes are Weakened for 8 seconds.', 'Elite Axe Attack. Deals +5...80 damage. Inflicts Deep Wound condition (5...20 seconds). Automatic critical hit. If foe is killed, nearby foes are Weakened (8 seconds). You lose all adrenaline and Energy.'),
