  (1699, 'Soldier''s Defense', 'Stance. For 1...6 seconds, you have a 75% chance to block attacks while under the effects of a shout or chant. You gain 1 strike of adrenaline for each blocked attack.', 'Stance. (1...6 seconds.) You have 75% chance to block while under the effects of a shout or chant. Block effect: gain 1 adrenaline.', 'Soldier''s Defense', 'Stance. For 1...6 seconds, you have a 75% chance to block attacks while under the effects of a shout or chant. You gain 1 strike of adrenaline for each blocked attack.', 'Stance. (1...6 seconds.) You have 75% chance to block while under the effects of a shout or chant. Block effect: gain 1 adrenaline.'),
  (1700, 'Frenzied Defense', 'Stance. For 8 seconds, you have a 75% chance to block incoming attacks, but take double damage.', 'Stance. (8 seconds.) You have 75% chance to block. You take double damage.', 'Frenzied Defense', 'Stance. For 8 seconds, you have a 75% chance to block incoming attacks, but take double damage.', 'Stance. (8 seconds.) You have 75% chance to block. You take double damage.'),
