  (1726, 'Magebane Shot', 'Elite Bow Attack. If this attack hits, it interrupts target foe''s action. If that action was a spell, it is disabled for an additional 10 seconds. This attack cannot be blocked.', 'Elite Bow Attack. Interrupts an action. Interruption effect: an interrupted spell is disabled for +10 seconds. Unblockable.', 'Magebane Shot', 'Elite Bow Attack. If this attack hits, it interrupts target foe''s action. If that action was a spell, it is disabled for an additional 10 seconds. This attack cannot be blocked.', 'Elite Bow Attack. Interrupts an action. Interruption effect: an interrupted spell is disabled for +10 seconds. Unblockable.'),
