  (1740, 'Wielder''s Remedy', 'Enchantment Spell. For 10...30 seconds, whenever you cast a weapon spell on an ally, that ally loses 2 conditions.', 'Enchantment Spell. (10...30 seconds.) Whenever you cast a weapon spell, the targeted ally loses two conditions.', 'Wielder''s Remedy', 'Enchantment Spell. For 10...30 seconds, whenever you cast a weapon spell on an ally, that ally loses 2 conditions.', 'Enchantment Spell. (10...30 seconds.) Whenever you cast a weapon spell, the targeted ally loses two conditions.'),
