  (1748, 'Recovery', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...14 spirit. Conditions on allies within range of this spirit expire 20...50% faster. This spirit dies after 30...60 seconds.', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...14 spirit (30...60 second lifespan). Conditions on allies in range expire 20...50% faster.', 'Recovery (PvP)', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...10 spirit. Conditions on allies within range of this spirit expire 20...50% faster. This spirit dies after 30...60 seconds.', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...10 spirit (30...60 second lifespan). Conditions on allies in range expire 20...50% faster.'),
  (1749, 'Weapon of Fury', 'Elite Weapon Spell. For 5...20 seconds, target ally gains 100% more adrenaline and 1 Energy whenever that ally successfully hits with an attack.', 'Elite Weapon Spell. (5...20 seconds.) 100% more adrenaline gain and +1 Energy whenever target ally hits with an attack.', 'Weapon of Fury', 'Elite Weapon Spell. For 5...20 seconds, target ally gains 100% more adrenaline and 1 Energy whenever that ally successfully hits with an attack.', 'Elite Weapon Spell. (5...20 seconds.) 100% more adrenaline gain and +1 Energy whenever target ally hits with an attack.'),
  (1750, 'Xinrae''s Weapon', 'Elite Weapon Spell. For 8 seconds, the next time target ally takes damage from a foe that damage is limited to 5% of that ally''s max Health and that ally steals up to 20...80 Health from that foe.', 'Elite Weapon Spell. (8 seconds.) The next time target ally takes damage from a foe, that damage is limited to 5% of target ally''s max Health and that ally steals up to 20...80 Health from that foe.', 'Xinrae''s Weapon', 'Elite Weapon Spell. For 8 seconds, the next time target ally takes damage from a foe that damage is limited to 5% of that ally''s max Health and that ally steals up to 20...80 Health from that foe.', 'Elite Weapon Spell. (8 seconds.) The next time target ally takes damage from a foe, that damage is limited to 5% of target ally''s max Health and that ally steals up to 20...80 Health from that foe.'),
  (1751, 'Warmonger''s Weapon', 'Weapon Spell. For 3...13 seconds, if target ally attacks a foe who is not attacking, that foe is interrupted.', 'Weapon Spell. (3...13 seconds.) Attacks interrupt an action. Does not interrupt attacking foes.', 'Warmonger''s Weapon', 'Weapon Spell. For 3...13 seconds, if target ally attacks a foe who is not attacking, that foe is interrupted.', 'Weapon Spell. (3...13 seconds.) Attacks interrupt an action. Does not interrupt attacking foes.'),
  (1752, 'Weapon of Remedy', 'Elite Weapon Spell. For 8 seconds, the next time target ally takes damage or life steal from a foe, that ally steals up to 20...80 Health from that foe and loses 2 conditions.', 'Elite Weapon Spell. (8 seconds.) The next time target ally takes damage or life steal from a foe, this ally steals 20...80 Health from that foe and loses 2 conditions.', 'Weapon of Remedy', 'Elite Weapon Spell. For 8 seconds, the next time target ally takes damage or life steal from a foe, that ally steals up to 20...80 Health from that foe and loses 2 conditions.', 'Elite Weapon Spell. (8 seconds.) The next time target ally takes damage or life steal from a foe, this ally steals 20...80 Health from that foe and loses 2 conditions.'),
  (1753, 'Rending Sweep', 'Scythe Attack. You deal +5...20 damage and lose 1 Dervish enchantment. If an enchantment was lost, you remove an enchantment from each foe you hit.', 'Scythe Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. You lose 1 Dervish enchantment. Removal Effect: struck foes lose an enchantment.', 'Rending Sweep', 'Scythe Attack. You deal +5...20 damage and lose 1 Dervish enchantment. If an enchantment was lost, you remove an enchantment from each foe you hit.', 'Scythe Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. You lose 1 Dervish enchantment. Removal Effect: struck foes lose an enchantment.'),
  (1754, 'Onslaught', 'Elite Flash Enchantment Spell. For 3...15 seconds, you attack, move, and gain adrenaline 25% faster.', 'Elite Flash Enchantment Spell. (3...15 seconds.) You attack, move, and gain adrenaline 25% faster.', 'Onslaught (PvP)', 'Elite Flash Enchantment Spell. For 2...8 seconds, you attack and gain adrenaline 25% faster.', 'Elite Flash Enchantment Spell. (2...8 seconds.) You attack and gain adrenaline 25% faster.'),
  (1755, 'Mystic Corruption', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. All adjacent foes suffer from Disease for 1...10 seconds. For 20 seconds, nothing happens. Disease duration is doubled if you are enchanted when you activate this skill. When this enchantment ends, all party members in earshot are cured of Disease.', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. (20 seconds.) Initial Effect: all adjacent foes are Diseased (1...10 seconds). Double duration if you are already enchanted. End Effect: party members in earshot lose Disease.', 'Mystic Corruption (PvP)', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. All adjacent foes suffer from Disease for 2...6 seconds. For 20 seconds, nothing happens. Disease duration is doubled if you are enchanted when you activate this skill. When this enchantment ends, all party members in earshot are cured of Disease.', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. (20 seconds.) Initial Effect: all adjacent foes are Diseased (2...6 seconds). Double duration if you are already enchanted. End Effect: party members in earshot lose Disease.'),
  (1756, 'Grenth''s Grasp', 'Elite Flash Enchantment Spell. For 20 seconds, your attack skills also Cripple that foe for 1...11 seconds and you transfer 1...3 conditions from yourself to that foe.', 'Elite Flash Enchantment Spell. (20 seconds.) Inflict Cripple (1...11 seconds) with your attack skills and transfer 1...3 conditions.', 'Grenth''s Grasp', 'Elite Flash Enchantment Spell. For 20 seconds, your attack skills also Cripple that foe for 1...11 seconds and you transfer 1...3 conditions from yourself to that foe.', 'Elite Flash Enchantment Spell. (20 seconds.) Inflict Cripple (1...11 seconds) with your attack skills and transfer 1...3 conditions.'),
  (1757, 'Veil of Thorns', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. When you cast this enchantment, all nearby foes are struck for 5...50 piercing damage. For 5...25 seconds, you take 5...35% less damage from spells.', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. (5...25 seconds.) Spell damage is reduced by 5...35%. Initial effect: nearby foes are struck for 5...50 piercing damage.', 'Veil of Thorns', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. When you cast this enchantment, all nearby foes are struck for 5...50 piercing damage. For 5...25 seconds, you take 5...35% less damage from spells.', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. (5...25 seconds.) Spell damage is reduced by 5...35%. Initial effect: nearby foes are struck for 5...50 piercing damage.'),
  (1758, 'Harrier''s Grasp', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. For 5...20 seconds, attacks against moving foes also Cripple those foes for 2...9 seconds. When you cast this enchantment, you are relieved of Cripple and 1 other condition. This enchantment ends after you apply Cripple 1...3 times.', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. (5...20 seconds.) Attacks on moving foes also Cripple them. Initial Effect: you lose Cripple and 1 other condition. Ends after applying cripple 1...3 times.', 'Harrier''s Grasp (PvP)', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. For 5...20 seconds, melee attacks against moving foes also Cripple those foes for 2...9 seconds. When you cast this enchantment, you are relieved of Cripple and 1 other condition. This enchantment ends after you apply Cripple 1...3 times.', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. (5...20 seconds.) Melee attacks on moving foes also Cripple them. Initial Effect: you lose Cripple and 1 other condition. Ends after applying cripple 1...3 times.'),
  (1759, 'Vow of Strength', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 15 seconds, whenever you attack a foe with your scythe, you deal 10...25 slashing damage to all adjacent foes.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (15 seconds.) Attacks with a scythe deal 10...25 slashing damage to all adjacent foes whenever you attack.', 'Vow of Strength', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 15 seconds, whenever you attack a foe with your scythe, you deal 10...25 slashing damage to all adjacent foes.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (15 seconds.) Attacks with a scythe deal 10...25 slashing damage to all adjacent foes whenever you attack.'),
  (1760, 'Ebon Dust Aura', 'Elite Flash Enchantment Spell. When you cast this enchantment, all nearby foes are Blinded for 1...7 seconds. For 30 seconds, if you are wielding an earth weapon, your melee attacks deal +3...30 earth damage. When this enchantment ends, you are cured of Blindness.', 'Elite Flash Enchantment Spell. (30 seconds.) Deal +3...30 earth damage with your melee attacks. Initial Effect: Blinds nearby foes for 1...7 seconds. End Effect: removes Blindness. No effect unless wielding an earth weapon.', 'Ebon Dust Aura', 'Elite Flash Enchantment Spell. When you cast this enchantment, all nearby foes are Blinded for 1...7 seconds. For 30 seconds, if you are wielding an earth weapon, your melee attacks deal +3...30 earth damage. When this enchantment ends, you are cured of Blindness.', 'Elite Flash Enchantment Spell. (30 seconds.) Deal +3...30 earth damage with your melee attacks. Initial Effect: Blinds nearby foes for 1...7 seconds. End Effect: removes Blindness. No effect unless wielding an earth weapon.'),
  (1761, 'Zealous Vow', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 20 seconds, you have -2 Energy regeneration, and you gain 1...6 Energy every time you hit with an attack.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (20 seconds.) You gain 1...6 Energy each time you hit with an attack. You have -2 Energy regeneration.', 'Zealous Vow', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 20 seconds, you have -2 Energy regeneration, and you gain 1...6 Energy every time you hit with an attack.', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (20 seconds.) You gain 1...6 Energy each time you hit with an attack. You have -2 Energy regeneration.'),
  (1762, 'Heart of Fury', 'Stance. For 2...10 seconds, you attack 25% faster.', 'Stance. (2...10 seconds.) You attack 25% faster.', 'Heart of Fury (PvP)', 'Stance. For 2...10 seconds, you attack 25% faster.', 'Stance. (2...10 seconds.) You attack 25% faster.'),
  (1763, 'Zealous Renewal', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. All nearby foes take 5...30 holy damage. For 5...25 seconds, you have -1 Energy regeneration and gain 1 Energy whenever you hit a foe. If this enchantment ends prematurely, you gain 1...5 Energy.', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. (5...25 seconds.) Initial effect: deals 5...30 holy damage to nearby foes. You have -1 Energy regeneration and gain 1 Energy when you hit. Gain 1...5 Energy if this enchantment ends early.', 'Zealous Renewal', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. All nearby foes take 5...30 holy damage. For 5...25 seconds, you have -1 Energy regeneration and gain 1 Energy whenever you hit a foe. If this enchantment ends prematurely, you gain 1...5 Energy.', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. (5...25 seconds.) Initial effect: deals 5...30 holy damage to nearby foes. You have -1 Energy regeneration and gain 1 Energy when you hit. Gain 1...5 Energy if this enchantment ends early.'),
  (1764, 'Attacker''s Insight', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. For 3...10 seconds, you have a 50% chance to block while attacking. When this enchantment ends you inflict Weakness on all adjacent foes for 3...15 seconds.', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. (3...10 seconds.) Gives 50% block chance while attacking. End Effect: Causes Weakness 3...15 seconds to adjacent foes.', 'Attacker''s Insight', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. For 3...10 seconds, you have a 50% chance to block while attacking. When this enchantment ends you inflict Weakness on all adjacent foes for 3...15 seconds.', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. (3...10 seconds.) Gives 50% block chance while attacking. End Effect: Causes Weakness 3...15 seconds to adjacent foes.'),
  (1765, 'Rending Aura', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. When you cast this enchantment, all nearby foes take 10...40 cold damage. For 30 seconds, your attack skills remove enchantments from knocked-down foes. When this enchantment ends, nearby foes are affected by Cracked Armor for 1...10 seconds.', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. (30 seconds.) Your attack skills remove enchantments from knocked-down foes. Initial effect: Deals 10...40 cold damage to all nearby foes. End Effect: nearby foes have Cracked Armor for 1...10 seconds.', 'Rending Aura', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. When you cast this enchantment, all nearby foes take 10...40 cold damage. For 30 seconds, your attack skills remove enchantments from knocked-down foes. When this enchantment ends, nearby foes are affected by Cracked Armor for 1...10 seconds.', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. (30 seconds.) Your attack skills remove enchantments from knocked-down foes. Initial effect: Deals 10...40 cold damage to all nearby foes. End Effect: nearby foes have Cracked Armor for 1...10 seconds.'),
  (1766, 'Featherfoot Grace', 'Enchantment Spell. For 5...20 seconds, you move 25% faster, and conditions expire 50% faster.', 'Enchantment Spell. (5...20 seconds.) You move 25% faster, and conditions expire 50% faster.', 'Featherfoot Grace', 'Enchantment Spell. For 5...20 seconds, you move 25% faster, and conditions expire 50% faster.', 'Enchantment Spell. (5...20 seconds.) You move 25% faster, and conditions expire 50% faster.'),
