  (1779, '"Make Your Time!"', 'Shout. You gain 2 strikes of adrenaline for each party member within earshot (maximum 1...8 adrenaline).', 'Shout. You gain two adrenaline (maximum 1...8) for each party member in earshot.', '"Make Your Time!"', 'Shout. You gain 2 strikes of adrenaline for each party member within earshot (maximum 1...8 adrenaline).', 'Shout. You gain two adrenaline (maximum 1...8) for each party member in earshot.'),
