  (1782, '"The Power Is Yours!"', 'Elite Shout. For 2...4 seconds, all allies within earshot gain 1...2 Energy regeneration.', 'Elite Shout. (2...4 seconds.) Allies within earshot gain 1...2 Energy regeneration.', '"The Power Is Yours!"', 'Elite Shout. For 2...4 seconds, all allies within earshot gain 1...2 Energy regeneration.', 'Elite Shout. (2...4 seconds.) Allies within earshot gain 1...2 Energy regeneration.'),
