  (2074, 'Chest Thumper', 'Spear Attack. If this attack hits a foe with Cracked Armor, that foe suffers a Deep Wound for 5...20 seconds.', 'Spear Attack. Inflicts Deep Wound condition (5...20 seconds) if target foe has Cracked Armor.', 'Chest Thumper', 'Spear Attack. If this attack hits a foe with Cracked Armor, that foe suffers a Deep Wound for 5...20 seconds.', 'Spear Attack. Inflicts Deep Wound condition (5...20 seconds) if target foe has Cracked Armor.'),
