  (2094, 'Elemental Lord', 'Enchantment Spell. For 40...60 seconds, your elemental attributes are boosted by 1. Each time you cast a spell, you gain 1 Energy for every 10 ranks of Energy Storage and are healed for 100...300% of the spell''s Energy cost.', 'Enchantment Spell. (40...60 seconds.) Your elemental attributes are boosted by 1. Each time you cast a spell, you gain 1 Energy for every 10 ranks of Energy Storage and are healed for 100...300% of the spell''s Energy cost.', 'Elemental Lord', 'Enchantment Spell. For 40...60 seconds, your elemental attributes are boosted by 1. Each time you cast a spell, you gain 1 Energy for every 10 ranks of Energy Storage and are healed for 100...300% of the spell''s Energy cost.', 'Enchantment Spell. (40...60 seconds.) Your elemental attributes are boosted by 1. Each time you cast a spell, you gain 1 Energy for every 10 ranks of Energy Storage and are healed for 100...300% of the spell''s Energy cost.'),
  (2095, 'Selfless Spirit', 'Enchantment Spell. For 15...20 seconds, spells you cast that target another ally cost 3 less Energy.', 'Enchantment Spell. (15...20 seconds.) Spells you cast that target another ally cost 3 less Energy.', 'Selfless Spirit', 'Enchantment Spell. For 15...20 seconds, spells you cast that target another ally cost 3 less Energy.', 'Enchantment Spell. (15...20 seconds.) Spells you cast that target another ally cost 3 less Energy.'),
