  (2200, 'Signet of Mystic Speed', 'Signet. For 30 seconds, your next 1...3 self-targeting enchantments cast instantly. Flash enchantments do not consume uses of this skill.', 'Signet. (30 seconds.) Your next 1...3 self-targeted enchantments cast instantly. Flash enchantments do not consume uses of this skill.', 'Signet of Mystic Speed', 'Signet. For 30 seconds, your next 1...3 self-targeting enchantments cast instantly. Flash enchantments do not consume uses of this skill.', 'Signet. (30 seconds.) Your next 1...3 self-targeted enchantments cast instantly. Flash enchantments do not consume uses of this skill.'),
  (2201, 'Shield of Force', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. For 1...16 seconds, blocks the next 1 attacks against you. If an attack is blocked, all adjacent attacking foes are knocked down and suffer from Weakness for 5...20 seconds.', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. (1...16 seconds.) Blocks the next 1 attacks against you. Knocks down and inflicts Weakness (5...20 seconds) on all adjacent attacking foes.', 'Shield of Force', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. For 1...16 seconds, blocks the next 1 attacks against you. If an attack is blocked, all adjacent attacking foes are knocked down and suffer from Weakness for 5...20 seconds.', 'Flash Enchantment Spell. (1...16 seconds.) Blocks the next 1 attacks against you. Knocks down and inflicts Weakness (5...20 seconds) on all adjacent attacking foes.'),
  (2202, 'Mending Grip', 'Spell. Target ally is healed for 30...90 Health. If that ally is under the effects of a weapon spell, that ally loses one condition.', 'Spell. Heals for 30...90. Removes one condition if target ally is under a Weapon spell.', 'Mending Grip', 'Spell. Target ally is healed for 30...90 Health. If that ally is under the effects of a weapon spell, that ally loses one condition.', 'Spell. Heals for 30...90. Removes one condition if target ally is under a Weapon spell.'),
  (2203, 'Spiritleech Aura', 'Skill. For 5...20 seconds, all of your spirits within earshot deal 5...20 less damage and steal 5...20 Health when they attack.', 'Skill. (5...20 seconds.) All of your spirits within earshot deal 5...20 less damage and steal 5...20 Health when they attack.', 'Spiritleech Aura', 'Skill. For 5...20 seconds, all of your spirits within earshot deal 5...20 less damage and steal 5...20 Health when they attack.', 'Skill. (5...20 seconds.) All of your spirits within earshot deal 5...20 less damage and steal 5...20 Health when they attack.'),
  (2204, 'Rejuvenation', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...20 spirit. This spirit heals all party members within earshot for 3...10 Health each second. This spirit loses 3...10 Health for each party member healed in this way. This spirit dies after 30...90 seconds.', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...20 spirit (30...90 second lifespan). Heals party members in earshot for 3...10 each second. Healing cost: this spirit loses 3...10 Health.', 'Rejuvenation (PvP)', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...16 spirit. This spirit heals all party members within earshot for 3...10 Health each second. This spirit loses 3...10 Health for each party member healed in this way. This spirit dies after 30...90 seconds.', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...16 spirit (30...90 second lifespan). Heals party members in earshot for 3...10 each second. Healing cost: this spirit loses 3...10 Health.'),
  (2205, 'Agony', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...12 spirit. This spirit causes 3...10 Health loss each second to foes within earshot. This spirit loses 3...10 Health for each foe hurt in this way. This spirit dies after 30...90 seconds.', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...12 spirit (30...90 second lifespan). Causes 3...10 Health loss each second to foes in earshot. This spirit loses 3...10 Health for each foe that loses Health.', 'Agony (PvP)', 'Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...8 spirit. This spirit causes 3...10 Health loss each second to foes within earshot. This spirit loses 3...10 Health for each foe hurt in this way. This spirit dies after 30...90 seconds.', 'Binding Ritual. Creates a level 1...8 spirit (30...90 second lifespan). Causes 3...10 Health loss each second to foes in earshot. This spirit loses 3...10 Health for each foe that loses Health.'),
  (2206, 'Ghostly Weapon', 'Weapon Spell. For 5...20 seconds, target other ally''s next attack cannot be blocked.', 'Weapon Spell. (5...20 seconds.) Target ally''s next attack is unblockable. Cannot self-target.', 'Ghostly Weapon', 'Weapon Spell. For 5...20 seconds, target other ally''s next attack cannot be blocked.', 'Weapon Spell. (5...20 seconds.) Target ally''s next attack is unblockable. Cannot self-target.'),
  (2207, 'Inspirational Speech', 'Skill. You lose all adrenaline and target other ally gains 1...8 strikes of adrenaline.', 'Skill. Target ally gains 1...8 strikes of adrenaline. Cannot self-target. You lose all adrenaline.', 'Inspirational Speech', 'Skill. You lose all adrenaline and target other ally gains 1...8 strikes of adrenaline.', 'Skill. Target ally gains 1...8 strikes of adrenaline. Cannot self-target. You lose all adrenaline.'),
  (2208, 'Burning Shield', 'Skill. For 3...9 seconds, while wielding a shield, the next attack skill used against you is blocked. If it was a melee attack, your attacker is set on fire for 1...6 seconds.', 'Skill. (3...9 seconds.) Blocks the next attack skill against you. Inflicts Burning condition (1...6 seconds) if it was a melee attack. No effect unless you are wielding a shield.', 'Burning Shield', 'Skill. For 3...9 seconds, while wielding a shield, the next attack skill used against you is blocked. If it was a melee attack, your attacker is set on fire for 1...6 seconds.', 'Skill. (3...9 seconds.) Blocks the next attack skill against you. Inflicts Burning condition (1...6 seconds) if it was a melee attack. No effect unless you are wielding a shield.'),
  (2209, 'Holy Spear', 'Spear Attack. If this attack hits, you deal +5...20 damage. If it hits a summoned creature, all nearby foes take 15...90 holy damage, and are set on fire for 3 seconds.', 'Spear Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. Deals 15...90 holy damage and inflicts Burning condition (3 seconds) to nearby foes if you hit a summoned creature.', 'Holy Spear', 'Spear Attack. If this attack hits, you deal +5...20 damage. If it hits a summoned creature, all nearby foes take 15...90 holy damage, and are set on fire for 3 seconds.', 'Spear Attack. Deals +5...20 damage. Deals 15...90 holy damage and inflicts Burning condition (3 seconds) to nearby foes if you hit a summoned creature.'),
  (2210, 'Spear Swipe', 'Spear Attack. If this attack hits, you deal +5...20 damage and target foe is Dazed for 4...10 seconds. This attack has melee range.', 'Spear Melee Attack. Deals +5...20 damage and inflicts Dazed condition (4...10 seconds). This attack has melee range.', 'Spear Swipe', 'Spear Attack. If this attack hits, you deal +5...20 damage and target foe is Dazed for 4...10 seconds. This attack has melee range.', 'Spear Melee Attack. Deals +5...20 damage and inflicts Dazed condition (4...10 seconds). This attack has melee range.'),
  (2211, 'Alkar''s Alchemical Acid', 'Spell. Throw Alkar''s Alchemical Acid at target foe. Target and adjacent foes are struck for 40...50 damage. Destroyers take an additional 45...70 damage and they have Cracked Armor for 14...20 seconds.', 'Spell. Projectile: deals 40...50 damage to target and adjacent foes. Deals 45...70 more damage and inflicts Cracked Armor condition (14...20 seconds) to Destroyers.', 'Alkar''s Alchemical Acid', 'Spell. Throw Alkar''s Alchemical Acid at target foe. Target and adjacent foes are struck for 40...50 damage. Destroyers take an additional 45...70 damage and they have Cracked Armor for 14...20 seconds.', 'Spell. Projectile: deals 40...50 damage to target and adjacent foes. Deals 45...70 more damage and inflicts Cracked Armor condition (14...20 seconds) to Destroyers.'),
  (2212, 'Light of Deldrimor', 'Spell. All foes in the area are struck for 55...80 holy damage. The location of hidden objects are briefly indicated on your Compass. Any hidden objects in the area are revealed.', 'Spell. Deals 55...80 holy damage to foes in the area. Pings hidden objects within the area on the compass.', 'Light of Deldrimor', 'Spell. All foes in the area are struck for 55...80 holy damage. The location of hidden objects are briefly indicated on your Compass. Any hidden objects in the area are revealed.', 'Spell. Deals 55...80 holy damage to foes in the area. Pings hidden objects within the area on the compass.'),
  (2213, 'Ear Bite', 'Skill. Target touched foe takes 50...70 piercing damage and begins Bleeding for 15...25 seconds.', 'Touch Skill. Deals 50...70 piercing damage and Inflicts Bleeding condition (15...25 seconds).', 'Ear Bite', 'Skill. Target touched foe takes 50...70 piercing damage and begins Bleeding for 15...25 seconds.', 'Touch Skill. Deals 50...70 piercing damage and Inflicts Bleeding condition (15...25 seconds).'),
  (2214, 'Low Blow', 'Skill. Strike target foe for 45...70 damage. If target foe is knocked down, that foe takes an additional 30...50 damage and suffers from Cracked Armor for 14...20 seconds.', 'Touch Skill. Deals 45...70 damage. Deals 30...50 more damage and Inflicts Cracked Armor (14...20 seconds) if target foe is knocked-down.', 'Low Blow', 'Skill. Strike target foe for 45...70 damage. If target foe is knocked down, that foe takes an additional 30...50 damage and suffers from Cracked Armor for 14...20 seconds.', 'Touch Skill. Deals 45...70 damage. Deals 30...50 more damage and Inflicts Cracked Armor (14...20 seconds) if target foe is knocked-down.'),
  (2215, 'Brawling Headbutt', 'Skill. You headbutt target touched foe, dealing 45...70 damage and knocking down that foe if it hits.', 'Touch Skill. Deals 45...70 damage; causes knock-down.', 'Brawling Headbutt', 'Skill. You headbutt target touched foe, dealing 45...70 damage and knocking down that foe if it hits.', 'Touch Skill. Deals 45...70 damage; causes knock-down.'),
  (2216, '"Don''t Trip!"', 'Shout. For 3...5 seconds, party members within earshot cannot be knocked down.', 'Shout. (3...5 seconds.) Prevents knock-down; affects party members within earshot.', '"Don''t Trip!"', 'Shout. For 3...5 seconds, party members within earshot cannot be knocked down.', 'Shout. (3...5 seconds.) Prevents knock-down; affects party members within earshot.'),
  (2217, '"By Ural''s Hammer!"', 'Shout. For 30 seconds, all dead party members in earshot are resurrected with full Health and Energy. Resurrected party members deal 25...33% more damage. When this effect ends, affected party members die. This skill does not incur a death penalty.', 'Shout. (30 seconds.) Resurrect all dead party members in earshot with full Health and Energy. Affected party members deal 25...33% more damage. Affected party members die when it ends, but do not receive a death penalty.', '"By Ural''s Hammer!"', 'Shout. For 30 seconds, all dead party members in earshot are resurrected with full Health and Energy. Resurrected party members deal 25...33% more damage. When this effect ends, affected party members die. This skill does not incur a death penalty.', 'Shout. (30 seconds.) Resurrect all dead party members in earshot with full Health and Energy. Affected party members deal 25...33% more damage. Affected party members die when it ends, but do not receive a death penalty.'),
