  (2226, 'Summon Ice Imp', 'Spell. Summon a level 14...20 Ice Imp that lives for 40...60 seconds and has Ice Spikes. Only 1 Asura Summon can be active at a time.', 'Spell. Summons a level 14...20 Ice Imp that has Ice Spikes (40...60 second lifespan). Only 1 Asura Summon can be active at a time.', 'Summon Ice Imp', 'Spell. Summon a level 14...20 Ice Imp that lives for 40...60 seconds and has Ice Spikes. Only 1 Asura Summon can be active at a time.', 'Spell. Summons a level 14...20 Ice Imp that has Ice Spikes (40...60 second lifespan). Only 1 Asura Summon can be active at a time.'),
