  (2356, '"I Am Unstoppable!"', 'Shout. For 16...20 seconds, you have +24 armor and cannot be knocked down or Crippled.', 'Shout. (16...20 seconds.) You have +24 armor and cannot be knocked-down or Crippled.', '"I Am Unstoppable!"', 'Shout. For 16...20 seconds, you have +24 armor and cannot be knocked down or Crippled.', 'Shout. (16...20 seconds.) You have +24 armor and cannot be knocked-down or Crippled.'),
