  (3430, 'Vow of Revolution', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 3...10 seconds, you have +1...6 energy regeneration. This skill reapplies itself every time you use a non-Dervish skill. PvE Skill', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (3...10 seconds.) Gain +1...6 energy regeneration. Renewal: whenever you use a non-Dervish skill. PvE Skill', 'Vow of Revolution', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. For 3...10 seconds, you have +1...6 energy regeneration. This skill reapplies itself every time you use a non-Dervish skill. PvE Skill', 'Elite Enchantment Spell. (3...10 seconds.) Gain +1...6 energy regeneration. Renewal: whenever you use a non-Dervish skill. PvE Skill'),
